"Bandingkan jawaban konfirmasi dengan saldo yang tercatat dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_656_6ybcrjw
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed amounts to recorded balances and investigate any "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan jumlah yang dikonfirmasi dengan saldo yang tercatat dan selidiki perbedaan apa pun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_632_baazdmu
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed balances to recorded amounts in the financial statements "
"and investigate any discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo yang dikonfirmasi dengan jumlah yang tercatat dalam laporan keuangan dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_592_sh4e6cc
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed balances to recorded amounts in the financial statements, "
"and investigate any discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo yang dikonfirmasi dengan jumlah yang tercatat dalam laporan keuangan, dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_64_m3q71ev
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed balances with recorded balances and investigate any "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo yang dikonfirmasi dengan saldo yang tercatat dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_2_whkg6ib
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed balances with recorded cash balances and investigate any "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo yang dikonfirmasi dengan saldo kas yang tercatat dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1016_g9ef3xr
msgid ""
"Compare confirmed interest amounts to recorded amounts and investigate any "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan jumlah bunga yang dikonfirmasi dengan jumlah yang tercatat dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1009_6j6gz9f
msgid ""
"Compare current period interest income to prior periods, considering changes"
" in principal balances, interest rates, or significant new investments."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan pendapatan bunga periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya dengan mempertimbangkan perubahan saldo pokok, suku bunga, atau investasi baru yang signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_951_x4yxyqi
msgid ""
"Compare current period retained earnings with prior periods to identify "
"significant fluctuations and investigate the reasons for changes."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan laba ditahan periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya untuk mengidentifikasi fluktuasi signifikan dan selidiki penyebab perubahan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_987_1lduo6p
msgid ""
"Compare current period revenue with prior periods and industry trends to "
"identify any unusual fluctuations or variances."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan pendapatan periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya dan tren industri untuk mengidentifikasi fluktuasi atau penyimpangan yang tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_124_ugycjnr
msgid ""
"Compare current year inventory levels and valuation adjustments with prior "
"years to identify significant changes or unusual trends."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan tingkat persediaan dan penyesuaian penilaian tahun berjalan dengan tahun sebelumnya untuk mengidentifikasi perubahan signifikan atau tren yang tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_146_jrosex8
msgid ""
"Compare prepayment balances as a percentage of total assets or expenses to "
"industry benchmarks to identify potential misstatements."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo prabayar sebagai persentase terhadap total aset atau beban dengan tolok ukur industri untuk mengidentifikasi potensi salah saji."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_204_e0rtslm
msgid ""
"Compare the balance as a percentage of total assets or working capital with "
"industry benchmarks to identify any unusual trends or growth in receivables."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan saldo sebagai persentase terhadap total aset atau modal kerja dengan tolok ukur industri untuk mengidentifikasi tren atau pertumbuhan piutang yang tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_544_ztb0ifq
msgid ""
"Compare the current period’s disposal group liabilities with those from "
"prior periods to identify significant fluctuations."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan kewajiban kelompok lepasan periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya untuk mengidentifikasi fluktuasi signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_678_au6r6d2
msgid ""
"Compare these assumptions to industry benchmarks or external data to confirm"
" they are reasonable and consistent with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Bandingkan asumsi tersebut dengan tolok ukur industri atau data eksternal untuk memastikan kewajarannya dan kesesuaiannya dengan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_233_2sfo4t3
msgid "Compliance Testing for Covenants (if applicable)"
msgstr "Pengujian Kepatuhan terhadap Kovenan (jika berlaku)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_385_bsh8b3e
msgid "Compliance Testing of Covenants, If Applicable"
msgstr "Pengujian Kepatuhan Kovenan, jika berlaku"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__conclusion_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__conclusion_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__conclusion_id
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "Kesimpulan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__conclusion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__conclusion
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__conclusion
msgid "Conclusion Additional Explanation"
msgstr "Penjelasan Tambahan Kesimpulan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__allowed_conclusion_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__allowed_conclusion_ids
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__allowed_conclusion_ids
msgid "Conclusions allowed for the selected worksheet type."
msgstr "Kesimpulan yang diizinkan untuk tipe lembar kerja yang dipilih."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_112_5g8vm04
msgid ""
"Conduct test counts on a sample of inventory items and compare with the "
"entity’s records for accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan penghitungan uji atas sampel item persediaan dan bandingkan dengan catatan entitas untuk memastikan keakuratan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_340_cgd81vp
msgid "Confirm Accuracy of Actuarial Calculations"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Keakuratan Perhitungan Aktuaria"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_268_k0i8v3f
msgid "Confirm Completeness of Disposal Group Liabilities"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Kelengkapan Kewajiban Kelompok Lepasan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_500_begxng6
msgid "Confirm Interest Income with Banks and Investment Institutions"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Pendapatan Bunga dengan Bank dan Lembaga Investasi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_520_d1x1dsd
msgid "Confirm Ownership Percentage and Profit Sharing Agreement"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Persentase Kepemilikan dan Perjanjian Pembagian Laba"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_273_apzh37l
msgid "Confirm Presentation and Disclosure of Disposal Group Liabilities"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Penyajian dan Pengungkapan Kewajiban Kelompok Lepasan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_491_bebqo11
msgid "Confirm Revenue with Major Customers (Confirmation Testing)"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Pendapatan dengan Pelanggan Utama (Pengujian Konfirmasi)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_515_pqb8uin
msgid "Confirm Significant Revenue Transactions with Customers"
msgstr "Konfirmasi Transaksi Pendapatan Signifikan dengan Pelanggan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_936_a6bqbh9
msgid ""
"Confirm compliance with accounting standards for the disclosure of "
"appropriated retained earnings, ensuring transparency regarding the reasons "
"and conditions for each appropriation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi untuk pengungkapan laba ditahan yang dialokasikan, memastikan transparansi atas alasan dan kondisi setiap apropriasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_958_roobk3t
msgid ""
"Confirm compliance with accounting standards for the disclosure of retained "
"earnings, ensuring clarity and transparency for users of the financial "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi untuk pengungkapan laba ditahan, memastikan kejelasan dan transparansi bagi pengguna laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_134_6qpymgp
msgid ""
"Confirm disclosures regarding any significant inventory write-downs, "
"valuation methods, and commitments or consigned inventory."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi pengungkapan mengenai penurunan nilai persediaan yang signifikan, metode penilaian, serta komitmen atau persediaan konsinyasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__confirm_ok
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__confirm_ok
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__confirm_ok
msgid ""
"Confirm policy\n"
"\n"
"* If active user can see and execute 'Confirm' button"
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan konfirmasi\n"
"\n"
"* Jika pengguna aktif dapat melihat dan mengeksekusi tombol 'Konfirmasi'"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_817_dlbyxmk
msgid ""
"Confirm that APIC is classified accurately as a component of equity in the "
"financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa APIC diklasifikasikan secara akurat sebagai komponen ekuitas dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_294_1onyana
msgid ""
"Confirm that CIP balances are transferred to the appropriate asset category "
"upon completion and that depreciation begins in accordance with policy."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saldo CIP dipindahkan ke kategori aset yang sesuai setelah selesai dan depresiasi dimulai sesuai kebijakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_981_m3i3ht2
msgid ""
"Confirm that NCI balances and transactions comply with relevant accounting "
"standards, including IFRS 10 or other applicable frameworks, and accurately "
"reflect the NCI holders’ share in the consolidated equity."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saldo dan transaksi NCI mematuhi standar akuntansi yang relevan (termasuk IFRS 10 atau kerangka lain yang berlaku) dan secara akurat mencerminkan bagian pemegang NCI dalam ekuitas konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_887_j3c4p63
msgid ""
"Confirm that NCI transactions are accounted for following relevant "
"accounting standards (e.g., IFRS, GAAP), particularly regarding the "
"treatment of changes in ownership interests and equity adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi NCI dicatat sesuai standar akuntansi yang relevan (mis. IFRS, GAAP), khususnya terkait perlakuan perubahan kepemilikan dan penyesuaian ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1270_cyf391t
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1286_mwvxb9r
msgid ""
"Confirm that OCI-related entries are not recorded in periods that do not "
"pertain to the reporting period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa entri terkait OCI tidak dicatat pada periode yang tidak termasuk dalam periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_321_j8ijp2z
msgid ""
"Confirm that ROU assets are presented appropriately in the balance sheet as "
"non-current assets, separate from owned fixed assets."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset ROU disajikan dengan tepat di neraca sebagai aset tidak lancar, terpisah dari aset tetap milik sendiri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_406_1kx8k7b
msgid ""
"Confirm that accounts payable is appropriately classified as a current "
"liability in the balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa utang usaha diklasifikasikan secara tepat sebagai liabilitas lancar di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_426_qzj0gg6
msgid ""
"Confirm that accruals and other payables are presented correctly in the "
"balance sheet, typically as current liabilities unless otherwise classified."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa akrual dan utang lainnya disajikan dengan benar di neraca, biasanya sebagai liabilitas lancar kecuali diklasifikasikan berbeda."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_574_55bb5eo
msgid ""
"Confirm that accruals are consistent with historical trends or expected "
"costs and are accurately recorded as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa akrual konsisten dengan tren historis atau biaya yang diharapkan dan dicatat secara akurat pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_554_k39b3v3
msgid ""
"Confirm that accruals for interest, employee expenses, or other items are "
"calculated accurately and in line with the company’s policies."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa akrual untuk bunga, beban karyawan, atau item lain dihitung secara akurat dan sesuai kebijakan perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_636_onovkfk
msgid ""
"Confirm that accrued interest is properly recorded as of the reporting date,"
" especially for borrowings with interest due shortly after period-end."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa bunga akrual dicatat dengan benar pada tanggal pelaporan, terutama untuk pinjaman dengan jatuh tempo bunga segera setelah akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_371_jpk65kc
msgid ""
"Confirm that additions are recorded at the correct acquisition cost, "
"appropriately classified, and consistent with the entity’s accounting "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penambahan dicatat pada biaya perolehan yang benar, diklasifikasikan tepat, dan konsisten dengan kebijakan akuntansi entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_944_tuj5ag2
msgid ""
"Confirm that adjustments are appropriately classified, accurately recorded, "
"and disclosed as either prior period adjustments or current period "
"transactions, as applicable."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian diklasifikasikan tepat, dicatat akurat, dan diungkap sebagai penyesuaian periode sebelumnya atau transaksi periode berjalan sesuai relevansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_310_szbw0sm
msgid ""
"Confirm that adjustments are based on updated lease terms, discount rates, "
"or payment changes, and that modifications are correctly recorded."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian didasarkan pada perubahan ketentuan sewa, tingkat diskonto, atau perubahan pembayaran yang mutakhir dan modifikasi dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1120_xuvdthw
msgid ""
"Confirm that adjustments are supported by appropriate documentation and "
"reflect legitimate changes to payroll expenses."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian didukung dokumentasi yang memadai dan mencerminkan perubahan yang sah pada beban penggajian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1070_9xss9sf
msgid ""
"Confirm that all entries are supported by appropriate documentation and "
"reflect accurate adjustments to the entity’s investment or share of profit "
"or loss."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa semua entri didukung dokumentasi yang sesuai dan mencerminkan penyesuaian akurat terhadap investasi entitas atau bagian laba/rugi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_695_wp3e53e
msgid ""
"Confirm that all required disclosures related to post-employment benefit "
"obligations are complete and comply with accounting standards, such as:"
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa semua pengungkapan yang diwajibkan terkait kewajiban imbalan pasca kerja lengkap dan sesuai standar akuntansi, seperti:"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_154_zy2taaj
msgid ""
"Confirm that all significant prepayments are appropriately disclosed in the "
"financial statements according to accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa seluruh prabayar signifikan diungkap dengan tepat dalam laporan keuangan sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_176_54sxph9
msgid ""
"Confirm that amounts recorded are accurate and match supporting "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa jumlah yang dicatat akurat dan sesuai dengan dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_194_8k59t2k
msgid ""
"Confirm that amounts recorded as non-trade receivables agree with supporting"
" documentation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa jumlah yang dicatat sebagai piutang non-usaha sesuai dengan dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_377_4hy5d2h
msgid ""
"Confirm that an allowance for doubtful accounts is recorded if needed, and "
"test for accuracy by recalculating for a sample of receivables."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyisihan piutang ragu-ragu dicatat bila diperlukan, dan uji keakuratan dengan menghitung ulang sampel piutang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_160_cvasu2c
msgid ""
"Confirm that any adjustments from prior tax periods are recorded accurately "
"and reflect any additional tax due or refunds applied."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian dari periode pajak sebelumnya dicatat akurat dan mencerminkan pajak tambahan terutang atau restitusi yang diterapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1088_s9ua57g
msgid ""
"Confirm that any changes are appropriately documented and disclosed in the "
"financial statements, if material."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap perubahan didokumentasikan dan diungkap dengan tepat dalam laporan keuangan jika material."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_934_p85jjrp
msgid ""
"Confirm that any changes in appropriations, such as releases or "
"reclassifications, are authorized and recorded accurately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perubahan apropriasi seperti pelepasan atau reklasifikasi telah diotorisasi dan dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_52_hwek7mp
msgid ""
"Confirm that any changes in estimates or significant changes in project "
"scope are documented, approved, and appropriately reflected in contract "
"asset balances."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perubahan estimasi atau perubahan signifikan dalam lingkup proyek didokumentasikan, disetujui, dan tercermin dengan tepat dalam saldo aset kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1156_zv472a8
msgid ""
"Confirm that any changes in useful lives or residual values are supported by"
" management documentation and approved."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perubahan umur manfaat atau nilai residu didukung dokumentasi manajemen dan disetujui."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1176_iwr3tet
msgid ""
"Confirm that any changes to interest rates or terms are documented and "
"authorized appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perubahan suku bunga atau ketentuan telah didokumentasikan dan diotorisasi dengan semestinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1086_ku71bu1
msgid ""
"Confirm that any costs related to goods or services provided after the year-"
"end are not included in the current period’s cost of revenues."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa biaya terkait barang atau jasa yang diserahkan setelah akhir tahun tidak termasuk dalam biaya pendapatan periode berjalan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_467_pz9bg9k
msgid ""
"Confirm that any covenant breaches are appropriately disclosed in the "
"financial statements if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap pelanggaran kovenan diungkap dengan tepat dalam laporan keuangan jika berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_331_algyrs5
msgid ""
"Confirm that any impairment losses are calculated accurately and recorded "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kerugian penurunan nilai dihitung akurat dan dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_543_hkgbkij
msgid ""
"Confirm that any material estimates are reasonable and consistent with "
"available information and management’s expectations."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa estimasi material wajar dan konsisten dengan informasi yang tersedia serta ekspektasi manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_729_k0bpv8e
msgid ""
"Confirm that any material subsequent events are evaluated for potential "
"adjustment to DTL balances or additional disclosure requirements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan yang material dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian saldo DTL atau kebutuhan pengungkapan tambahan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1052_ucxc7gj
msgid ""
"Confirm that any material subsequent events are properly evaluated for "
"adjustment or disclosure if they impact revenue for the reporting period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan yang material dievaluasi dengan tepat untuk penyesuaian atau pengungkapan bila berdampak pada pendapatan periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_930_ugd5n1e
msgid ""
"Confirm that any reallocations or releases of appropriated retained earnings"
" are appropriately adjusted in the correct reporting period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap realokasi atau pelepasan laba ditahan yang dialokasikan disesuaikan secara tepat pada periode pelaporan yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_483_7fki57k
msgid ""
"Confirm that any resolved obligations are appropriately adjusted or removed "
"in the financial records."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kewajiban yang telah terselesaikan disesuaikan atau dihapus dengan tepat dalam catatan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_948_o20s96s
msgid ""
"Confirm that any restricted portion of retained earnings is classified "
"separately from unappropriated retained earnings if required by local "
"regulations or industry guidelines."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa bagian laba ditahan yang dibatasi diklasifikasikan terpisah dari laba ditahan tidak dialokasikan jika diwajibkan oleh regulasi lokal atau pedoman industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_298_a4aw0oh
msgid ""
"Confirm that any revaluation gains or losses are recorded accurately and in "
"compliance with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa keuntungan atau kerugian revaluasi dicatat akurat dan sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1212_b9364z4
msgid ""
"Confirm that any significant transactions related to discontinued operations"
" are documented."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi signifikan terkait operasi yang dihentikan didokumentasikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_984_5u5vik5
msgid ""
"Confirm that any subsequent events impacting NCI are appropriately disclosed"
" or considered for adjustment if material to the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan yang berdampak pada NCI diungkap dengan tepat atau dipertimbangkan untuk penyesuaian jika material bagi laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_960_9xxjp4u
msgid ""
"Confirm that any subsequent events impacting retained earnings are disclosed"
" appropriately and that management has considered the need for adjustments "
"or disclosures."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan yang berdampak pada laba ditahan diungkap secara tepat dan manajemen telah mempertimbangkan kebutuhan penyesuaian atau pengungkapan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_249_lce1zo6
msgid ""
"Confirm that any transactions between the entity and the joint venture are "
"properly authorized, documented, and disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi antara entitas dan ventura bersama telah diotorisasi, didokumentasikan, dan diungkap dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1154_5ftt35b
msgid ""
"Confirm that assets are added to or removed from the depreciation or "
"amortization schedule and that no expense is recognized for disposed assets "
"after their disposal date."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset ditambahkan atau dihapus dari jadwal depresiasi/amortisasi dan tidak ada beban yang diakui atas aset yang telah dilepas setelah tanggal pelepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_607_14h8gwl
msgid ""
"Confirm that bank borrowings are classified as current or non-current "
"liabilities based on repayment terms."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pinjaman bank diklasifikasikan sebagai liabilitas lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan ketentuan pembayaran kembali."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_464_7d5yxhj
msgid ""
"Confirm that bank overdrafts are appropriately classified as current "
"liabilities on the balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa cerukan bank diklasifikasikan dengan tepat sebagai liabilitas lancar di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1110_6z367kv
msgid ""
"Confirm that benefits are appropriately recorded in the period incurred and "
"reflect accurate coverage and benefit levels."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa manfaat dicatat pada periode terjadinya dan mencerminkan cakupan serta tingkat manfaat yang akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_647_6wx9dvw
msgid ""
"Confirm that borrowings are classified correctly as current or non-current "
"based on their repayment schedules and due dates."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pinjaman diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan jadwal dan tanggal jatuh tempo."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_513_l63ku0y
msgid ""
"Confirm that calculations are accurate, taking into account any tax credits,"
" deductions, or allowances that apply."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perhitungan akurat dengan mempertimbangkan kredit pajak, pengurang, atau insentif yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_132_vqiuz23
msgid ""
"Confirm that committed purchase prices are considered in inventory valuation"
" assessments."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa harga pembelian yang telah dikomitmen dipertimbangkan dalam penilaian persediaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_446_qx0t97x
msgid ""
"Confirm that contract liabilities are appropriately classified as current or"
" non-current liabilities in the balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kewajiban kontrak diklasifikasikan dengan tepat sebagai liabilitas lancar atau tidak lancar di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_671_a4rjv3w
msgid ""
"Confirm that convertible bonds are classified accurately as current or non-"
"current based on repayment and conversion terms."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa obligasi konversi diklasifikasikan secara akurat sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan ketentuan pelunasan dan konversi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_521_dj6sakf
msgid ""
"Confirm that current tax expense aligns with the recorded liability, and "
"verify that any payments made during the year have been properly recorded "
"and reduced from the taxes payable balance."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa beban pajak kini selaras dengan liabilitas yang dicatat, dan verifikasi bahwa pembayaran sepanjang tahun telah dicatat dengan benar serta mengurangi saldo utang pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_277_0g6g0e5
msgid ""
"Confirm that deferred tax assets are classified correctly on the balance "
"sheet as non-current assets."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset pajak tangguhan diklasifikasikan dengan benar di neraca sebagai aset tidak lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1165_546lwgl
msgid ""
"Confirm that depreciation for different categories of assets (e.g., "
"equipment, vehicles, buildings) is recorded in the correct account."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa depresiasi untuk berbagai kategori aset (mis. peralatan, kendaraan, bangunan) dicatat pada akun yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_109_qqxai5n
msgid ""
"Confirm that derivative financial instruments are classified and presented "
"correctly on the balance sheet (e.g., asset or liability) and by fair value "
"hierarchy level."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa instrumen keuangan derivatif diklasifikasikan dan disajikan dengan benar di neraca (mis. sebagai aset atau liabilitas) serta sesuai tingkat hirarki nilai wajar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1144_65q4ncc
msgid ""
"Confirm that disbursements are consistent with authorized payments and match"
" corresponding entries in the general ledger."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengeluaran konsisten dengan pembayaran yang diotorisasi dan cocok dengan entri terkait di buku besar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1004_gwwl1fb
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures are complete and comply with applicable accounting "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan lengkap dan sesuai dengan standar akuntansi yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_232_9vpmu12
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures are made in accordance with accounting standards, "
"including information on ownership percentage, dividends, significant "
"transactions, and any impairment losses."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan dilakukan sesuai standar akuntansi termasuk informasi persentase kepemilikan, dividen, transaksi signifikan, dan kerugian penurunan nilai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_978_zrtynfl
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures comply with accounting standards (e.g., IFRS or "
"GAAP), providing transparency on the composition and impact of NCI on "
"consolidated equity."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan mematuhi standar akuntansi (mis. IFRS atau GAAP) dan memberikan transparansi atas komposisi serta dampak NCI pada ekuitas konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1072_aaqetkm
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures comply with accounting standards and adequately "
"represent the nature, financial effects, and risks associated with these "
"investments."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan mematuhi standar akuntansi dan secara memadai merepresentasikan sifat, dampak keuangan, serta risiko terkait investasi tersebut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_771_bn55h7k
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures in the financial statements meet the requirements "
"of relevant accounting standards (e.g., IFRS, GAAP), covering aspects like:"
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan memenuhi persyaratan standar akuntansi yang relevan (mis. IFRS, GAAP), mencakup aspek seperti:"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1026_kw73vqi
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures meet applicable accounting standards and provide "
"transparency regarding interest income sources and risk exposure."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan memenuhi standar akuntansi yang berlaku dan memberikan transparansi mengenai sumber pendapatan bunga serta eksposur risiko."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_754_xzjpsvc
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures provide a clear understanding of the loan's "
"ranking, repayment priority, and financial impact."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan memberikan pemahaman jelas atas peringkat pinjaman, prioritas pelunasan, dan dampak keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1147_wdg4x21
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures related to G&A expenses are complete, including any"
" significant non-recurring items or changes in expense structure."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait beban umum & administrasi lengkap, termasuk item non-berulang signifikan atau perubahan struktur beban."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1095_7a4a9ji
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures related to cost of revenues are complete and in "
"accordance with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait biaya pendapatan lengkap dan sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1121_kcbdhwi
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures related to human resources expense are complete, "
"including information on key personnel compensation and benefits if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait beban SDM lengkap, termasuk informasi kompensasi dan manfaat personel kunci jika berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1049_ig14adc
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures related to other revenue types are complete and in "
"accordance with accounting standards, especially if they represent "
"significant revenue sources."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait jenis pendapatan lain lengkap dan sesuai standar akuntansi, terutama bila merupakan sumber pendapatan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_547_z37d3nh
msgid ""
"Confirm that disclosures related to the disposal group include all relevant "
"details, such as major classes of liabilities, expected timing of disposal, "
"and any associated risks."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait kelompok lepasan mencakup semua detail relevan seperti klasifikasi utama kewajiban, waktu pelepasan yang diharapkan, dan risiko terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_996_unvwmg7
msgid ""
"Confirm that discounts, allowances, and returns are accurately recorded and "
"do not overstate net revenue."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa diskon, potongan, dan retur dicatat akurat dan tidak menyebabkan pendapatan bersih menjadi berlebihan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_284_ztb0ifq
msgid ""
"Confirm that disposed assets are removed from the fixed asset register, and "
"any resulting gain or loss on disposal is accurately calculated and "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset yang dilepas dihapus dari register aset tetap dan laba atau rugi pelepasan dihitung serta dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1036_c5pqjvp
msgid ""
"Confirm that dividend income has been recognized in the correct period and "
"that any restrictions or conditions affecting dividend receipt are "
"disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan dividen diakui pada periode yang benar dan setiap pembatasan atau kondisi yang mempengaruhi penerimaan dividen diungkap."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1196_ewhx31n
msgid ""
"Confirm that documentation reflects the nature and purpose of the expenses "
"incurred."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa dokumentasi mencerminkan sifat dan tujuan beban yang terjadi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_421_bk961bm
msgid ""
"Confirm that each accrual reversal has valid support and does not affect "
"current period results inappropriately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap pembalikan akrual memiliki dukungan yang sah dan tidak mempengaruhi hasil periode berjalan secara tidak semestinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_347_plh3w8e
msgid ""
"Confirm that each acquisition is recorded at cost (initially) or fair value "
"and classified correctly as investment property."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap perolehan dicatat pada biaya (awal) atau nilai wajar dan diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai properti investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_326_i4g8hzx
msgid ""
"Confirm that each addition is recorded at the correct acquisition cost, is "
"properly classified, and has been authorized per company policy."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap penambahan dicatat pada biaya perolehan yang benar, diklasifikasikan tepat, dan telah diotorisasi sesuai kebijakan perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_471_fnlv6un
msgid ""
"Confirm that each provision has a valid and supportable basis, in accordance"
" with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa setiap provisi memiliki dasar yang sah dan dapat didukung, sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1117_12la8a7
msgid ""
"Confirm that employee records used for payroll processing are complete and "
"accurate by comparing the payroll register with HR records."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa data karyawan untuk pemrosesan penggajian lengkap dan akurat dengan membandingkan register penggajian dengan catatan SDM."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1162_mjzizc9
msgid ""
"Confirm that entries are backed by supporting documentation and reflect "
"legitimate adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa entri didukung dokumentasi pendukung dan mencerminkan penyesuaian yang sah."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1198_4iuhjmg
msgid ""
"Confirm that expenses incurred after the period-end are not included in the "
"current period's other expenses."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa beban yang terjadi setelah akhir periode tidak dimasukkan dalam beban lain periode berjalan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_906_w0fgrgk
msgid ""
"Confirm that fair value adjustments are based on reliable market data or "
"valuations, and that any gains or losses are recorded in OCI until the "
"assets are disposed of."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian nilai wajar didasarkan pada data pasar atau penilaian yang andal, dan setiap laba/rugi dicatat dalam OCI sampai aset dilepas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_85_m3yk6k1
msgid ""
"Confirm that financial assets are properly classified, disclosed, and "
"presented in the financial statements per applicable standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset keuangan diklasifikasikan, diungkap, dan disajikan dengan benar sesuai standar yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_385_2h2xgky
msgid ""
"Confirm that gains or losses from disposal are accurately calculated and "
"recorded, and that the asset register is updated accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa laba atau rugi pelepasan dihitung dan dicatat akurat serta register aset diperbarui sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_355_8r4mo5j
msgid ""
"Confirm that gains or losses on disposal are accurately calculated and "
"recorded, and that the disposed properties are removed from the property "
"register."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa laba/rugi pelepasan dihitung dan dicatat akurat serta properti yang dilepas dihapus dari register properti."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1164_29tcr12
msgid ""
"Confirm that impairment adjustments are documented, approved by management, "
"and calculated in line with applicable standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian penurunan nilai didokumentasikan, disetujui manajemen, dan dihitung sesuai standar yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_72_0mzubhf
msgid ""
"Confirm that impairment losses are recognized timely and in accordance with "
"applicable standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kerugian penurunan nilai diakui tepat waktu dan sesuai standar yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_84_4vmgqba
msgid ""
"Confirm that income on financial assets is accurately calculated, recorded "
"in the correct period, and adequately disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan atas aset keuangan dihitung akurat, dicatat pada periode yang benar, dan diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_342_84rntxm
msgid ""
"Confirm that intangible assets are classified appropriately in the balance "
"sheet as non-current assets and that goodwill is separately disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset tak berwujud diklasifikasikan dengan tepat di neraca sebagai aset tidak lancar dan goodwill diungkap terpisah."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1012_x4m7biv
msgid ""
"Confirm that interest income has been calculated accurately and recorded "
"correctly in the appropriate period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan bunga telah dihitung akurat dan dicatat pada periode yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1180_wjyiek0
msgid ""
"Confirm that interest incurred after period-end is not recorded in the "
"current period's interest expense."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa bunga yang timbul setelah akhir periode tidak dicatat dalam beban bunga periode berjalan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1084_i8lss2a
msgid ""
"Confirm that inventory adjustments, write-offs, or impairments are supported"
" by appropriate documentation and authorized by management."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyesuaian, penghapusan, atau penurunan nilai persediaan didukung dokumentasi yang memadai dan diotorisasi manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_122_lmob4vu
msgid ""
"Confirm that inventory is written down to net realizable value when it "
"exceeds cost, in compliance with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa persediaan diturunkan ke nilai realisasi bersih ketika melebihi biaya sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_366_qvcxovo
msgid ""
"Confirm that investment properties are classified appropriately in the "
"balance sheet, separate from property used in operations."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa properti investasi diklasifikasikan dengan tepat di neraca, terpisah dari properti yang digunakan dalam operasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_860_ccckf9s
msgid ""
"Confirm that it is excluded from the calculation of outstanding shares until"
" actual conversion occurs."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa instrumen tersebut dikecualikan dari perhitungan saham beredar sampai konversi aktual terjadi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1092_mha6plo
msgid ""
"Confirm that journal entries are supported by appropriate documentation and "
"reflect legitimate adjustments to the cost of revenues."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa jurnal didukung dokumentasi memadai dan mencerminkan penyesuaian yang sah terhadap biaya pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1184_tg11hpi
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1202_o97b86p
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1220_ual0fv5
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1238_citjocf
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1256_32egkg2
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1274_hxxmx1x
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1290_bdojfuo
msgid ""
"Confirm that journal entries are supported by appropriate documentation and "
"reflect legitimate adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa jurnal didukung dokumentasi yang memadai dan mencerminkan penyesuaian yang sah."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1080_kd870sc
msgid ""
"Confirm that labor costs relate to revenue-generating activities and are "
"recorded in the correct period based on hours worked or tasks completed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa biaya tenaga kerja terkait aktivitas penghasil pendapatan dan dicatat pada periode yang benar berdasarkan jam kerja atau tugas yang selesai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_623_adn98o1
msgid ""
"Confirm that lease liabilities are correctly classified as current or non-"
"current based on repayment terms."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa liabilitas sewa diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan ketentuan pembayaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_541_jxclj1b
msgid ""
"Confirm that liabilities no longer part of the disposal group are "
"reclassified appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kewajiban yang tidak lagi menjadi bagian kelompok lepasan direklasifikasi secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_767_to8tqcj
msgid ""
"Confirm that long-term liabilities are appropriately classified on the "
"balance sheet (e.g., non-current) based on repayment terms or contractual "
"agreements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa liabilitas jangka panjang diklasifikasikan dengan tepat di "
"neraca (mis. tidak lancar) berdasarkan ketentuan pelunasan atau perjanjian "
"kontraktual."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1002_rngrkpb
msgid ""
"Confirm that management correctly applies the standard, including "
"identification of performance obligations, allocation of transaction prices,"
" and revenue recognition timing."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa manajemen menerapkan standar secara benar, termasuk "
"identifikasi kewajiban pelaksanaan, alokasi harga transaksi, dan penentuan "
"waktu pengakuan pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_106_kqvouox
msgid ""
"Confirm that management has assessed the need for bifurcation and that "
"embedded derivatives are measured appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa manajemen telah menilai kebutuhan pemisahan (bifurcation) "
"dan derivatif tertanam diukur secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_739_kh3b2kk
msgid ""
"Confirm that management has considered and adhered to the terms of "
"subordination in all loan transactions during the period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa manajemen telah mempertimbangkan dan mematuhi ketentuan "
"subordinasi pada semua transaksi pinjaman selama periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_473_ywl4dsq
msgid ""
"Confirm that management’s assumptions (e.g., future cash outflows, "
"settlement dates) are reasonable and consistent with past experience or "
"industry standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa asumsi manajemen (mis. arus kas keluar masa depan, tanggal "
"penyelesaian) wajar dan konsisten dengan pengalaman sebelumnya atau standar "
"industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_531_rcgvj1t
msgid ""
"Confirm that management’s intent and plans for disposal align with the "
"classification."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa niat dan rencana manajemen untuk pelepasan selaras dengan "
"klasifikasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_727_v7u4761
msgid ""
"Confirm that netting is consistent with reporting requirements and "
"management’s assessment of recoverability."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saling-hapus (netting) konsisten dengan persyaratan "
"pelaporan dan penilaian manajemen atas keterpulihan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_587_w8xtgfj
msgid ""
"Confirm that non-trade payables are correctly classified as current or non-"
"current based on their due dates."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa utang non‑usaha diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai "
"lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan tanggal jatuh temponya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_567_zqgf101
msgid ""
"Confirm that other current liabilities are correctly classified as current "
"liabilities on the balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kewajiban lancar lainnya diklasifikasikan dengan benar "
"sebagai liabilitas lancar di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_386_i6jojza
msgid ""
"Confirm that other non-current assets are presented in the balance sheet as "
"non-current assets, with sub-categorization if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset tidak lancar lainnya disajikan di neraca sebagai aset "
"tidak lancar, dengan sub‑kategori jika berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_459_imar1oi
msgid ""
"Confirm that outstanding checks and deposits in transit are accurately "
"reflected, and any overdraft balances are appropriately classified."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa cek beredar dan setoran dalam perjalanan tercermin secara "
"akurat, serta setiap saldo cerukan diklasifikasikan dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_486_y9al52n
msgid ""
"Confirm that provisions are correctly classified as current or non-current "
"based on the expected timing of settlement."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa provisi diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai lancar atau "
"tidak lancar berdasarkan waktu penyelesaian yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1296_e26max8
msgid ""
"Confirm that reclassifications are supported by documentation and compliant "
"with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa reklasifikasi didukung dokumentasi dan mematuhi standar "
"akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1019_fyiuekl
msgid ""
"Confirm that recorded interest income aligns with applicable interest rates "
"in contracts and agreements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan bunga yang dicatat selaras dengan suku bunga "
"yang berlaku dalam kontrak dan perjanjian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_168_vlkk540
msgid ""
"Confirm that refundable portions are accurately classified and determine if "
"the recoverability of the prepaid balance is impaired due to a change in "
"future taxable income."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa bagian yang dapat direstitusi diklasifikasikan secara "
"akurat dan tentukan apakah keterpulihan saldo prabayar terpengaruh (impaired)"
" akibat perubahan penghasilan kena pajak masa depan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_58_pz05c9r
msgid ""
"Confirm that related party contracts are recognized and measured "
"consistently with third-party contracts."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kontrak pihak berelasi diakui dan diukur secara konsisten "
"dengan kontrak pihak ketiga."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_582_upizunz
msgid ""
"Confirm that related-party payables are disclosed in the financial "
"statements in accordance with disclosure requirements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa utang pihak berelasi diungkap dalam laporan keuangan sesuai "
"persyaratan pengungkapan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1130_u2v31i3
msgid ""
"Confirm that rent and utility expenses are consistent with contract terms, "
"accurately recorded, and properly classified."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa beban sewa dan utilitas konsisten dengan ketentuan kontrak, "
"dicatat akurat, dan diklasifikasikan dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_353_rsbocm5
msgid ""
"Confirm that rental income is recorded in accordance with lease terms and "
"properly classified as revenue from investment property."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan sewa dicatat sesuai ketentuan sewa dan "
"diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai pendapatan dari properti investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_18_jn3apfr
msgid ""
"Confirm that restrictions are properly disclosed in the financial "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pembatasan diungkap dengan benar dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_992_nub6m5g
msgid ""
"Confirm that revenue recognition aligns with the terms of the contract, "
"delivery of goods, or completion of services."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengakuan pendapatan selaras dengan ketentuan kontrak, "
"penyerahan barang, atau penyelesaian jasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1034_bfepswl
msgid ""
"Confirm that revenue recognition complies with accounting standards, such as"
" recognition over the period of service or based on usage (for royalties)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengakuan pendapatan mematuhi standar akuntansi, seperti "
"pengakuan sepanjang periode jasa atau berdasarkan penggunaan (untuk royalti)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_994_ybiactt
msgid ""
"Confirm that sales to these customers are legitimate, appropriately "
"recorded, and reflect the terms of the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penjualan kepada pelanggan tersebut sah, dicatat dengan "
"semestinya, dan mencerminkan ketentuan perjanjian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1132_3mkc4yr
msgid ""
"Confirm that services are consistent with business needs and appropriately "
"classified as G&A expenses."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa layanan konsisten dengan kebutuhan bisnis dan "
"diklasifikasikan tepat sebagai beban Umum & Administrasi (G&A)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_834_z84s78k
msgid ""
"Confirm that share repurchases align with board approvals and verify the "
"repurchase price, number of shares, and repurchase date."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pembelian kembali saham selaras dengan persetujuan dewan "
"dan verifikasi harga buyback, jumlah saham, dan tanggal buyback."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_787_s2byysl
msgid ""
"Confirm that share transactions are in line with board approvals and that "
"the terms of issuance (e.g., share price, number of shares) are correctly "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi saham sejalan dengan persetujuan dewan dan "
"ketentuan penerbitan (mis. harga saham, jumlah saham) dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_506_bxpahg9
msgid ""
"Confirm that short-term employee benefit liabilities are correctly "
"classified as current liabilities on the balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kewajiban imbalan kerja jangka pendek diklasifikasikan "
"dengan benar sebagai liabilitas lancar di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_674_y7sj2sa
msgid ""
"Confirm that subsequent events are evaluated and that any impact on the "
"financial statements is accurately disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan dievaluasi dan setiap "
"dampaknya terhadap laporan keuangan diungkap secara akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_701_5c8gs47
msgid ""
"Confirm that subsequent events are evaluated for potential adjustments to "
"the obligation balance or additional disclosures."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan dievaluasi untuk potensi "
"penyesuaian saldo kewajiban atau pengungkapan tambahan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1028_4a5h200
msgid ""
"Confirm that subsequent events are properly evaluated for adjustment or "
"disclosure if they materially affect interest income for the reporting "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan dievaluasi dengan tepat "
"untuk penyesuaian atau pengungkapan bila secara material mempengaruhi "
"pendapatan bunga periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_38_n1vay96
msgid ""
"Confirm that such accounts are properly valued, classified, and disclosed in"
" the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa akun tersebut dinilai, diklasifikasikan, dan diungkap dengan "
"benar dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1234_9xvk6nh
msgid ""
"Confirm that tax-related entries are not recorded in periods that do not "
"pertain to the current tax obligation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa entri terkait pajak tidak dicatat pada periode yang tidak "
"berkaitan dengan kewajiban pajak kini."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1252_nmwnrzy
msgid ""
"Confirm that tax-related entries are not recorded in periods that do not "
"pertain to the deferred tax obligation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa entri terkait pajak tidak dicatat pada periode yang tidak "
"berkaitan dengan kewajiban pajak tangguhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_526_bof8tcj
msgid ""
"Confirm that taxes payable are correctly classified as current liabilities "
"on the balance sheet, as they are generally due within a short period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa utang pajak diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai liabilitas "
"lancar di neraca karena umumnya jatuh tempo dalam periode singkat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1106_ff5c06p
msgid ""
"Confirm that taxes withheld and remitted are consistent with legal "
"requirements and the entity’s policies."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pajak yang dipotong dan disetor konsisten dengan persyaratan "
"hukum dan kebijakan entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_308_e0gk5ri
msgid ""
"Confirm that the ROU assets are depreciated consistently with the lease term"
" and accounting policy, and verify accuracy in the calculation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa aset ROU disusutkan secara konsisten dengan masa sewa dan "
"kebijakan akuntansi, serta verifikasi keakuratan perhitungannya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_868_0sq9mdm
msgid ""
"Confirm that the accounting policy note explains the basis for classifying "
"and measuring the equity component of convertible bonds."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa catatan kebijakan akuntansi menjelaskan dasar klasifikasi "
"dan pengukuran komponen ekuitas obligasi konversi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_914_d8ojecs
msgid ""
"Confirm that the accumulated OCI balance in equity is reconciled and "
"disclosed as required by accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saldo akumulasi OCI dalam ekuitas direkonsiliasi dan "
"diungkap sesuai yang disyaratkan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_836_zefxqs7
msgid ""
"Confirm that the calculated cost matches the recorded amount in the treasury"
" shares contra-equity account."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa biaya yang dihitung cocok dengan jumlah yang dicatat pada "
"akun kontra ekuitas saham treasuri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_858_1iqgf31
msgid ""
"Confirm that the calculated equity component aligns with the amount recorded"
" in equity."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa komponen ekuitas yang dihitung selaras dengan jumlah yang "
"dicatat dalam ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_264_p4drkss
msgid ""
"Confirm that the calculations align with the applicable tax regulations and "
"entity-specific tax rates."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perhitungan selaras dengan peraturan pajak yang berlaku dan "
"tarif pajak spesifik entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_900_mdq78kv
msgid ""
"Confirm that the calculations follow the company’s accounting policies and "
"comply with relevant standards (e.g., IFRS, GAAP)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perhitungan mengikuti kebijakan akuntansi perusahaan dan "
"mematuhi standar yang relevan (mis. IFRS, GAAP)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_291_sxv3cfr
msgid ""
"Confirm that the capitalization policy is consistently applied by reviewing "
"a sample of acquisitions around the capitalization threshold."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kebijakan kapitalisasi diterapkan secara konsisten dengan "
"meninjau sampel perolehan di sekitar ambang kapitalisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_926_15gsonw
msgid ""
"Confirm that the classification distinguishes appropriations from other "
"retained earnings or reserves and that this presentation is consistent with "
"accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa klasifikasi membedakan apropriasi dari laba ditahan atau "
"cadangan lainnya dan penyajian ini konsisten dengan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_902_aovdcgv
msgid ""
"Confirm that the cumulative balance of OCI is included in the equity section"
" of the balance sheet as \"Accumulated Other Comprehensive Income.\""
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saldo kumulatif OCI dimasukkan di bagian ekuitas neraca "
"sebagai \"Akumulasi Penghasilan Komprehensif Lain\"."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_302_wapyhu1
msgid ""
"Confirm that the disclosures in the financial statements comply with "
"accounting standards, including asset classes, useful lives, depreciation "
"methods, revaluation adjustments, and impairment details."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar "
"akuntansi, termasuk kelas aset, umur manfaat, metode depresiasi, penyesuaian "
"revaluasi, dan detail penurunan nilai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_533_t2g9x8a
msgid ""
"Confirm that the disposal group designation is justified and consistent with"
" management’s plans and accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penetapan kelompok lepasan dapat dibenarkan dan konsisten "
"dengan rencana manajemen serta standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1266_c0peitx
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1282_0jqjseq
msgid ""
"Confirm that the documentation reflects the nature and amount of each OCI "
"item."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa dokumentasi mencerminkan sifat dan jumlah setiap item OCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1230_ejgkfof
msgid ""
"Confirm that the documentation reflects the nature and amount of taxes owed "
"for the period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa dokumentasi mencerminkan sifat dan jumlah pajak terutang "
"untuk periode tersebut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1248_hdqngce
msgid ""
"Confirm that the documentation reflects the nature and amount of temporary "
"differences and their associated tax effects."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa dokumentasi mencerminkan sifat dan jumlah perbedaan "
"temporer serta dampak pajaknya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1167_bum8hwa
msgid ""
"Confirm that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures for "
"depreciation and amortization methods, useful lives, and any changes."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa laporan keuangan memuat pengungkapan yang tepat atas metode "
"depresiasi dan amortisasi, umur manfaat, serta perubahan apa pun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_214_0mgeo0l
msgid ""
"Confirm that the initial cost of the investment was recorded accurately and "
"is consistent with the transaction documentation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa biaya awal investasi dicatat secara akurat dan konsisten "
"dengan dokumentasi transaksi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_236_g7ympjw
msgid ""
"Confirm that the initial investment cost recorded is accurate and matches "
"supporting documentation."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa biaya awal investasi yang dicatat akurat dan cocok dengan "
"dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_306_z690kfg
msgid ""
"Confirm that the initial recognition of the ROU asset is based on the "
"present value of lease payments and accurately recorded."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa pengakuan awal aset ROU didasarkan pada nilai kini "
"pembayaran sewa dan dicatat secara akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_499_5y8c5sv
msgid ""
"Confirm that the liability for bonuses is consistent with budgeted amounts "
"and other performance indicators, such as company or departmental "
"performance metrics."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa liabilitas bonus konsisten dengan jumlah yang dianggarkan "
"dan indikator kinerja lain, seperti metrik kinerja perusahaan atau departemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_865_hm911yz
msgid ""
"Confirm that the methodology for determining the equity component complies "
"with applicable accounting standards (e.g., IFRS, GAAP)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa metodologi penentuan komponen ekuitas mematuhi standar "
"akuntansi yang berlaku (mis. IFRS, GAAP)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_845_63ukf1c
msgid ""
"Confirm that the number of treasury shares held reconciles with the share "
"register or records from the transfer agent."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa jumlah saham treasuri yang dimiliki direkonsiliasi dengan "
"register saham atau catatan agen transfer."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_814_hz808cv
msgid ""
"Confirm that the par value and issuance price of each share align with "
"board-approved amounts and that APIC is calculated accurately (i.e., "
"issuance price minus par value)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa nilai nominal dan harga penerbitan tiap saham selaras dengan "
"jumlah yang disetujui dewan dan APIC dihitung akurat (yaitu harga penerbitan "
"dikurangi nilai nominal)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_876_m80mns7
msgid ""
"Confirm that the percentage of ownership and financial terms match the "
"recorded NCI balance."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa persentase kepemilikan dan ketentuan finansial cocok dengan "
"saldo NCI yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_138_osdqdtf
msgid ""
"Confirm that the prepayment period aligns with contractual obligations and "
"that costs have been recorded accurately."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa periode prabayar selaras dengan kewajiban kontraktual dan "
"biaya telah dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_61_uwmzaal
msgid ""
"Confirm that the presentation and disclosure of contract assets in the "
"financial statements meet accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa penyajian dan pengungkapan aset kontrak dalam laporan "
"keuangan memenuhi standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_709_fshmyse
msgid ""
"Confirm that the recalculated DTL matches the recorded amounts, and "
"investigate any discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa DTL hasil perhitungan ulang cocok dengan jumlah yang "
"dicatat, dan selidiki setiap selisih."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1056_d79bhu0
msgid ""
"Confirm that the recorded share of profit or loss aligns with the ownership "
"percentage as outlined in the agreement."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa porsi laba atau rugi yang dicatat selaras dengan persentase "
"kepemilikan sebagaimana tercantum dalam perjanjian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_955_2txxpg2
msgid ""
"Confirm that the retained earnings balance, including unappropriated "
"amounts, complies with the applicable accounting framework (e.g., IFRS, "
"GAAP)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saldo laba ditahan, termasuk jumlah yang tidak dialokasikan, "
"mematuhi kerangka akuntansi yang berlaku (mis. IFRS, GAAP)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_792_pbtmjuz
msgid ""
"Confirm that the share capital is classified correctly in the equity section"
" of the balance sheet, distinguishing between different classes (e.g., "
"common vs. preferred shares)."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa modal saham diklasifikasikan dengan benar di bagian ekuitas "
"neraca, membedakan antara kelas yang berbeda (mis. saham biasa vs. saham "
"preferen)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_260_qh5tcq9
msgid ""
"Confirm that the temporary differences align with tax laws and relate to "
"deductible amounts for which future tax benefits are likely to be realized."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa perbedaan temporer selaras dengan undang‑undang pajak dan "
"terkait dengan jumlah yang dapat dikurangkan yang manfaat pajak masa "
"depannya kemungkinan dapat direalisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_612_lpx8ac7
msgid ""
"Confirm that the terms of each lease are consistent with the recorded "
"liability and verify the initial recognition and classification as a finance"
" lease."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa ketentuan setiap sewa konsisten dengan liabilitas yang "
"dicatat dan verifikasi pengakuan awal serta klasifikasi sebagai sewa "
"pembiayaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_760_g0sdwn5
msgid ""
"Confirm that the terms, amounts, and any related conditions are accurately "
"reflected in the financial records."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa ketentuan, jumlah, dan kondisi terkait tercermin secara "
"akurat dalam catatan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_823_dj65cy8
msgid ""
"Confirm that the total APIC is included in the total shareholder’s equity "
"and that it reconciles with the company’s share issuance activity."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa total APIC termasuk dalam total ekuitas pemegang saham dan "
"direkonsiliasi dengan aktivitas penerbitan saham perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_690_xqemu6l
msgid ""
"Confirm that these components of benefit expense are appropriately allocated"
" between operating and financing activities."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa komponen beban imbalan tersebut dialokasikan secara tepat "
"antara aktivitas operasi dan pembiayaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1006_kzohxql
msgid ""
"Confirm that these events are properly considered for adjustment or "
"disclosure if they materially impact the revenue balance."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa kejadian tersebut dipertimbangkan dengan benar untuk "
"penyesuaian atau pengungkapan jika berdampak material pada saldo pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1140_crg0zy2
msgid ""
"Confirm that these expenses are correctly classified and disclosed, ensuring"
" that they do not distort operational expense trends."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa beban tersebut diklasifikasikan dan diungkap dengan benar, "
"memastikan tidak mendistorsi tren beban operasional."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_148_kj3k4pt
msgid ""
"Confirm that these prepayments are included on the prepayment schedule and "
"are allocated over the correct benefit period."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa prabayar tersebut termasuk dalam jadwal prabayar dan "
"dialokasikan sepanjang periode manfaat yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1216_rnbbpcp
msgid ""
"Confirm that transactions that should be recorded as part of discontinued "
"operations are not included in ongoing operations."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi yang seharusnya dicatat sebagai bagian operasi "
"yang dihentikan tidak dimasukkan dalam operasi berlanjut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1186_cob5bun
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1204_3qdnvpr
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1222_6kbzce1
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1240_2u43ea3
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1258_famoszl
msgid ""
"Confirm that transactions with related parties are conducted on arm's length"
" terms and adequately documented."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa transaksi dengan pihak berelasi dilakukan pada ketentuan "
"wajar (arm's length) dan terdokumentasi memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_847_jfkkhxz
msgid ""
"Confirm that treasury shares are accounted for in compliance with applicable"
" accounting standards (e.g., IFRS, GAAP), including presentation, "
"recognition, and disclosure."
msgstr ""
"Konfirmasi bahwa saham treasuri dicatat sesuai standar akuntansi yang berlaku "
"(mis. IFRS, GAAP), termasuk penyajian, pengakuan, dan pengungkapan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_838_hukvgy5
msgid ""
"Confirm that treasury shares are not included in outstanding share counts "
"and are excluded from earnings per share calculations."
msgstr ""
