msgid "End date for the interim period."
msgstr "Tanggal akhir untuk periode interim."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__previous_date_end
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__previous_date_end
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__previous_date_end
msgid "End date of the previous period."
msgstr "Tanggal akhir periode sebelumnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_190_9lkdvi7
msgid "Ensure adequate disclosures are made regarding the nature, composition, and any provisions or impairments related to other current assets."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan memadai dibuat mengenai sifat, komposisi, dan setiap provisi atau penurunan nilai terkait aset lancar lainnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_210_7o0ev2q
msgid "Ensure adequate disclosures in the financial statements regarding the nature, terms, provisions for doubtful accounts, and related party receivables."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan memadai mengenai sifat, ketentuan, provisi piutang ragu‑ragu, dan piutang pihak berelasi dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_256_32rnd2w
msgid "Ensure adequate disclosures, including ownership percentage, share of profits/losses, dividends, impairment, and material transactions with the joint venture."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan memadai termasuk persentase kepemilikan, bagian laba/rugi, dividen, penurunan nilai, dan transaksi material dengan ventura bersama."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_890_hxqtqqb
msgid "Ensure compliance with standards for disclosing NCI balances and related transactions, including information on dividends distributed to NCI holders."
msgstr "Pastikan kepatuhan terhadap standar pengungkapan saldo dan transaksi NCI, termasuk informasi dividen yang dibagikan kepada pemegang NCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_848_535e2u5
msgid "Ensure compliance with standards regarding classification as contra-equity and the exclusion of treasury shares from outstanding share counts."
msgstr "Pastikan kepatuhan terhadap standar klasifikasi sebagai kontra‑ekuitas dan pengecualian saham treasuri dari jumlah saham beredar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_248_jb4eur6
msgid "Ensure dividend income is correctly recorded and any reduction in the investment’s carrying value is in accordance with accounting standards."
msgstr "Pastikan pendapatan dividen dicatat dengan benar dan setiap penurunan nilai tercatat investasi sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_907_tjaeasw
msgid "Ensure that OCI transactions recorded near the reporting date are recognized in the correct period."
msgstr "Pastikan transaksi OCI yang dicatat dekat tanggal pelaporan diakui pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_745_gli2u7f
msgid "Ensure that accrued interest is recorded accurately at the period-end and is classified consistently with principal balances."
msgstr "Pastikan bunga akrual dicatat akurat pada akhir periode dan diklasifikasikan konsisten dengan saldo pokok."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_172_yn6jx6x
msgid "Ensure that adequate disclosures are made in the financial statements regarding the nature, amount, and timing of prepaid taxes."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan memadai atas sifat, jumlah, dan waktu pajak dibayar di muka dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_980_yr3iz0d
msgid "Ensure that adjustments or allocations affecting NCI are properly recognized in the current period and included in the financial statements."
msgstr "Pastikan penyesuaian atau alokasi yang mempengaruhi NCI diakui dengan benar pada periode berjalan dan tercantum dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1170_69n6k6u
msgid "Ensure that amounts recorded in the financial statements reflect accurate and current depreciation/amortization figures for all assets in use."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dicatat mencerminkan angka depresiasi/amortisasi yang akurat dan mutakhir untuk semua aset yang digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1190_kvpxdni
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements are reflective of current interest expense calculations for all debt obligations."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan beban bunga mutakhir untuk semua kewajiban utang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1278_23jsb1y
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1294_63u8m3t
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements reflect OCI calculations for all relevant items."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan OCI untuk semua item terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1208_fcqndd6
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements reflect current expense calculations for all relevant categories."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan beban mutakhir untuk semua kategori terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1226_a3jhx0x
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements reflect current profit or loss calculations for all discontinued items."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan laba rugi mutakhir untuk semua item yang dihentikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1244_ytpihi1
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements reflect current tax expense calculations for all relevant jurisdictions."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan beban pajak mutakhir untuk semua yurisdiksi terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1262_nato1s7
msgid "Ensure that amounts reported in the financial statements reflect deferred tax expense calculations for all relevant jurisdictions."
msgstr "Pastikan jumlah yang dilaporkan mencerminkan perhitungan beban pajak tangguhan untuk semua yurisdiksi terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_938_10hkwpy
msgid "Ensure that any changes impacting appropriated retained earnings are appropriately disclosed or considered for adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan yang mempengaruhi laba ditahan yang dialokasikan diungkapkan atau dipertimbangkan untuk penyesuaian dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1096_yevuztm
msgid "Ensure that any changes in cost allocation methods or material adjustments impacting cost of revenues are clearly disclosed."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan metode alokasi biaya atau penyesuaian material yang mempengaruhi biaya pendapatan diungkapkan dengan jelas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_441_wdwhd9v
msgid "Ensure that any changes in performance obligations or timing are appropriately reflected in the contract liability balance."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan kewajiban pelaksanaan atau waktu tercermin dengan tepat dalam saldo kewajiban kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_768_f6nwjio
msgid "Ensure that any current portion of long-term liabilities, if applicable, is correctly reclassified as a current liability."
msgstr "Pastikan porsi lancar dari liabilitas jangka panjang, jika ada, direklasifikasi dengan benar sebagai liabilitas lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_892_400e77t
msgid "Ensure that any material post-reporting changes are appropriately disclosed and assessed for adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan material setelah tanggal pelaporan diungkap dan dinilai untuk penyesuaian yang diperlukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_830_y0lsa6n
msgid "Ensure that any material subsequent events are appropriately disclosed and evaluated for potential adjustment to APIC."
msgstr "Pastikan kejadian material setelah tanggal pelaporan diungkap dan dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian terhadap APIC."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_852_4l5btct
msgid "Ensure that any material subsequent events are appropriately disclosed and evaluated for potential adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan kejadian material setelah tanggal pelaporan diungkap dan dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_737_u2pfjyp
msgid "Ensure that any required disclosures regarding subordination provisions and the priority of repayment are included in the financial statements."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan yang diperlukan mengenai ketentuan subordinasi dan prioritas pelunasan disertakan dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_793_xf0v132
msgid "Ensure that any shares subject to special terms or restrictions are disclosed appropriately."
msgstr "Pastikan setiap saham dengan ketentuan atau pembatasan khusus diungkap secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1168_ke20qd8
msgid "Ensure that any significant changes in estimates or impairment charges are disclosed in line with accounting standards."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan signifikan dalam estimasi atau beban penurunan nilai diungkap sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_62_fexg4d8
msgid "Ensure that any significant contract terms, risks, and unfulfilled performance obligations are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Pastikan ketentuan kontrak signifikan, risiko, dan kewajiban pelaksanaan yang belum terpenuhi diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_870_twin9dp
msgid "Ensure that any significant conversions or issuances are disclosed and assessed for potential adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan konversi atau penerbitan signifikan diungkap dan dinilai untuk potensi penyesuaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_918_3dwz6wn
msgid "Ensure that any subsequent events impacting OCI are appropriately disclosed or considered for potential adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan yang mempengaruhi OCI diungkap atau dipertimbangkan untuk penyesuaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_290_mkpx1r3
msgid "Ensure that assets are appropriately tagged or identified and located as per the register."
msgstr "Pastikan aset diberi label atau diidentifikasi dan ditemukan sesuai register."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_884_vgixtlq
msgid "Ensure that changes in ownership or other relevant events are reflected accurately as of the reporting date."
msgstr "Pastikan perubahan kepemilikan atau kejadian relevan lainnya tercermin akurat pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_564_9hoqz2g
msgid "Ensure that contingent liabilities expected to settle within 12 months are classified as current and verify that necessary disclosures are made in the financial statements."
msgstr "Pastikan liabilitas kontinjensi yang diharapkan selesai dalam 12 bulan diklasifikasikan sebagai lancar dan verifikasi pengungkapan yang diperlukan telah dibuat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_684_o8rwvv4
msgid "Ensure that contributions and benefit payments are consistent with the plan terms and properly reflected in the obligation balance."
msgstr "Pastikan kontribusi dan pembayaran manfaat konsisten dengan ketentuan rencana dan tercermin dengan benar dalam saldo kewajiban."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_252_fyozo8z
msgid "Ensure that contributions or withdrawals are recorded appropriately in line with the joint venture agreement."
msgstr "Pastikan kontribusi atau penarikan dicatat dengan tepat sesuai perjanjian ventura bersama."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_713_s1eyzio
msgid "Ensure that current and non-current classifications in the financial statements align with the underlying temporary difference schedule."
msgstr "Pastikan klasifikasi lancar dan tidak lancar selaras dengan jadwal perbedaan temporer yang mendasarinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_775_w24exmc
msgid "Ensure that disclosures provide users with a clear understanding of the nature and financial impact of the long-term liabilities."
msgstr "Pastikan pengungkapan memberi pemakai pemahaman jelas atas sifat dan dampak keuangan liabilitas jangka panjang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_922_v4kvm71
msgid "Ensure that documentation aligns with the company’s policies and includes sufficient rationale for each appropriation."
msgstr "Pastikan dokumentasi selaras dengan kebijakan perusahaan dan memuat alasan yang cukup untuk setiap apropriasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1022_ocxhhhc
msgid "Ensure that entries are supported by appropriate documentation and approved by authorized personnel."
msgstr "Pastikan entri didukung dokumentasi yang sesuai dan disetujui personel berwenang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1000_vfk3cbs
msgid "Ensure that entries are supported by valid documentation and approved by authorized personnel."
msgstr "Pastikan entri didukung dokumentasi yang sah dan disetujui personel berwenang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1138_p7ntv58
msgid "Ensure that expenses incurred after period-end are not included in the current period's G&A expenses."
msgstr "Pastikan beban setelah akhir periode tidak dimasukkan dalam beban Umum & Administrasi (G&A) periode berjalan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_70_mfx7qgi
msgid "Ensure that gains or losses, reclassifications, and impairments are appropriately recorded and disclosed."
msgstr "Pastikan laba atau rugi, reklasifikasi, dan penurunan nilai dicatat serta diungkap dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_660_r82djmx
msgid "Ensure that interest expense is appropriately split between finance cost and any related equity component, if applicable."
msgstr "Pastikan beban bunga dipisahkan tepat antara biaya pembiayaan dan komponen ekuitas terkait, jika berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_781_9t8c44y
msgid "Ensure that interest is accrued in the correct period and reconciled with terms outlined in the agreement."
msgstr "Pastikan bunga diakrualkan pada periode yang benar dan direkonsiliasi dengan ketentuan perjanjian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_126_wzeryrv
msgid "Ensure that inventory transfers between locations are properly authorized and recorded in the correct period."
msgstr "Pastikan transfer persediaan antar lokasi diotorisasi dan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_912_lk6q5t4
msgid "Ensure that items recorded in OCI are appropriate under the company’s accounting framework (e.g., IFRS or GAAP)."
msgstr "Pastikan item yang dicatat dalam OCI sesuai dengan kerangka akuntansi perusahaan (mis. IFRS atau GAAP)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1044_w1bed8q
msgid "Ensure that manual entries have sufficient documentation, appropriate authorization, and are properly explained."
msgstr "Pastikan entri manual memiliki dokumentasi memadai, otorisasi yang sesuai, dan dijelaskan dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_810_8m879ty
msgid "Ensure that material subsequent events are disclosed and, if necessary, evaluated for potential adjustments."
msgstr "Pastikan kejadian material setelah tanggal pelaporan diungkap dan bila perlu dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_357_0dps1t8
msgid "Ensure that properties are appropriately secured and match their descriptions in the register."
msgstr "Pastikan properti diamankan dengan tepat dan sesuai dengan deskripsi dalam register."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_206_9xca8a4
msgid "Ensure that receivables from related parties are appropriately classified and disclosed in the financial statements."
msgstr "Pastikan piutang dari pihak berelasi diklasifikasikan dan diungkap dengan tepat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1104_nyje4wm
msgid "Ensure that recorded salary and wage expenses are accurate and reflect the approved rates."
msgstr "Pastikan beban gaji dan upah yang dicatat akurat dan mencerminkan tarif yang disetujui."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_250_vbogrcf
msgid "Ensure that terms of related party transactions are fair and consistent with market rates, if applicable."
msgstr "Pastikan ketentuan transaksi pihak berelasi wajar dan konsisten dengan tarif pasar, jika berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_880_z2gmnxf
msgid "Ensure that the NCI share in each subsidiary’s net assets and results is reflected separately in the consolidated financial statements."
msgstr "Pastikan bagian NCI atas aset neto dan hasil tiap entitas anak dicerminkan terpisah dalam laporan keuangan konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_747_g4mmad3
msgid "Ensure that the classification aligns with loan agreements, considering any repayment schedules and management’s expectations of repayment timing."
msgstr "Pastikan klasifikasi selaras dengan perjanjian pinjaman, mempertimbangkan jadwal pelunasan dan ekspektasi waktu pelunasan manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_692_8l18ymg
msgid "Ensure that the classification is in line with actuarial calculations and reporting standards."
msgstr "Pastikan klasifikasi selaras dengan perhitungan aktuaria dan standar pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1291_qdcy6g0
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding OCI items that will be reclassified, including the nature of these items and their impact on equity."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan memuat pengungkapan yang tepat atas item OCI yang akan direklasifikasi, termasuk sifat dan dampaknya pada ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1275_32hg3fp
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding OCI items that will not be reclassified, including the nature of these items and their impact on equity."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan memuat pengungkapan atas item OCI yang tidak akan direklasifikasi, termasuk sifat dan dampaknya pada ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1241_7g3mwix
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding current tax expenses, including any significant components, deferred tax implications, and tax rates used."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan mengungkap beban pajak kini secara tepat termasuk komponen signifikan, implikasi pajak tangguhan, dan tarif pajak yang digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1259_yoro891
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding deferred tax expenses, including the nature of the temporary differences and the tax rates used."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan mengungkap beban pajak tangguhan secara tepat termasuk sifat perbedaan temporer dan tarif pajak yang digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1223_jfw754y
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding discontinued operations, including the nature of the discontinuation, financial impact, and any significant related party transactions."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan mengungkap operasi yang dihentikan secara tepat termasuk sifat penghentian, dampak keuangan, dan transaksi pihak berelasi signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1187_kv6v37s
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding interest expense, including terms of debt, interest rates, and maturity dates."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan mengungkap beban bunga secara tepat termasuk ketentuan utang, suku bunga, dan tanggal jatuh tempo."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1205_fwpxeul
msgid "Ensure that the financial statements include appropriate disclosures regarding other expenses, including significant components or unusual items."
msgstr "Pastikan laporan keuangan mengungkap beban lainnya termasuk komponen signifikan atau item tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_866_tt715mf
msgid "Ensure that the liability and equity components are split based on present value calculations using an appropriate discount rate for the liability portion."
msgstr "Pastikan komponen liabilitas dan ekuitas dipisahkan berdasarkan perhitungan nilai kini dengan tingkat diskonto yang sesuai untuk bagian liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1136_eqy50um
