#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_897_xv222fv
msgid "For a sample of OCI items, review supporting documentation (e.g., fair value adjustments, actuarial reports, or foreign exchange statements) to verify the legitimacy and accuracy of the transactions."
msgstr "Untuk sampel item OCI, tinjau dokumentasi pendukung (mis. penyesuaian nilai wajar, laporan aktuaria, atau laporan valas) untuk verifikasi keabsahan dan keakuratan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_390_2uc90nb
msgid "For a sample of accounts payable balances, send confirmations to key suppliers to verify the amount owed and any disputed amounts."
msgstr "Untuk sampel saldo utang usaha, kirim konfirmasi ke pemasok utama untuk verifikasi jumlah terutang dan jumlah yang disengketakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_412_ow2jgqo
msgid "For a sample of accruals, inspect supporting documentation, such as contracts or service agreements, to confirm the basis for the accrual."
msgstr "Untuk sampel akrual, periksa dokumentasi pendukung seperti kontrak atau perjanjian jasa untuk mengonfirmasi dasar akrual."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_490_80l8cff
msgid "For a sample of accrued benefits, recalculate the liability based on payroll data, employee contracts, approved bonus plans, or vacation policies."
msgstr "Untuk sampel manfaat terakru, hitung ulang liabilitas berdasarkan data penggajian, kontrak karyawan, rencana bonus disetujui, atau kebijakan cuti."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_498_l2ccawb
msgid "For a sample of accrued bonuses and other variable pay, verify that the liability is recorded based on approved bonus plans and aligns with any performance criteria, management estimates, or board approvals."
msgstr "Untuk sampel bonus terakru dan imbalan variabel lain, verifikasi bahwa liabilitas dicatat sesuai rencana bonus yang disetujui dan selaras dengan kriteria kinerja, estimasi manajemen, atau persetujuan dewan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_405_dpvlfru
msgid "For a sample of accrued expenses, confirm that the amounts are reasonable and calculated in accordance with company policy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel beban terakru, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah wajar dan dihitung sesuai kebijakan perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_553_use1lai
msgid "For a sample of accrued expenses, recalculate the liability based on supporting documentation, contract terms, or agreed rates."
msgstr "Untuk sampel beban terakru, hitung ulang liabilitas berdasarkan dokumentasi pendukung, ketentuan kontrak, atau tarif yang disepakati."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_573_y0bb1lc
msgid "For a sample of accrued non-trade payables, recalculate the amounts based on supporting documentation, contracts, or agreed rates."
msgstr "Untuk sampel utang non-usaha terakru, hitung ulang jumlah berdasarkan dokumentasi pendukung, kontrak, atau tarif yang disepakati."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_943_ks1rirf
msgid "For a sample of adjustments affecting retained earnings (e.g., corrections of errors, changes in accounting policies), review supporting documentation to verify accuracy and compliance with accounting standards."
msgstr "Untuk sampel penyesuaian yang mempengaruhi laba ditahan (mis. koreksi kesalahan, perubahan kebijakan akuntansi), tinjau dokumentasi pendukung guna verifikasi keakuratan dan kepatuhan standar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_927_novjlnf
msgid "For a sample of appropriations, recalculate the amounts appropriated and compare them to approved resolutions or budgets to verify accuracy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel apropriasi, hitung ulang jumlah yang dialokasikan dan bandingkan dengan keputusan atau anggaran yang disetujui guna verifikasi keakuratan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1155_scelykk
msgid "For a sample of assets, compare useful life and residual values with historical data, industry standards, and the organization’s policy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel aset, bandingkan umur manfaat dan nilai residu dengan data historis, standar industri, dan kebijakan organisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1151_u517gu3
msgid "For a sample of assets, recalculate depreciation (for tangible assets) and amortization (for intangible assets) using the organization’s policy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel aset, hitung ulang depresiasi (aset berwujud) dan amortisasi (aset tak berwujud) memakai kebijakan organisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1061_4kuzkdi
msgid "For a sample of associates or joint ventures, recalculate the entity’s share of profit or loss based on the reported profit or loss in the investee’s financial statements and the ownership percentage."
msgstr "Untuk sampel entitas asosiasi atau ventura bersama, hitung ulang porsi laba/rugi berdasarkan laporan keuangan investee dan persentase kepemilikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_679_8o9bj2r
msgid "For a sample of benefit plans, recalculate key figures in the actuarial report, such as present value of the obligation, interest cost, and service cost, to confirm accuracy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel rencana imbalan, hitung ulang angka kunci dalam laporan aktuaria (nilai kini kewajiban, biaya bunga, biaya jasa) untuk konfirmasi akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_635_ft0jn8q
msgid "For a sample of borrowings, recalculate interest expense based on the outstanding principal and interest rate, and verify accuracy in the financial statements."
msgstr "Untuk sampel pinjaman, hitung ulang beban bunga berdasarkan pokok terutang dan suku bunga, lalu verifikasi akurasinya di laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_432_odrmwru
msgid "For a sample of contract liabilities, verify that they are released (or recognized as revenue) only when the related performance obligations are fulfilled."
msgstr "Untuk sampel kewajiban kontrak, verifikasi bahwa pelepasan/pengakuan sebagai pendapatan hanya terjadi saat kewajiban pelaksanaan terpenuhi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_991_yspq1tz
msgid "For a sample of contracts or sales transactions, verify that revenue is recognized based on the terms of the contract and in accordance with the applicable accounting standards (e.g., performance obligations satisfied over time or at a point in time)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel kontrak atau transaksi penjualan, verifikasi bahwa pendapatan diakui sesuai ketentuan kontrak dan standar akuntansi yang berlaku (kewajiban pelaksanaan dipenuhi sepanjang waktu atau pada titik waktu)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_440_kkhnnw3
msgid "For a sample of contracts with modifications or cancellations, verify that adjustments to contract liabilities are recorded accurately and reflect the revised contract terms."
msgstr "Untuk sampel kontrak dengan modifikasi atau pembatalan, verifikasi bahwa penyesuaian kewajiban kontrak dicatat akurat dan mencerminkan ketentuan revisi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_683_w7cv83y
msgid "For a sample of contributions made and benefits paid to retirees during the period, inspect supporting documentation to confirm amounts and verify accurate recording in the financial statements."
msgstr "Untuk sampel kontribusi dan pembayaran manfaat kepada pensiunan, periksa dokumentasi pendukung guna konfirmasi jumlah dan pencatatan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_659_5iikyvd
msgid "For a sample of convertible bonds, recalculate interest expense using the effective interest rate method, confirming that amortization of any discount or premium aligns with the recorded amounts."
msgstr "Untuk sampel obligasi konversi, hitung ulang beban bunga dengan metode suku bunga efektif, konfirmasi amortisasi diskonto/premium sesuai jumlah tercatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_855_kogjq91
msgid "For a sample of convertible bonds, review supporting documentation (e.g., bond indenture agreements) to confirm the terms of the bond and the basis for the equity component calculation."
msgstr "Untuk sampel obligasi konversi, tinjau dokumentasi (mis. perjanjian indenture) untuk konfirmasi ketentuan dan dasar perhitungan komponen ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_560_p1a25p3
msgid "For a sample of customer deposits, trace amounts to contracts or customer agreements, verifying that deposits are returned or offset when goods or services are delivered."
msgstr "Untuk sampel uang muka pelanggan, telusuri ke kontrak/perjanjian pelanggan, verifikasi pengembalian atau pemakaian ketika barang/jasa diserahkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1249_b5wp6le
msgid "For a sample of deferred tax entries, recalculate the deferred tax expense based on the relevant temporary differences and applicable tax rates."
msgstr "Untuk sampel entri pajak tangguhan, hitung ulang beban pajak tangguhan berbasis perbedaan temporer relevan dan tarif pajak berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1213_vwo5m3d
msgid "For a sample of discontinued items, recalculate the profit or loss by tracing revenue and expenses to supporting documentation (invoices, contracts)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel item yang dihentikan, hitung ulang laba/rugi dengan menelusuri pendapatan dan beban ke dokumentasi pendukung (faktur, kontrak)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_562_6nhwspt
msgid "For a sample of employee accruals, recalculate amounts based on policies or employment agreements and confirm they are appropriately classified as current liabilities."
msgstr "Untuk sampel akrual karyawan, hitung ulang jumlah berdasarkan kebijakan atau perjanjian kerja dan konfirmasi klasifikasi sebagai liabilitas lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_501_exr42hw
msgid "For a sample of employees, verify accrued vacation based on vacation days earned and used, and ensure the calculation aligns with the company’s vacation policy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel karyawan, verifikasi akrual cuti berdasarkan hari diperoleh dan digunakan, pastikan perhitungan sesuai kebijakan cuti perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1193_3wjfnjw
msgid "For a sample of expense transactions, recalculate the amounts based on the underlying documentation (e.g., invoices, contracts)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel transaksi beban, hitung ulang jumlah berdasarkan dokumentasi dasar (mis. faktur, kontrak)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_611_xzpvxbo
msgid "For a sample of finance leases, inspect the lease agreements to verify terms, payment schedules, interest rates, and any options for extension or termination."
msgstr "Untuk sampel sewa pembiayaan, periksa perjanjian sewa guna verifikasi ketentuan, jadwal pembayaran, suku bunga, dan opsi perpanjangan/pengakhiran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_327_ms0yan5
msgid "For a sample of intangible assets with finite useful lives, verify that the amortization expense has been calculated correctly and is based on the assigned useful life and method."
msgstr "Untuk sampel aset tak berwujud berumur terbatas, verifikasi amortisasi dihitung benar dan sesuai umur manfaat serta metode yang ditetapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_744_bmgl1bg
msgid "For a sample of interest payments made during the period, inspect payment documentation to confirm amounts and verify that interest was paid in line with the loan terms."
msgstr "Untuk sampel pembayaran bunga periode berjalan, periksa dokumentasi pembayaran guna konfirmasi jumlah dan kesesuaian dengan ketentuan pinjaman."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1011_dex0tz8
msgid "For a sample of interest-bearing investments or loans, recalculate interest income based on the principal, interest rate, and term specified in agreements."
msgstr "Untuk sampel investasi atau pinjaman berbunga, hitung ulang pendapatan bunga berdasarkan pokok, suku bunga, dan tenor perjanjian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1173_57uwqg0
msgid "For a sample of interest-bearing loans or debt, recalculate interest expense based on the loan agreement terms, interest rates, and outstanding principal."
msgstr "Untuk sampel pinjaman/utang berbunga, hitung ulang beban bunga sesuai ketentuan perjanjian, suku bunga, dan pokok terutang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_117_tmjwpe0
msgid "For a sample of inventory items, review cost assignments to ensure consistency with the entity’s costing method (e.g., FIFO, LIFO)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel item persediaan, tinjau penetapan biaya guna memastikan konsistensi dengan metode biaya entitas (mis. FIFO, LIFO)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_615_9dg0v38
msgid "For a sample of lease payments made during the period, trace payments to supporting documentation and confirm that they are correctly recorded as reductions of the lease liability."
msgstr "Untuk sampel pembayaran sewa periode berjalan, telusuri ke dokumentasi pendukung dan konfirmasi pencatatan sebagai pengurang liabilitas sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_621_96wrgc0
msgid "For a sample of leases with modifications or changes in lease terms, inspect documentation of the modification and confirm that the lease liability is remeasured in accordance with accounting standards."
msgstr "Untuk sampel sewa dengan modifikasi/ perubahan ketentuan, periksa dokumentasi modifikasi dan konfirmasi pengukuran ulang liabilitas sesuai standar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_613_vsn7bdn
msgid "For a sample of leases, recalculate the present value of lease payments using the appropriate discount rate (e.g., the company’s incremental borrowing rate or the interest rate implicit in the lease)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel sewa, hitung ulang nilai kini pembayaran sewa menggunakan tingkat diskonto yang sesuai (mis. incremental borrowing rate perusahaan atau tingkat implisit sewa)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_551_dpvx8z3
msgid "For a sample of liabilities, inspect supporting documentation such as invoices, contracts, and agreements to confirm that the liability exists and is accurately recorded."
msgstr "Untuk sampel liabilitas, periksa dokumentasi pendukung (faktur, kontrak, perjanjian) untuk konfirmasi keberadaan dan pencatatan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_530_jjwio3f
msgid "For a sample of liabilities, review supporting documents to confirm they meet the criteria for classification within a disposal group."
msgstr "Untuk sampel liabilitas, tinjau dokumen pendukung mengonfirmasi pemenuhan kriteria klasifikasi dalam kelompok lepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_534_b1ryhxt
msgid "For a sample of liabilities, verify that they are recorded at the lower of carrying amount or fair value less costs to sell (if required by standards)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel liabilitas, verifikasi pencatatan pada nilai terendah antara nilai tercatat atau nilai wajar dikurangi biaya jual (jika disyaratkan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_595_vh9a4ts
msgid "For a sample of loan repayments during the period, trace payments to bank statements and confirm that principal and interest amounts are correctly recorded in the general ledger."
msgstr "Untuk sampel pelunasan pinjaman, telusuri pembayaran ke rekening koran bank dan konfirmasi pencatatan pokok serta bunga di buku besar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_579_ar5i4dd
msgid "For a sample of long-outstanding non-trade payables, confirm with management or the counterparty whether the liability is still valid."
msgstr "Untuk sampel utang non-usaha lama, konfirmasi dengan manajemen atau pihak lawan apakah liabilitas masih valid."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_759_ikj3gak
msgid "For a sample of long-term liabilities, review supporting documents such as contracts, legal agreements, or actuarial reports."
msgstr "Untuk sampel liabilitas jangka panjang, tinjau dokumen pendukung (kontrak, perjanjian hukum, laporan aktuaria)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_571_uv8jtkz
msgid "For a sample of non-trade payables, inspect supporting documentation (e.g., invoices, contracts, agreements) to confirm the existence, legitimacy, and accuracy of recorded payables."
msgstr "Untuk sampel utang non-usaha, periksa dokumentasi pendukung (faktur, kontrak, perjanjian) untuk konfirmasi keberadaan, keabsahan, dan keakuratan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_472_q3d5tai
msgid "For a sample of provisions, independently recalculate the amount based on the supporting documentation, assumptions, and company policy to verify accuracy."
msgstr "Untuk sampel provisi, hitung ulang secara independen jumlah berdasarkan dokumentasi, asumsi, dan kebijakan perusahaan guna verifikasi akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_470_4jh0dbw
msgid "For a sample of provisions, inspect supporting documentation to understand the basis for recognition and calculation, such as legal correspondence, warranty data, or restructuring plans."
msgstr "Untuk sampel provisi, periksa dokumentasi pendukung memahami dasar pengakuan dan perhitungan (korespondensi hukum, data garansi, rencana restrukturisasi)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1001_1mrh2lr
msgid "For a sample of revenue transactions, verify compliance with the applicable revenue recognition standard (e.g., IFRS 15’s 5-step model or ASC 606)."
msgstr "Untuk sampel transaksi pendapatan, verifikasi kepatuhan pada standar pengakuan pendapatan yang berlaku (mis. IFRS 15 model 5 langkah atau ASC 606)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_786_j94v2mh
msgid "For a sample of share issuances, redemptions, or cancellations during the period, inspect supporting documents such as stock issuance agreements, share certificates, and payment receipts."
msgstr "Untuk sampel penerbitan, penebusan, atau pembatalan saham, periksa dokumen pendukung (perjanjian penerbitan, sertifikat saham, bukti pembayaran)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_813_s44zf0w
msgid "For a sample of share issuances, review supporting documentation, such as stock issuance agreements and receipts for funds received."
msgstr "Untuk sampel penerbitan saham, tinjau dokumentasi pendukung (perjanjian penerbitan, bukti penerimaan dana)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_175_vw3k0mf
msgid "For a sample of significant items, inspect supporting documentation (e.g., contracts, invoices, agreements) to verify existence, ownership, and terms of other current assets."
msgstr "Untuk sampel item signifikan, periksa dokumentasi (kontrak, faktur, perjanjian) memverifikasi keberadaan, kepemilikan, dan ketentuan aset lancar lainnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_402_pjptot1
msgid "For a sample of significant vendor accounts, review reconciliation statements provided by vendors to confirm recorded amounts match the vendor’s records."
msgstr "Untuk sampel akun vendor signifikan, tinjau rekonsiliasi vendor guna konfirmasi kecocokan jumlah tercatat dengan catatan vendor."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1231_u7vss40
msgid "For a sample of tax expense entries, recalculate the current tax expense based on the relevant taxable income and applicable tax rates."
msgstr "Untuk sampel entri beban pajak, hitung ulang beban pajak kini berdasarkan penghasilan kena pajak relevan dan tarif pajak berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_512_4fi2xal
msgid "For a sample of tax liabilities, recalculate the accrued amounts based on supporting documents, applicable tax rates, and the entity’s tax schedules."
msgstr "Untuk sampel liabilitas pajak, hitung ulang jumlah terakru berdasarkan dokumen pendukung, tarif pajak berlaku, dan jadwal pajak entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_510_i0dt4hu
msgid "For a sample of taxes payable, inspect tax returns, payroll records, and other supporting documents to verify that the liabilities recorded align with filed returns."
msgstr "Untuk sampel utang pajak, periksa SPT, catatan penggajian, dan dokumen pendukung lain guna verifikasi kesesuaian dengan SPT yang diajukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_259_yoj35ei
msgid "For a sample of temporary differences, inspect supporting documentation to verify that differences are correctly identified and accurately calculated."
msgstr "Untuk sampel perbedaan temporer, periksa dokumentasi pendukung guna verifikasi identifikasi dan perhitungan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_708_qeq0zn3
msgid "For a sample of temporary differences, recalculate the deferred tax liability balance by multiplying the temporary difference amount by the applicable tax rate."
msgstr "Untuk sampel perbedaan temporer, hitung ulang saldo liabilitas pajak tangguhan dengan mengalikan jumlah perbedaan dengan tarif pajak berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_833_neomqp9
msgid "For a sample of treasury share transactions, inspect supporting documentation, such as buyback agreements, payment records, and confirmation from brokers."
msgstr "Untuk sampel transaksi saham treasuri, periksa dokumentasi (perjanjian buyback, catatan pembayaran, konfirmasi broker)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_400_dsfdmal
msgid "For accounts payable denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate at the balance sheet date."
msgstr "Untuk utang usaha valas, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang tepat pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_422_p9x6hlc
msgid "For accruals denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate at the balance sheet date."
msgstr "Untuk akrual valas, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs tepat pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_561_vtnzl9t
msgid "For accruals related to employee expenses (e.g., vacation pay, bonuses), verify that they are calculated based on contractual or policy requirements."
msgstr "Untuk akrual beban karyawan (cuti dibayar, bonus), verifikasi perhitungan berdasarkan kontrak atau kebijakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_502_hd6kj4s
msgid "For accrued employee benefits subject to payroll taxes (e.g., accrued wages, bonuses), confirm that payroll tax liabilities are appropriately calculated and recorded."
msgstr "Untuk manfaat karyawan terakru yang dikenai pajak penggajian (upah, bonus), konfirmasi liabilitas pajak dihitung dan dicatat tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_200_39ppzbj
msgid "For aged or overdue receivables, confirm that management has appropriately assessed the likelihood of collection and recorded necessary provisions."
msgstr "Untuk piutang tua atau lewat jatuh tempo, konfirmasi penilaian manajemen atas kemungkinan penagihan dan pencatatan provisi yang perlu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_372_7brxy0u
msgid "For any assets subject to amortization or accretion (e.g., deferred charges), verify the amortization calculation and ensure consistency with the entity’s policy."
msgstr "Untuk aset yang diamortisasi/akresi (mis. biaya tangguhan), verifikasi perhitungan amortisasi dan konsistensi dengan kebijakan entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_863_onkoi7q
msgid "For any bonds issued close to the reporting date, ensure they are recorded in the correct period and that the equity component is accurately calculated based on the bond issuance date."
msgstr "Untuk obligasi diterbitkan dekat tanggal pelaporan, pastikan dicatat di periode benar dan komponen ekuitas dihitung akurat berdasarkan tanggal penerbitan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_643_zuysrmh
msgid "For any borrowings with modifications, refinancings, or renegotiated terms, review relevant documentation to confirm accurate recording and remeasurement of the liability."
msgstr "Untuk pinjaman dengan modifikasi, refinancing, atau negosiasi ulang, tinjau dokumentasi guna konfirmasi pencatatan dan pengukuran ulang liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_251_x0nj5gq
msgid "For any contributions or withdrawals made to or from the joint venture during the period, inspect supporting documentation to confirm the accuracy and timing of these transactions."
msgstr "Untuk kontribusi/penarikan ventura bersama, periksa dokumentasi guna konfirmasi akurasi dan waktu transaksi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_542_dzj7z00
msgid "For any estimated or contingent liabilities within the disposal group, review the assumptions and calculations used to estimate the amounts."
msgstr "Untuk liabilitas estimasi atau kontinjensi dalam kelompok lepasan, tinjau asumsi dan perhitungan yang digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1066_spzumcu
msgid "For any investment where the associate or joint venture has incurred significant losses, confirm that the carrying amount has been adjusted accordingly or impaired if necessary."
msgstr "Untuk investasi dengan kerugian signifikan pada entitas asosiasi/ventura bersama, konfirmasi penyesuaian atau penurunan nilai bila perlu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_309_9trfp5s
msgid "For any leases with modifications or reassessments during the period, inspect documentation for adjustments to the ROU asset and lease liability."
msgstr "Untuk sewa dengan modifikasi atau penilaian ulang, periksa dokumentasi penyesuaian aset ROU dan liabilitas sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1023_qkoqjfw
msgid "For any new interest-generating assets acquired during the period, obtain the investment or loan agreement and confirm that interest income is accurately recorded based on the terms."
msgstr "Untuk aset penghasil bunga baru, dapatkan perjanjian investasi/pinjaman dan konfirmasi pendapatan bunga dicatat akurat sesuai ketentuan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_723_1oqo0om
msgid "For any new temporary differences created through transactions, verify accurate recording and consistent application of tax rates."
msgstr "Untuk perbedaan temporer baru dari transaksi, verifikasi pencatatan akurat dan konsistensi penerapan tarif pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_693_dm8s15l
msgid "For any plan amendments, curtailments, or settlements, review supporting documentation to understand the nature and financial impact of changes."
msgstr "Untuk amandemen, pembatasan, atau penyelesaian rencana, tinjau dokumentasi guna memahami sifat dan dampak keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_606_brjiybu
msgid "For any refinancing or modifications, verify that disclosures reflect these events accurately if they occurred before the financial statements were issued."
msgstr "Untuk refinancing atau modifikasi, verifikasi pengungkapan mencerminkan peristiwa secara akurat jika terjadi sebelum penerbitan laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_939_hgqr970
msgid "For appropriations related to statutory or regulatory requirements, confirm compliance with minimum requirements (e.g., mandatory reserves for specific industries)."
msgstr "Untuk apropriasi terkait persyaratan hukum/regulasi, konfirmasi kepatuhan pada ketentuan minimum (mis. cadangan wajib industri tertentu)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_380_60553il
msgid "For assets denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr "Untuk aset valas, konfirmasi penerjemahan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs tepat pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_288_40pj8ym
msgid "For assets identified with potential impairment, inspect management’s impairment tests and assumptions, ensuring adjustments are recorded correctly if impairment is required."
msgstr "Untuk aset berindikasi penurunan nilai, periksa uji dan asumsi manajemen, pastikan penyesuaian dicatat benar bila diperlukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_297_0fcdqz8
msgid "For assets that are revalued, review management’s revaluation documentation, including the basis for fair value determinations and assumptions used."
msgstr "Untuk aset direvaluasi, tinjau dokumentasi revaluasi manajemen (dasar nilai wajar dan asumsi digunakan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1163_9h5g5ul
msgid "For assets that may have been impaired, verify that depreciation and amortization are adjusted accordingly."
msgstr "Untuk aset mungkin turun nilai, verifikasi depresiasi dan amortisasi disesuaikan semestinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_293_yr28qyv
msgid "For assets under construction, verify the amounts capitalized by inspecting construction contracts, work orders, and payment invoices."
msgstr "Untuk aset dalam konstruksi, verifikasi jumlah dikapitalisasi dengan memeriksa kontrak konstruksi, SPK, dan faktur pembayaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_180_oppa7tl
msgid "For assets with indicators of impairment, such as aged advances or deposits unlikely to be recovered, confirm that provisions have been recorded in line with accounting standards."
msgstr "Untuk aset berindikator penurunan nilai (uang muka/depositus lama tak tertagih), konfirmasi pencatatan provisi sesuai standar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_663_4u6r0ic
msgid "For bonds with embedded derivatives or conversion options, verify management’s valuation of the conversion feature or any derivatives embedded in the instrument."
msgstr "Untuk obligasi dengan derivatif tertanam atau opsi konversi, verifikasi penilaian manajemen atas fitur konversi atau derivatif tertanam."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_645_5cce7gg
msgid "For borrowings with unusual terms or long-outstanding balances, review the terms of the agreements and confirm with management that these liabilities are still valid and correctly classified."
msgstr "Untuk pinjaman dengan ketentuan tidak biasa atau saldo lama, tinjau ketentuan perjanjian dan konfirmasi kepada manajemen validitas serta klasifikasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_227_d39fzkc
msgid "For changes in the ownership percentage of the associate, confirm that they are accurately reflected in the investment schedule and general ledger."
msgstr "Untuk perubahan persentase kepemilikan entitas asosiasi, konfirmasi refleksi akurat dalam jadwal investasi dan buku besar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_59_gu90cfy
msgid ""
"For contract assets denominated in foreign currency, verify that they are "
"translated using the appropriate exchange rates as of the balance sheet "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset kontrak yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa aset tersebut "
"diterjemahkan menggunakan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_438_p3bmxdy
msgid ""
"For contract liabilities denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange"
" rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kewajiban kontrak yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_444_565g79h
msgid ""
"For contracts with performance obligations extending over multiple periods, "
"confirm that contract liabilities are classified correctly as current or "
"non-current based on expected fulfillment dates."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kontrak dengan kewajiban pelaksanaan yang melampaui beberapa periode, konfirmasi bahwa "
"kewajiban kontrak diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan "
"tanggal pemenuhan yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_559_yj3fdbp
msgid ""
"For customer deposits or advances, confirm that deposits are recorded "
"accurately and are classified as current liabilities if they are expected to"
" be settled within 12 months."
msgstr ""
"Untuk uang muka atau deposit pelanggan, konfirmasi bahwa deposit dicatat akurat dan "
"diklasifikasikan sebagai kewajiban lancar bila diharapkan akan diselesaikan dalam 12 bulan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_273_eh5j2pl
msgid ""
"For deferred tax assets denominated in foreign currencies, verify that "
"amounts are translated into the reporting currency at the correct exchange "
"rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset pajak tangguhan (DTA) yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa "
"jumlah diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang benar pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1035_5rv5kok
msgid ""
"For dividend income, obtain confirmations or statements from the investee "
"entities to verify recorded amounts."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pendapatan dividen, dapatkan konfirmasi atau pernyataan dari entitas investee untuk "
"memverifikasi jumlah yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_969_f0vwsf8
msgid ""
"For dividends paid to NCI holders, obtain dividend declarations and verify "
"that they align with approved amounts and are accurately recorded as a "
"reduction in NCI."
msgstr ""
"Untuk dividen yang dibayarkan kepada pemegang NCI, dapatkan deklarasi dividen dan verifikasi "
"kesesuaiannya dengan jumlah yang disetujui serta pencatatan akurat sebagai pengurang NCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_225_k5xbioz
msgid ""
"For dividends received from associates, inspect documentation such as "
"dividend declarations and payment receipts to confirm existence and "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Untuk dividen yang diterima dari entitas asosiasi, periksa dokumentasi seperti deklarasi dividen "
"dan bukti pembayaran untuk mengonfirmasi keberadaan dan keakuratan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_218_cwvc9q3
msgid ""
"For each adjustment, ensure that the calculations are accurate based on the "
"investor’s percentage ownership and that entries are recorded correctly."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap penyesuaian, pastikan perhitungan akurat berdasarkan persentase kepemilikan investor "
"dan entri dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_921_dk6eci1
msgid ""
"For each appropriation, review supporting documentation, including board or "
"shareholder resolutions, legal requirements, or management decisions, to "
"verify approval and authorization."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap apropriasi, tinjau dokumentasi pendukung termasuk risalah dewan atau keputusan "
"pemegang saham, persyaratan hukum, atau keputusan manajemen untuk memverifikasi persetujuan dan "
"otorisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1055_n9nfwit
msgid ""
"For each associate or joint venture, verify the ownership percentage and "
"profit-sharing arrangement based on the original investment agreement and "
"any amendments."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap entitas asosiasi atau ventura bersama, verifikasi persentase kepemilikan dan "
"pengaturan pembagian laba berdasarkan perjanjian investasi awal dan setiap amandemennya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_706_kvfh8sp
msgid ""
"For each deferred tax liability component, inspect the tax rate applied and "
"verify that it is consistent with enacted rates as of the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap komponen liabilitas pajak tangguhan (DTL), periksa tarif pajak yang diterapkan dan "
"verifikasi konsistensinya dengan tarif yang berlaku pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_593_b2hnod4
msgid ""
"For each loan, inspect the loan agreement to verify the loan amount, "
"interest rate, repayment terms, and any covenants."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap pinjaman, periksa perjanjian pinjaman guna memverifikasi jumlah pinjaman, suku bunga, "
"ketentuan pelunasan, dan kovenan yang ada."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_633_kcaclk2
msgid ""
"For each significant borrowing, inspect loan agreements to confirm loan "
"amount, interest rate, repayment terms, collateral, and any restrictions."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap pinjaman signifikan, periksa perjanjian pinjaman untuk mengonfirmasi jumlah pinjaman, "
"suku bunga, ketentuan pelunasan, agunan, dan pembatasan yang ada."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_653_yc9ldnx
msgid ""
"For each significant convertible bond issuance, inspect the bond agreement "
"to verify key terms, including principal amount, interest rate, maturity "
"date, conversion price, and conversion conditions."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap penerbitan obligasi konversi signifikan, periksa perjanjian obligasi guna memverifikasi "
"ketentuan utama termasuk jumlah pokok, suku bunga, tanggal jatuh tempo, harga konversi, dan "
"ketentuan konversi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_350_3n2y3uz
msgid ""
"For entities using the cost model, review for indicators of impairment, such"
" as adverse changes in market conditions or reduced rental income."
msgstr ""
"Untuk entitas yang menggunakan model biaya, tinjau indikator penurunan nilai seperti perubahan "
"kondisi pasar yang merugikan atau penurunan pendapatan sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_348_y3c0tkq
msgid ""
"For entities using the fair value model, obtain valuation reports from "
"external appraisers and review the assumptions and methods used in "
"determining fair value."
msgstr ""
"Untuk entitas yang menggunakan model nilai wajar, dapatkan laporan penilaian dari penilai eksternal "
"dan tinjau asumsi serta metode yang digunakan dalam penentuan nilai wajar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_101_oxdc0y0
msgid ""
"For foreign currency derivatives, confirm that balances are translated using"
" the correct exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk derivatif mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa saldo diterjemahkan menggunakan kurs yang benar "
"pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_151_b30jiq4
msgid ""
"For foreign currency prepayments, confirm that balances are translated at "
"the appropriate exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk prabayar mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa saldo diterjemahkan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada "
"tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_11_hwwtdoq
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated cash accounts, verify that year-end "
"balances are translated using the appropriate exchange rate."
msgstr ""
"Untuk rekening kas yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa saldo akhir tahun "
"diterjemahkan menggunakan kurs yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_79_vaya8kl
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated financial assets, verify that balances are "
"translated at the appropriate exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset keuangan yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa saldo "
"diterjemahkan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_35_jzi90vx
msgid ""
"For foreign currency-denominated receivables, verify that balances are "
"translated using the correct exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa saldo diterjemahkan "
"menggunakan kurs yang benar pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1018_hok063v
msgid ""
"For income earned close to the year-end, confirm that any accrued interest "
"is correctly recorded and that income is allocated to the appropriate "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pendapatan yang diperoleh mendekati akhir tahun, konfirmasi bahwa setiap bunga akrual "
"dicatat dengan benar dan pendapatan dialokasikan ke periode yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_520_shoqwql
msgid ""
"For income tax payable, examine the income tax provision calculated as part "
"of the year-end tax provision process."
msgstr ""
"Untuk utang pajak penghasilan, periksa perhitungan provisi pajak penghasilan sebagai bagian proses "
"provisi pajak akhir tahun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_947_ml1kuv5
msgid ""
"For industries with statutory minimum reserve requirements, verify that "
"retained earnings are sufficient to meet these requirements."
msgstr ""
"Untuk industri dengan persyaratan cadangan minimum menurut ketentuan, verifikasi bahwa laba "
"ditahan cukup untuk memenuhi persyaratan tersebut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_741_8jqr7x7
msgid ""
"For instances of covenant non-compliance, inspect evidence of lender waivers"
" or amendments to confirm no violation of the loan terms."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kasus ketidakpatuhan kovenan, periksa bukti dispensasi atau amandemen dari pemberi pinjaman "
"guna memastikan tidak ada pelanggaran ketentuan pinjaman."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_338_e34m1a0
msgid ""
"For intangible assets denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange"
" rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset tak berwujud yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_334_3okrzpc
msgid ""
"For intangible assets generated internally (such as development costs), "
"verify that expenditures meet the criteria for capitalization."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset tak berwujud yang dihasilkan secara internal (seperti biaya pengembangan), verifikasi "
"bahwa pengeluaran memenuhi kriteria kapitalisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_330_cwpqpug
msgid ""
"For intangible assets with indefinite useful lives, such as goodwill, review"
" the annual impairment test, including management’s assumptions and "
"supporting evidence."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset tak berwujud dengan umur manfaat tidak terbatas seperti goodwill, tinjau uji penurunan "
"nilai tahunan termasuk asumsi manajemen dan bukti pendukungnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_103_hccioga
msgid ""
"For interest rate derivatives, confirm that valuation considers prevailing "
"market interest rates and that changes in fair value are correctly "
"calculated."
msgstr ""
"Untuk derivatif suku bunga, konfirmasi bahwa penilaian mempertimbangkan suku bunga pasar yang "
"berlaku dan perubahan nilai wajar dihitung dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_780_nsjd5el
msgid ""
"For interest-bearing long-term liabilities or those with accretion expense "
"(e.g., asset retirement obligations), review calculations to verify that "
"interest or accretion is recorded accurately."
msgstr ""
"Untuk liabilitas jangka panjang berbunga atau yang memiliki beban akresi (mis. kewajiban "
"pensiun aset), tinjau perhitungan guna memverifikasi bahwa bunga atau akresi dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_129_npbvsjt
msgid ""
"For inventory held on consignment, confirm that it is excluded from the "
"inventory balance and appropriately disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Untuk persediaan titipan (consignment), konfirmasi bahwa persediaan tersebut dikecualikan dari "
"saldo persediaan dan diungkap dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_223_q208xs1
msgid ""
"For investments in associates denominated in foreign currencies, confirm "
"that amounts are translated into the reporting currency at the appropriate "
"exchange rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk investasi pada entitas asosiasi yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, konfirmasi "
"bahwa jumlah diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_185_3u95lhp
msgid ""
"For items classified as prepayments or deposits, confirm that they are being"
" amortized or expensed over the period of benefit."
msgstr ""
"Untuk item yang diklasifikasikan sebagai prabayar atau deposit, konfirmasi bahwa item tersebut "
"diamortisasi atau dibebankan sepanjang periode manfaatnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_181_x2brsf3
msgid ""
"For items such as advances to suppliers or other receivables, assess the "
"likelihood of recovery by reviewing subsequent transactions and payment "
"history."
msgstr ""
"Untuk item seperti uang muka kepada pemasok atau piutang lainnya, nilai kemungkinan tertagih "
"dengan meninjau transaksi berikutnya dan riwayat pembayaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_711_gla4s2i
msgid ""
"For items where reversal may not occur (such as indefinite-lived "
"intangibles), confirm that deferred tax liabilities are appropriately "
"recognized based on tax regulations."
msgstr ""
"Untuk item yang mungkin tidak berbalik (seperti aset tak berwujud umur tidak terbatas), konfirmasi "
"bahwa liabilitas pajak tangguhan diakui secara tepat sesuai peraturan pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_240_01gafjv
msgid ""
"For joint ventures accounted under proportionate consolidation, confirm that"
" the appropriate share of joint venture assets, liabilities, income, and "
"expenses is included in the entity’s financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Untuk ventura bersama yang dicatat dengan konsolidasi proporsional, konfirmasi bahwa bagian "
"aset, liabilitas, pendapatan, dan beban ventura bersama yang tepat termasuk dalam laporan "
"keuangan entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_239_mpk1vfd
msgid ""
"For joint ventures accounted under the equity method, verify adjustments for"
" the share of profits or losses and dividends received."
msgstr ""
"Untuk ventura bersama yang dicatat dengan metode ekuitas, verifikasi penyesuaian atas bagian laba "
"atau rugi dan dividen yang diterima."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_245_hazg6iz
msgid ""
"For joint ventures denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts "
"are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate as"
" of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk ventura bersama yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_707_4xv0hiz
msgid ""
"For jurisdictions with future tax rate changes, verify that management has "
"applied the appropriate rates in line with the expected reversal period of "
"each temporary difference."
msgstr ""
"Untuk yurisdiksi dengan perubahan tarif pajak masa depan, verifikasi bahwa manajemen menerapkan "
"tarif yang sesuai selaras dengan periode pembalikan yang diharapkan untuk setiap perbedaan temporer."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_315_8axuh6i
msgid ""
"For leases denominated in foreign currencies, confirm that amounts are "
"translated to the reporting currency at the correct exchange rate as of the "
"balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk sewa yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah diterjemahkan ke "
"mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang benar pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_762_qjmaju0
msgid ""
"For liabilities based on estimates, recalculate or independently verify the "
"amounts and confirm consistency with prior periods unless there is a "
"justified change in assumptions."
msgstr ""
"Untuk liabilitas berbasis estimasi, hitung ulang atau verifikasi secara independen jumlah dan "
"konfirmasi konsistensinya dengan periode sebelumnya kecuali ada perubahan asumsi yang "
"dibenarkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_769_h6hu1wq
msgid ""
"For liabilities based on management estimates, assess the reasonableness of "
"assumptions by comparing them to historical experience, industry data, or "
"actuarial recommendations."
msgstr ""
"Untuk liabilitas berbasis estimasi manajemen, nilai kewajaran asumsi dengan membandingkan pada "
"pengalaman historis, data industri, atau rekomendasi aktuaria."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_603_xwx0oab
msgid ""
"For loans secured by assets, review the details of the collateral "
"arrangement and confirm that assets pledged as collateral are properly "
"disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pinjaman yang dijamin aset, tinjau rincian pengaturan agunan dan konfirmasi bahwa aset "
"yang diagunkan diungkap dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_782_nq4rvjr
msgid ""
"For long-term liabilities with covenant requirements, test compliance by "
"recalculating key ratios or thresholds and comparing them to covenant terms."
msgstr ""
"Untuk liabilitas jangka panjang dengan persyaratan kovenan, uji kepatuhan dengan menghitung ulang "
"rasio atau ambang kunci dan membandingkannya dengan ketentuan kovenan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_376_fjjetzn
msgid ""
"For long-term receivables included in other non-current assets, review "
"credit assessments, payment history, and terms to determine recoverability."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang jangka panjang yang termasuk dalam aset tidak lancar lainnya, tinjau penilaian "
"kredit, riwayat pembayaran, dan ketentuan untuk menentukan keterpulihan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_638_zrg28gr
msgid ""
"For new borrowings or repayments near the reporting date, inspect supporting"
" documents to confirm accurate cutoff in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pinjaman baru atau pelunasan dekat tanggal pelaporan, periksa dokumen pendukung untuk "
"mengonfirmasi cutoff yang akurat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_657_ssm7u7d
msgid ""
"For new issuances, test the calculation and allocation of debt and equity "
"components at the inception date of the bond in line with applicable "
"accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Untuk penerbitan baru, uji perhitungan dan alokasi komponen utang dan ekuitas pada tanggal awal "
"obligasi sesuai standar akuntansi yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_598_owthlow
msgid ""
"For new loans or repayments around year-end, inspect supporting "
"documentation to confirm that these transactions are accurately recorded in "
"the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pinjaman baru atau pelunasan di sekitar akhir tahun, periksa dokumentasi pendukung untuk "
"mengonfirmasi pencatatan akurat transaksi tersebut dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_147_x9o9n85
msgid ""
"For new prepayments acquired during the period, inspect supporting "
"documentation (e.g., vendor invoices, contracts) to verify the initial "
"recording and accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Untuk prabayar baru yang diperoleh selama periode, periksa dokumentasi pendukung (mis. faktur "
"vendor, kontrak) guna memverifikasi pencatatan awal dan keakuratannya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_391_8tsowls
msgid ""
"For non-responding confirmations, perform alternative procedures such as "
"reviewing subsequent cash disbursements or vendor statements."
msgstr ""
"Untuk konfirmasi yang tidak merespons, lakukan prosedur alternatif seperti meninjau pengeluaran "
"kas berikutnya atau pernyataan vendor."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_22_k9jicyb
msgid ""
"For non-responses, consider performing alternative procedures, such as "
"vouching to subsequent cash receipts or sales invoices."
msgstr ""
"Untuk ketidakjawaban, pertimbangkan prosedur alternatif seperti menelusuri ke penerimaan kas "
"berikutnya atau faktur penjualan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_581_oq7l0sk
msgid ""
"For non-trade payables related to related parties, review the nature of the "
"transaction, confirm that it is appropriately recorded and disclosed, and "
"ensure it complies with applicable standards."
msgstr ""
"Untuk utang non-usaha kepada pihak berelasi, tinjau sifat transaksi, konfirmasi pencatatan dan "
"pengungkapan yang tepat, serta pastikan kepatuhan pada standar yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_207_rue7dp0
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables denominated in foreign currencies, verify that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the applicable exchange "
"rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang non-usaha yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang berlaku pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_199_a8ojm0d
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables due from employees, related parties, or tax "
"authorities, review subsequent repayments or settlements to assess "
"recoverability."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang non-usaha yang jatuh tempo dari karyawan, pihak berelasi, atau otoritas pajak, "
"tinjau pelunasan atau penyelesaian berikutnya untuk menilai keterpulihan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_205_dmuxbkf
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables due from related parties, review board approvals "
"and confirm that terms are consistent with market rates."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang non-usaha dari pihak berelasi, tinjau persetujuan dewan dan konfirmasi bahwa "
"ketentuan konsisten dengan tarif pasar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_201_0y32ile
msgid ""
"For non-trade receivables that accrue interest (e.g., loans to employees or "
"related parties), confirm that interest income is accurately calculated and "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang non-usaha yang menimbulkan bunga (mis. pinjaman kepada karyawan atau pihak berelasi), "
"konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan bunga dihitung dan dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_68_1cr6zq7
msgid ""
"For non-traded or complex financial assets, review management’s valuation "
"techniques and assumptions, or obtain independent valuation if available."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset keuangan yang tidak diperdagangkan atau kompleks, tinjau teknik dan asumsi penilaian "
"manajemen atau dapatkan penilaian independen jika tersedia."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_187_jyohhuf
msgid ""
"For other current assets denominated in foreign currencies, verify that "
"amounts are translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange"
" rate as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset lancar lainnya yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_92_o1tcs88
msgid ""
"For over-the-counter (OTC) derivatives, review management’s valuation "
"methods, and consider reperforming the valuation or consulting with an "
"independent valuation specialist if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Untuk derivatif over-the-counter (OTC), tinjau metode penilaian manajemen dan pertimbangkan "
"melakukan ulang penilaian atau berkonsultasi dengan spesialis penilaian independen bila perlu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_461_b2z4h3l
msgid ""
"For overdrafts with continuous usage, evaluate the sustainability of cash "
"flow management and the entity's ability to reduce overdraft dependence."
msgstr ""
"Untuk cerukan dengan penggunaan berkelanjutan, nilai keberlanjutan manajemen arus kas dan "
"kemampuan entitas mengurangi ketergantungan cerukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_424_fl8qiaa
msgid ""
"For payroll and benefit-related accruals, review calculations and underlying"
" payroll data for accuracy and reasonableness."
msgstr ""
"Untuk akrual terkait penggajian dan manfaat, tinjau perhitungan serta data penggajian dasar guna "
"akurasi dan kewajaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_518_fw25zb6
msgid ""
"For payroll taxes payable, verify that payroll-related tax liabilities "
"(e.g., social security, Medicare, federal and state taxes) are accurately "
"calculated and recorded based on the payroll records."
msgstr ""
"Untuk utang pajak penggajian, verifikasi bahwa liabilitas pajak terkait penggajian (mis. jaminan "
"sosial, Medicare, pajak pusat dan daerah) dihitung dan dicatat akurat berdasarkan catatan "
"penggajian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_169_8tkpee5
msgid ""
"For prepaid taxes denominated in foreign currencies, verify that amounts are"
" translated to the reporting currency at the applicable exchange rate as of "
"the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pajak dibayar di muka yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa jumlah "
"diterjemahkan ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang berlaku pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_358_fk8npyg
msgid ""
"For properties denominated in foreign currencies, verify that amounts are "
"translated to the reporting currency at the appropriate exchange rate at the"
" balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Untuk properti yang didenominasikan dalam mata uang asing, verifikasi bahwa jumlah diterjemahkan "
"ke mata uang pelaporan dengan kurs yang sesuai pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_764_jhpra0t
msgid ""
"For provisions or obligations with future payments, recalculate present "
"values using appropriate rates and terms."
msgstr ""
"Untuk provisi atau kewajiban dengan pembayaran masa depan, hitung ulang nilai kini menggunakan "
"tingkat dan ketentuan yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_480_mxidl30
msgid ""
"For provisions with significant management judgment (e.g., legal "
"contingencies, warranty claims), review the assumptions and estimates used "
"by management."
msgstr ""
"Untuk provisi dengan pertimbangan manajemen signifikan (mis. kontinjensi hukum, klaim garansi), "
"tinjau asumsi dan estimasi yang digunakan manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_67_ks4aqmx
msgid ""
"For publicly traded financial assets, obtain market prices as of the balance"
" sheet date from reliable sources to verify recorded fair values."
msgstr ""
"Untuk aset keuangan yang diperdagangkan publik, dapatkan harga pasar pada tanggal neraca dari "
"sumber tepercaya guna memverifikasi nilai wajar yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1037_9jaz6vg
msgid ""
"For rental income, obtain lease agreements and confirm that revenue "
"recognized is consistent with contract terms."
msgstr ""
"Untuk pendapatan sewa, dapatkan perjanjian sewa dan konfirmasi bahwa pendapatan yang diakui "
"konsisten dengan ketentuan kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1041_mo57bsk
msgid ""
"For revenue transactions near the end of the reporting period, verify that "
"revenue is recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Untuk transaksi pendapatan dekat akhir periode pelaporan, verifikasi bahwa pendapatan dicatat pada "
"periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_808_tu27czw
msgid ""
"For shares issued or redeemed close to the year-end, verify the timing of "
"issuance or redemption against supporting documents to ensure accurate "
"period-end balances."
msgstr ""
"Untuk saham yang diterbitkan atau ditebus dekat akhir tahun, verifikasi waktu penerbitan atau "
"penebusan terhadap dokumen pendukung guna memastikan saldo akhir periode akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_628_1rwjsvg
msgid ""
"For significant covenants, obtain management's compliance assessment and "
"verify accuracy through recalculation or inspection of supporting documents."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kovenan signifikan, dapatkan penilaian kepatuhan manajemen dan verifikasi akurasinya melalui "
"perhitungan ulang atau pemeriksaan dokumen pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_193_9nx3fdj
msgid ""
"For significant non-trade receivables, inspect supporting documentation, "
"such as loan agreements or employee advance forms, to verify the existence, "
"terms, and accuracy of recorded amounts."
msgstr ""
"Untuk piutang non-usaha signifikan, periksa dokumentasi pendukung seperti perjanjian pinjaman atau "
"form uang muka karyawan untuk memverifikasi keberadaan, ketentuan, dan keakuratan jumlah yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_583_90c517z
msgid ""
"For significant or non-routine non-trade transactions (e.g., consulting "
"fees, legal settlements), obtain a copy of the contract or agreement to "
"confirm terms and verify the recorded liability."
msgstr ""
"Untuk transaksi non-usaha signifikan atau non-rutin (mis. biaya konsultan, penyelesaian hukum), "
"dapatkan salinan kontrak atau perjanjian guna mengonfirmasi ketentuan dan memverifikasi liabilitas yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_157_mq91v7f
msgid ""
"For significant prepaid tax items, obtain and inspect tax payment receipts, "
"and confirm the amounts and dates of payments."
msgstr ""
"Untuk item pajak dibayar di muka signifikan, dapatkan dan periksa bukti pembayaran pajak serta "
"konfirmasi jumlah dan tanggal pembayarannya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_137_ebf8oju
msgid ""
"For significant prepayments (e.g., long-term insurance or rental contracts),"
" obtain confirmations or review supporting agreements to verify terms and "
"existence."
msgstr ""
"Untuk prabayar signifikan (mis. kontrak asuransi atau sewa jangka panjang), dapatkan konfirmasi "
"atau tinjau perjanjian pendukung guna memverifikasi ketentuan dan keberadaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_893_75cj2k4
msgid ""
"For subsidiaries that distributed dividends to NCI holders, verify the "
"accuracy of the dividend calculation and ensure it aligns with the ownership"
" percentage."
msgstr ""
"Untuk entitas anak yang mendistribusikan dividen kepada pemegang NCI, verifikasi keakuratan "
"perhitungan dividen dan kesesuaiannya dengan persentase kepemilikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_903_q5s0cml
msgid ""
"For subsidiaries with foreign operations, review foreign currency "
"translation adjustments included in OCI."
msgstr ""
"Untuk entitas anak dengan operasi luar negeri, tinjau penyesuaian translasi mata uang asing yang "
"termasuk dalam OCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_425_cnfryqe
msgid ""
"For tax-related payables, verify calculations, obtain supporting tax returns"
" or filings, and ensure appropriate classification."
msgstr ""
"Untuk kewajiban terkait pajak, verifikasi perhitungan, dapatkan SPT atau dokumen pajak pendukung, "
"dan pastikan klasifikasi yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1020_t2k3bn0
msgid ""
"For variable-rate investments or loans, ensure that interest rate "
"adjustments are correctly applied, and income is accurately calculated based"
" on the adjusted rates."
msgstr ""
"Untuk investasi atau pinjaman dengan suku bunga variabel, pastikan penyesuaian suku bunga "
"diterapkan dengan benar dan pendapatan dihitung akurat berdasarkan suku bunga yang disesuaikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_18_k7yg6y3
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_40_ea7yff7
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_51_4so4xuj
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_6_o0roo4x
msgid "Foreign Currency Translation Testing (if applicable)"
msgstr "Pengujian Translasi Mata Uang Asing (jika berlaku)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.model_general_audit_audit_procedure
msgid "General Audit - Audit Procedure"
msgstr "Audit Umum - Prosedur Audit"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
