msgstr "Ikon untuk menandakan aktivitas pengecualian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_549_9fvif42
msgid "Identify and Test Non-Recurring HR Expenses"
msgstr "Identifikasi dan Uji Beban SDM Non-Berulang"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_562_da61z8q
msgid "Identify and Test Unusual or Non-Recurring Expenses"
msgstr "Identifikasi dan Uji Beban Tidak Biasa atau Non-Berulang"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_993_impxz9x
msgid ""
"Identify and examine revenue transactions from significant customers, "
"focusing on large or unusual sales transactions that could impact revenue "
"materially."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi dan periksa transaksi pendapatan dari pelanggan signifikan, fokus pada transaksi "
"penjualan besar atau tidak biasa yang dapat berdampak material pada pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1021_n0uznga
msgid ""
"Identify and review any manual journal entries impacting interest income, "
"focusing on unusual or non-standard entries."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi dan tinjau entri jurnal manual yang mempengaruhi pendapatan bunga, fokus pada entri "
"tidak biasa atau non-standar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1089_qtkfyt1
msgid ""
"Identify and review any non-recurring or unusual costs included in cost of "
"revenues, such as product launch expenses or abnormal production losses."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi dan tinjau biaya non-berulang atau tidak biasa dalam biaya pendapatan, seperti beban "
"peluncuran produk atau kerugian produksi abnormal."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1043_v8uz9i6
msgid ""
"Identify and review manual journal entries affecting non-interest revenue "
"accounts, focusing on unusual or large entries."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi dan tinjau entri jurnal manual yang mempengaruhi akun pendapatan non-bunga, fokus "
"pada entri besar atau tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_999_vinry2m
msgid ""
"Identify and review manual journal entries impacting revenue, focusing on "
"unusual or non-standard entries."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi dan tinjau entri jurnal manual yang mempengaruhi pendapatan, fokus pada entri tidak "
"biasa atau non-standar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_143_rsjfz01
msgid ""
"Identify any adjustments or reversals made to prepayments during the period "
"and confirm that they are properly authorized and documented."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi penyesuaian atau pembalikan atas prabayar selama periode dan konfirmasi otorisasi serta "
"dokumentasi yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_105_pe97ncl
msgid ""
"Identify any embedded derivatives within hybrid financial instruments, "
"ensuring they are properly separated and accounted for."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi derivatif tertanam dalam instrumen keuangan hibrida, pastikan dipisahkan dan dicatat "
"dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1067_e60t0kn
msgid ""
"Identify any events after the reporting period that may impact the share of "
"profit or loss, such as significant transactions, asset write-downs, or "
"operational changes in the associate or joint venture."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi kejadian setelah periode pelaporan yang dapat mempengaruhi porsi laba atau rugi seperti "
"transaksi signifikan, penurunan nilai aset, atau perubahan operasional di entitas asosiasi/ventura bersama."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_959_0vl41ai
msgid ""
"Identify any events occurring after the reporting date, such as dividend "
"declarations or material changes in estimates, that may affect retained "
"earnings."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan seperti deklarasi dividen atau perubahan material "
"dalam estimasi yang dapat mempengaruhi laba ditahan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1093_6aj8mld
msgid ""
"Identify any impairments or write-downs of inventory or production costs "
"affecting cost of revenues."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi penurunan nilai atau penghapusan persediaan atau biaya produksi yang mempengaruhi "
"biaya pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1139_bspnh3c
msgid ""
"Identify any non-recurring or unusual G&A expenses, such as relocation costs"
" or office improvements."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi beban Umum & Administrasi (G&A) non-berulang atau tidak biasa seperti biaya relokasi "
"atau perbaikan kantor."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1113_aelvi82
msgid ""
"Identify any non-recurring or unusual HR expenses, such as severance "
"payments, recruitment fees, or training costs."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi beban SDM non-berulang atau tidak biasa seperti pesangon, biaya rekrutmen, atau biaya pelatihan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_17_p6qpp3k
msgid ""
"Identify any restricted cash accounts (e.g., compensating balances, "
"collateral for loans) and assess whether they are properly classified and "
"disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi rekening kas terbatas (mis. saldo kompensasi, agunan pinjaman) dan nilai apakah telah "
"diklasifikasikan serta diungkap dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1051_rid4avd
msgid ""
"Identify any subsequent events, such as service contract modifications, "
"significant rent adjustments, or royalty changes, that could affect the "
"recorded revenue."
msgstr ""
"Identifikasi kejadian setelah tanggal pelaporan seperti modifikasi kontrak jasa, penyesuaian sewa "
"signifikan, atau perubahan royalti yang dapat mempengaruhi pendapatan yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_37_pwxgv47
msgid ""
"If any accounts receivable are factored, pledged, or assigned, review "
"supporting agreements and disclosures."
msgstr ""
"Jika ada piutang yang difaktorkan, dijaminkan, atau dialihkan, tinjau perjanjian pendukung dan "
"pengungkapannya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_646_wy49d41
msgid ""
"If applicable, evaluate whether reclassification or additional disclosures "
"are needed for such long-standing borrowings."
msgstr ""
"Jika berlaku, nilai apakah diperlukan reklasifikasi atau pengungkapan tambahan untuk pinjaman "
"jangka panjang tersebut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_664_futnrq6
msgid ""
"If applicable, review the valuation model used and assumptions to confirm "
"that the fair value of the conversion option is appropriately recognized and"
" disclosed."
msgstr ""
"Jika berlaku, tinjau model penilaian dan asumsi yang digunakan untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa nilai wajar "
"opsi konversi diakui dan diungkap secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_audit_procedure__message_needaction
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_audit_procedure__message_unread
