#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__message_has_error
msgid "If checked, some messages have a delivery error."
msgstr "Jika dicentang, beberapa pesan mengalami kesalahan pengiriman."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_244_lxfafrn
msgid ""
"If impairment indicators exist, review management’s impairment calculations "
"and ensure they are reasonable and comply with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Jika terdapat indikator penurunan nilai, tinjau perhitungan penurunan nilai manajemen dan pastikan "
"kewajaran serta kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_222_6bismqw
msgid ""
"If impairment is identified, test management’s impairment calculations and "
"confirm they are in line with applicable accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Jika penurunan nilai teridentifikasi, uji perhitungan penurunan nilai manajemen dan konfirmasi "
"kesesuaiannya dengan standar akuntansi yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_796_lvpmdz8
msgid ""
"If the company has treasury shares (repurchased shares), confirm that they "
"are appropriately classified as a contra-equity account in the financial "
"statements."
msgstr ""
"Jika perusahaan memiliki saham treasuri (saham buyback), konfirmasi bahwa saham tersebut "
"diklasifikasikan dengan tepat sebagai akun kontra‑ekuitas dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_961_x6f6g4h
msgid ""
"If the retained earnings account has a debit balance, examine whether the "
"accumulated deficit has been properly disclosed and if management has a plan"
" to address it."
msgstr ""
"Jika akun laba ditahan bersaldo debit, periksa apakah defisit akumulasi telah diungkap dengan tepat "
"dan apakah manajemen memiliki rencana untuk menanganinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_522_nqebu09
msgid ""
"If there are any interest or penalties related to late tax payments, confirm"
" that these amounts are recorded accurately in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Jika terdapat bunga atau denda terkait keterlambatan pembayaran pajak, konfirmasi bahwa jumlah "
"tersebut dicatat akurat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_428_pa77gry
msgid "Impact Analysis on Potential Dilution of Equity"
msgstr "Analisis Dampak atas Potensi Dilusi Ekuitas"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_175_61sz73d
msgid "Impairment Testing (Cost Model)"
msgstr "Pengujian Penurunan Nilai (Model Biaya)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_409_unxj8su
msgid "Inspect Supporting Documentation for Treasury Share Repurchases"
msgstr "Periksa Dokumentasi Pendukung Pembelian Kembali Saham Treasuri"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_120_txbbzyv
msgid ""
"Inspect a sample of inventory items to assess their physical condition and "
"confirm management’s assertion on obsolescence."
msgstr ""
"Periksa sampel item persediaan untuk menilai kondisi fisik dan mengonfirmasi pernyataan manajemen "
"tentang keusangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_182_kk6czfx
msgid ""
"Inspect any provisions for non-collectable balances and verify that they are"
" reasonable and supported by management's assessment."
msgstr ""
"Periksa setiap provisi atas saldo tidak tertagih dan verifikasi kewajarannya serta dukungan "
"penilaian manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_457_8kcavks
msgid ""
"Inspect bank statements and ensure overdrafts as of the balance sheet date "
"are correctly recorded as current liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Periksa rekening koran bank dan pastikan cerukan pada tanggal neraca dicatat dengan benar sebagai "
"kewajiban lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_669_dl51fl3
msgid ""
"Inspect compliance reports for any bond covenants, recalculating any "
"relevant ratios (such as debt-to-equity or interest coverage ratios) to "
"verify compliance."
msgstr ""
"Periksa laporan kepatuhan atas kovenan obligasi, hitung ulang rasio relevan (mis. debt-to-equity, "
"interest coverage) untuk memverifikasi kepatuhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_361_w19g8dm
msgid ""
"Inspect contracts and rental agreements to verify proper timing of "
"recognition."
msgstr ""
"Periksa kontrak dan perjanjian sewa untuk memverifikasi ketepatan waktu pengakuan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_393_8224q6o
msgid ""
"Inspect documentation for goods or services received near the balance sheet "
"date to verify proper cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi barang atau jasa yang diterima dekat tanggal neraca untuk memverifikasi cutoff "
"yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_247_2c4ulm2
msgid ""
"Inspect documentation such as dividend declarations and receipts to verify "
"any dividend income from the joint venture."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi seperti deklarasi dividen dan bukti penerimaan untuk memverifikasi pendapatan "
"dividen dari ventura bersama."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_335_78f0hw4
msgid ""
"Inspect documentation supporting the technical feasibility, future economic "
"benefits, and management intent to complete the asset, ensuring that "
"research costs are expensed as incurred."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi yang mendukung kelayakan teknis, manfaat ekonomi masa depan, dan niat manajemen "
"untuk menyelesaikan aset, pastikan biaya penelitian dibebankan saat terjadi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_337_4dxy715
msgid ""
"Inspect documentation, such as acquisition dates and payment evidence, to "
"confirm that transactions are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi seperti tanggal perolehan dan bukti pembayaran untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa "
"transaksi dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_266_2nvd9x2
msgid ""
"Inspect forecasts, budgets, and other evidence that supports management’s "
"expectation of future taxable income, to assess whether DTAs are likely to "
"be realized."
msgstr ""
"Periksa proyeksi, anggaran, dan bukti lain yang mendukung ekspektasi manajemen atas penghasilan "
"kena pajak masa depan untuk menilai apakah DTA kemungkinan dapat direalisasikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_576_swk5gqg
msgid ""
"Inspect invoices and contracts to ensure appropriate cutoff for recording "
"non-trade payables."
msgstr ""
"Periksa faktur dan kontrak untuk memastikan cutoff yang sesuai dalam pencatatan utang non-usaha."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_556_6hrsgjb
msgid ""
"Inspect invoices and other documentation to ensure appropriate cutoff for "
"liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Periksa faktur dan dokumentasi lain untuk memastikan cutoff yang tepat atas liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_296_841yaew
msgid ""
"Inspect invoices, authorizations, or sale agreements to ensure transactions "
"are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa faktur, otorisasi, atau perjanjian penjualan untuk memastikan transaksi dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_618_l0n3cow
msgid ""
"Inspect lease agreements or payment schedules for new or terminated leases "
"around year-end to confirm proper cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Periksa perjanjian sewa atau jadwal pembayaran untuk sewa baru atau yang dihentikan di sekitar akhir tahun guna mengonfirmasi cutoff yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_314_sxz65tl
msgid ""
"Inspect lease commencement dates and modification dates to verify proper "
"timing of recognition."
msgstr ""
"Periksa tanggal dimulainya sewa dan tanggal modifikasi untuk memverifikasi waktu pengakuan yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_312_np1ih6n
msgid ""
"Inspect management’s impairment assessment and calculations, ensuring any "
"impairment loss is recorded accurately in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Periksa penilaian dan perhitungan penurunan nilai manajemen, pastikan setiap kerugian penurunan nilai dicatat akurat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_351_32oehdp
msgid ""
"Inspect management’s impairment assessments and test any impairment "
"adjustments for selected properties to ensure they are accurate and "
"consistent with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Periksa penilaian penurunan nilai manajemen dan uji penyesuaian penurunan nilai atas properti terpilih untuk memastikan akurat dan konsisten dengan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_375_hwl6qlg
msgid ""
"Inspect management’s impairment assessments for a sample of assets, ensuring"
" impairment losses are calculated accurately and recorded in compliance with"
" accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Periksa penilaian penurunan nilai manajemen untuk sampel aset, pastikan kerugian penurunan nilai dihitung akurat dan dicatat sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_435_v7y2vn9
msgid ""
"Inspect payment and service completion dates to ensure that liabilities "
"related to unfulfilled obligations as of the balance sheet date are "
"appropriately recorded."
msgstr ""
"Periksa tanggal pembayaran dan penyelesaian jasa untuk memastikan liabilitas atas kewajiban yang belum terpenuhi pada tanggal neraca dicatat dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_565_eycnof8
msgid ""
"Inspect payments made after the balance sheet date to determine if any "
"liabilities for the period-end were unrecorded."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pembayaran setelah tanggal neraca untuk menentukan apakah ada liabilitas akhir periode yang belum dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_625_kuqvb6s
msgid ""
"Inspect payments made after the balance sheet date to identify any "
"liabilities that were unpaid as of period-end."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pembayaran setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas yang belum dibayar pada akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_649_koswdzy
msgid ""
"Inspect payments made to lenders after the reporting date to identify any "
"liabilities that may not have been fully accounted for as of period-end."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pembayaran kepada pemberi pinjaman setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas yang mungkin belum sepenuhnya dicatat pada akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_524_0d3o1re
msgid ""
"Inspect payments made to tax authorities after the balance sheet date for "
"evidence of any unpaid taxes as of year-end."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pembayaran kepada otoritas pajak setelah tanggal neraca untuk bukti pajak yang belum dibayar pada akhir tahun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_585_0jaheln
msgid ""
"Inspect payments made to vendors after the balance sheet date to identify "
"any liabilities that were unpaid as of period-end."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pembayaran kepada pemasok setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas yang belum dibayar pada akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_443_eyiwceq
msgid ""
"Inspect sales or service agreements initiated shortly before the period-end "
"for evidence of unrecorded contract liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Periksa perjanjian penjualan atau jasa yang dimulai dekat akhir periode untuk bukti kewajiban kontrak yang belum dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_460_icdxdqp
msgid ""
"Inspect subsequent cash transactions for each overdraft facility after the "
"reporting date to confirm balances were cleared or maintained per overdraft "
"agreements."
msgstr ""
"Periksa transaksi kas setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk setiap fasilitas cerukan guna mengonfirmasi saldo telah dilunasi atau dipertahankan sesuai perjanjian cerukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_749_97uouwv
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documentation for transactions close to the reporting "
"date to verify accurate cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi pendukung atas transaksi dekat tanggal pelaporan untuk memverifikasi cutoff yang akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_162_t0mczov
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documentation to confirm proper classification and "
"recording in the correct fiscal period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi pendukung untuk mengonfirmasi klasifikasi dan pencatatan pada periode fiskal yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_242_2jgs2oz
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documentation to confirm that any changes in ownership or"
" other material transactions are recorded accurately and in the correct "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi pendukung untuk mengonfirmasi perubahan kepemilikan atau transaksi material lainnya dicatat akurat dan pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_196_75dm5lw
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documentation to confirm that any receipts or repayments "
"are properly classified and recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi pendukung untuk mengonfirmasi bahwa setiap penerimaan atau pelunasan diklasifikasikan dan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_235_rzn4lex
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documentation, such as joint venture agreements, to "
"verify the initial cost of the investment."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumentasi pendukung seperti perjanjian ventura bersama untuk memverifikasi biaya perolehan awal investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_419_q8k8mwx
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documents for goods or services received near the balance"
" sheet date and verify that the corresponding accruals were recorded "
"properly."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumen pendukung atas barang atau jasa yang diterima dekat tanggal neraca dan verifikasi akrual terkait dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_686_bkb4472
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documents for transactions near the reporting date to "
"verify accurate cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumen pendukung untuk transaksi dekat tanggal pelaporan guna memverifikasi cutoff yang akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_662_g610642
msgid ""
"Inspect supporting documents for transactions near the reporting date to "
"verify correct cutoff in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Periksa dokumen pendukung transaksi dekat tanggal pelaporan untuk memverifikasi cutoff yang benar dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_806_rlod76v
msgid ""
"Inspect the approval for dividends declared and confirm that payment of "
"dividends is consistent with shareholder agreements and rights."
msgstr ""
"Periksa persetujuan atas dividen yang diumumkan dan konfirmasi pembayaran dividen konsisten dengan perjanjian serta hak pemegang saham."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_495_f7j2lj2
msgid ""
"Inspect time records and payroll calculations to verify the completeness of "
"liabilities for the last pay period of the fiscal year."
msgstr ""
"Periksa catatan waktu dan perhitungan penggajian untuk memverifikasi kelengkapan liabilitas periode gaji terakhir tahun fiskal."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_605_n8g3iqy
msgid ""
"Inspect transactions and events after the balance sheet date to identify any"
" new borrowings, early repayments, or covenant breaches that may impact the "
"reporting period."
msgstr ""
"Periksa transaksi dan kejadian setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi pinjaman baru, pelunasan dini, atau pelanggaran kovenan yang dapat mempengaruhi periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_415_l2wmj8p
msgid ""
"Inspect vendor statements and invoices received shortly after the period-end"
" for evidence of liabilities that should be accrued."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pernyataan pemasok dan faktur yang diterima segera setelah akhir periode untuk bukti liabilitas yang harus diakru."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_395_ci0qarl
msgid ""
"Inspect vendor statements and open invoices for evidence of any liabilities "
"that should have been accrued."
msgstr ""
"Periksa pernyataan pemasok dan faktur terbuka untuk bukti liabilitas yang seharusnya sudah diakru."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.selection__general_audit_ws_b26d482__balance_type__interim
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.selection__general_audit_ws_f9f3299__balance_type__interim
msgid "Interim Balance"
msgstr "Saldo Interim"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__interim_date_end
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__interim_date_end
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__interim_date_end
msgid "Interim End Date"
msgstr "Tanggal Akhir Interim"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__interim_date_start
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__interim_date_start
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__interim_date_start
msgid "Interim Start Date"
msgstr "Tanggal Awal Interim"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_65_advjjul
msgid "Inventory Held on Consignment Testing (if applicable)"
msgstr "Pengujian Persediaan Titipan (jika berlaku)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_66_5xfirch
msgid "Inventory Purchase Commitments (if applicable)"
msgstr "Komitmen Pembelian Persediaan (jika berlaku)"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_57_d30gwt1
msgid "Inventory Reconciliation Testing"
msgstr "Pengujian Rekonsiliasi Persediaan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1239_caxsote
msgid ""
"Investigate any current tax expenses associated with related parties to "
"ensure they are properly disclosed and accounted for according to applicable"
" standards."
msgstr ""
