#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_408_n68mxge
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of accruals and other payables, including descriptions, amounts, and calculation methods."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci akrual dan utang lain termasuk deskripsi, jumlah, dan metode perhitungan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_629_qvloowf
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of all long-term borrowings, including details such as principal amount, interest rate, maturity date, repayment terms, and any collateral requirements."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci seluruh pinjaman jangka panjang termasuk pokok, suku bunga, jatuh tempo, syarat pelunasan, dan persyaratan agunan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_757_6f1be5t
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of all other long-term liabilities, including descriptions, amounts, and supporting calculations."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci liabilitas jangka panjang lainnya termasuk deskripsi, jumlah, dan perhitungan pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_651_2zufaet
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of all outstanding convertible bonds, including issue date, principal amount, interest rate, conversion terms, and maturity date."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci seluruh obligasi konversi beredar termasuk tanggal terbit, pokok, suku bunga, syarat konversi, dan jatuh tempo."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_589_inqlylm
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of bank borrowings, including the principal amount, interest rate, maturity date, repayment schedule, and any collateral."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci pinjaman bank termasuk pokok, suku bunga, jatuh tempo, jadwal pelunasan, dan agunan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_428_9hpi9ic
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of contract liabilities, including descriptions, amounts, contract terms, performance obligations, and release dates."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci kewajiban kontrak termasuk deskripsi, jumlah, ketentuan, kewajiban pelaksanaan, dan tanggal pelepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_853_h4gmei2
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of convertible bonds issued, including the split between liability and equity components."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci obligasi konversi diterbitkan termasuk pemisahan komponen liabilitas dan ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1227_z71rmyi
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of current tax expenses for the reporting period, including amounts calculated for each jurisdiction."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci beban pajak kini periode pelaporan termasuk jumlah per yurisdiksi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_257_xgsil5d
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of deferred tax assets, including the underlying temporary differences, tax losses, and credits carried forward."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci aset pajak tangguhan termasuk perbedaan temporer, rugi pajak, dan kredit yang dibawa ke depan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1245_0l243zy
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of deferred tax expenses for the reporting period, including the components of deferred tax assets and liabilities."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci beban pajak tangguhan periode pelaporan termasuk komponen aset dan liabilitas pajak tangguhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_702_nho7nom
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of deferred tax liabilities, including descriptions of underlying temporary differences, applicable tax rates, and total DTL for each difference."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci liabilitas pajak tangguhan termasuk deskripsi perbedaan temporer, tarif pajak berlaku, dan total DTL tiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1149_j2kt3ge
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of depreciation and amortization expenses, listing each asset or asset category, useful life, depreciation/amortization method, and expense for the period."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci beban depresiasi/amortisasi memuat tiap aset atau kategori, umur manfaat, metode, dan beban periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_609_r1asq97
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of finance lease liabilities, including the asset description, initial recognition date, lease term, interest rate, maturity date, and payment amounts."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci liabilitas sewa pembiayaan termasuk deskripsi aset, tanggal pengakuan, masa sewa, suku bunga, jatuh tempo, dan jumlah pembayaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1171_7vsopz3
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of interest expense for the reporting period, including amounts broken down by type of debt (e.g., short-term loans, long-term loans, bonds)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci beban bunga periode pelaporan termasuk pemecahan per jenis utang (pinjaman jangka pendek, jangka panjang, obligasi)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1007_zrioaw7
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of interest income for the period, breaking down income by source (e.g., loans, investments, deposits)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci pendapatan bunga periode dengan pemecahan sumber (pinjaman, investasi, deposito)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_211_151l6o6
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of investments in associates, including the ownership percentage, carrying value, and reconciliation of the investment account for the period."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci investasi pada entitas asosiasi termasuk persentase kepemilikan, nilai tercatat, dan rekonsiliasi akun investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_528_x8y9tr5
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of liabilities included in disposal groups and reconcile it with the general ledger and financial statements."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci liabilitas dalam kelompok lepasan dan rekonsiliasi dengan buku besar serta laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1191_itlgg2f
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of other expenses for the reporting period, including amounts broken down by category (e.g., selling, general and administrative expenses)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci beban lain periode pelaporan termasuk pemecahan kategori (penjualan, umum & administrasi)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_675_ngozu1a
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of post-employment benefit obligations, including amounts recognized for each plan, current and non-current portions, and related assumptions."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci kewajiban imbalan pasca-kerja termasuk jumlah tiap rencana, porsi lancar/tidak lancar, dan asumsi terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1209_tmg2ghi
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of profit or loss for discontinued operations for the reporting period, including revenue, expenses, gains, and losses."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci laba/rugi operasi dihentikan periode pelaporan termasuk pendapatan, beban, laba, rugi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_468_azgtssd
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of provisions, including descriptions, amounts, calculation methods, supporting evidence, and basis for recognition."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci provisi termasuk deskripsi, jumlah, metode hitung, bukti pendukung, dan dasar pengakuan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_784_n0teqeo
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of share capital, including authorized, issued, and outstanding shares for each class (e.g., common, preferred)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci modal saham termasuk saham disetujui, diterbitkan, dan beredar per kelas (biasa, preferen)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1053_zyc1s60
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of the entity’s investment in associates and joint ventures, including each entity’s carrying amount, share of profit or loss, ownership percentage, and other relevant details."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci investasi entitas pada asosiasi & ventura bersama termasuk nilai tercatat, bagian laba/rugi, persentase kepemilikan, dan rincian relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_831_p5cl3kg
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of treasury shares, including the number of shares repurchased, repurchase prices, and total cost."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci saham treasuri termasuk jumlah saham dibeli kembali, harga buyback, dan total biaya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_941_ys8ni6t
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule of unappropriated retained earnings and reconcile it to the general ledger to confirm accuracy."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci laba ditahan tidak dialokasikan dan rekonsiliasi ke buku besar untuk konfirmasi akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_368_j4rlnyo
msgid "Obtain a detailed schedule that includes acquisition dates, carrying amounts, amortization (if applicable), and supporting documentation."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci memuat tanggal perolehan, nilai tercatat, amortisasi (jika ada), dan dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_548_qr9265f
msgid "Obtain a management representation letter confirming that liabilities classified in the disposal group meet criteria for classification and that management has the intent to complete the disposal."
msgstr "Peroleh surat pernyataan manajemen yang menegaskan liabilitas kelompok lepasan memenuhi kriteria dan manajemen berniat menyelesaikan pelepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_233_vsc1n1y
msgid "Obtain a schedule detailing each joint venture, including ownership percentage, carrying value, and a reconciliation of the investment account for the period."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci tiap ventura bersama termasuk persentase kepemilikan, nilai tercatat, dan rekonsiliasi akun investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1029_zow7fhd
msgid "Obtain a schedule detailing each type of non-interest revenue, including service fees, royalties, dividends, and rental income."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal rinci tiap jenis pendapatan non-bunga termasuk fee jasa, royalti, dividen, dan pendapatan sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1123_6ne87e1
msgid "Obtain a schedule of G&A expenses by category, such as rent, utilities, professional fees, and office supplies."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal beban G&A per kategori seperti sewa, utilitas, honor profesional, perlengkapan kantor."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_873_y90lx5c
msgid "Obtain a schedule of NCI transactions, including acquisitions or disposals of NCI, dividends, and allocations of profit or loss to NCI."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal transaksi NCI termasuk akuisisi/pelepasan NCI, dividen, dan alokasi laba/rugi ke NCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_895_b6o8x4m
msgid "Obtain a schedule of OCI transactions and reconcile it with the general ledger to confirm completeness and accuracy."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal transaksi OCI dan rekonsiliasi dengan buku besar untuk konfirmasi kelengkapan dan akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_919_d15dv6v
msgid "Obtain a schedule of appropriated retained earnings, showing each appropriation’s purpose, amount, and approval date."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal laba ditahan dialokasikan menampilkan tujuan, jumlah, dan tanggal persetujuan tiap apropriasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_448_d9bebf2
msgid "Obtain a schedule of bank overdrafts, including bank name, account number, balance, and overdraft limit for each overdraft facility."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal cerukan bank termasuk nama bank, nomor akun, saldo, dan limit cerukan tiap fasilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1107_bsvdmyy
msgid "Obtain a schedule of bonuses and incentive payments and select a sample to test for accuracy and authorization."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal bonus dan insentif lalu pilih sampel untuk uji akurasi dan otorisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_569_as014t9
msgid "Obtain a schedule of non-trade payables, detailing the nature, amount, due date, and vendor for each payable."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal utang non-usaha merinci sifat, jumlah, jatuh tempo, dan vendor tiap utang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_191_6wxa6vs
msgid "Obtain a schedule of non-trade receivables, detailing the nature, balances, and terms of each receivable (e.g., employee advances, loans)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal piutang non-usaha merinci sifat, saldo, dan ketentuan tiap piutang (uang muka karyawan, pinjaman)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_173_t8lcioh
msgid "Obtain a schedule of other current assets, detailing the nature and balances of each item, such as advances, deposits, and other receivables."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal aset lancar lain merinci sifat dan saldo tiap item (uang muka, deposit, piutang lain)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_549_b3g069h
msgid "Obtain a schedule of other current liabilities, detailing the nature, amount, and maturity date for each liability."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal kewajiban lancar lain merinci sifat, jumlah, dan tanggal jatuh tempo tiap liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1081_znvw5ei
msgid "Obtain a schedule of overhead costs allocated to the cost of revenues and review the basis for allocation (e.g., direct labor hours or machine hours)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal biaya overhead dialokasikan ke biaya pendapatan dan tinjau basis alokasi (jam tenaga kerja langsung, jam mesin)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_155_one8ncj
msgid "Obtain a schedule of prepaid taxes, detailing the nature of each prepaid tax (e.g., income tax, VAT) and the allocation of each payment to the relevant periods."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal pajak dibayar di muka merinci sifat tiap pajak (PPh, PPN) dan alokasi pembayaran ke periode relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1131_t5g8yxo
msgid "Obtain a schedule of professional fees (e.g., legal, audit, consulting) and select a sample to verify authorization and purpose."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal honor profesional (legal, audit, konsultan) dan pilih sampel untuk verifikasi otorisasi serta tujuan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_303_c662pfu
msgid "Obtain a schedule of right-of-use assets that includes each lease’s acquisition date, lease term, lease payments, and net book value."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal aset hak-guna memuat tanggal perolehan sewa, masa sewa, pembayaran sewa, dan nilai buku neto."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_488_gtk8x02
msgid "Obtain a schedule of short-term employee benefit liabilities, including accrued wages, salaries, bonuses, vacation, and other benefits."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal liabilitas imbalan kerja jangka pendek termasuk upah, gaji, bonus, cuti terakru, dan manfaat lain."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_508_792a2r5
msgid "Obtain a schedule of taxes payable, including all types of taxes (e.g., income tax, payroll tax, sales tax, withholding tax)."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal utang pajak mencakup semua jenis pajak (PPh, pajak penggajian, pajak penjualan, pajak potong)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_496_49if07p
msgid "Obtain an Interest Income Schedule"
msgstr "Peroleh Jadwal Pendapatan Bunga"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_362_ik2250b
msgid "Obtain and Review Loan Agreements"
msgstr "Peroleh dan Tinjau Perjanjian Pinjaman"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_507_rl8v1g1
msgid "Obtain and Review Revenue Breakdown Schedule"
msgstr "Peroleh dan Tinjau Jadwal Rincian Pendapatan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_3_4f1udcj
msgid "Obtain and review bank reconciliations for all cash accounts, ensuring they are completed and independently reviewed."
msgstr "Peroleh dan tinjau rekonsiliasi bank semua akun kas, pastikan selesai dan ditinjau independen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_677_kcwcrsx
msgid "Obtain and review the actuarial valuation report, focusing on assumptions such as discount rates, salary growth, mortality rates, and employee turnover rates."
msgstr "Peroleh dan tinjau laporan valuasi aktuaria fokus pada asumsi (diskonto, pertumbuhan gaji, mortalitas, turnover karyawan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_130_6modohw
msgid "Obtain confirmations from consignees for inventory held at their locations to verify quantities and terms."
msgstr "Peroleh konfirmasi dari pihak titipan atas persediaan di lokasi mereka untuk verifikasi kuantitas dan ketentuan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_532_9ypf9us
msgid "Obtain documentation supporting the disposal plan, such as board minutes, management memos, or sale agreements."
msgstr "Peroleh dokumentasi pendukung rencana pelepasan (risalah dewan, memo manajemen, perjanjian penjualan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_91_a48uy5m
msgid "Obtain market data to independently verify fair values of derivatives as of the balance sheet date for exchange-traded derivatives."
msgstr "Peroleh data pasar untuk verifikasi independen nilai wajar derivatif yang diperdagangkan bursa pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1057_ldci5lp
msgid "Obtain the audited financial statements (or unaudited if applicable) of each associate or joint venture and confirm that the reported profit or loss is consistent with the share recognized by the entity."
msgstr "Peroleh laporan keuangan diaudit (atau tidak diaudit bila berlaku) tiap asosiasi/ventura bersama dan konfirmasi konsistensi laba/rugi dengan bagian entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_279_xxtwb6o
msgid "Obtain the detailed fixed asset register, including descriptions, locations, acquisition costs, accumulated depreciation, and net book values."
msgstr "Peroleh register aset tetap rinci termasuk deskripsi, lokasi, biaya perolehan, akumulasi depresiasi, dan nilai buku neto."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_323_0xy1h53
msgid "Obtain the detailed intangible asset register, including acquisition dates, useful lives, amortization methods, and carrying amounts."
msgstr "Peroleh register aset tak berwujud rinci termasuk tanggal perolehan, umur manfaat, metode amortisasi, dan nilai tercatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_971_7r43o25
msgid "Obtain the financial statements of each subsidiary with NCI and confirm that balances and transactions align with consolidated NCI records."
msgstr "Peroleh laporan keuangan tiap entitas anak dengan NCI dan konfirmasi keselarasan saldo dan transaksi dengan catatan NCI konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_344_mkp8gac
msgid "Obtain the investment property register, including acquisition dates, locations, fair values (or carrying amounts if using cost model), and any rental income generated."
msgstr "Peroleh register properti investasi termasuk tanggal perolehan, lokasi, nilai wajar (atau nilai tercatat jika model biaya), dan pendapatan sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_237_9aclwun
msgid "Obtain the latest audited financial statements of the joint venture to verify the accuracy of the share of profits or losses recorded."
msgstr "Peroleh laporan keuangan diaudit terbaru ventura bersama untuk verifikasi akurasi bagian laba/rugi yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_215_susfnhb
msgid "Obtain the most recent audited financial statements of the associate and review them to confirm the accuracy of the share of profits/losses recorded."
msgstr "Peroleh laporan keuangan diaudit terbaru entitas asosiasi dan tinjau untuk konfirmasi akurasi bagian laba/rugi yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_135_40vx64v
msgid "Obtain the prepayment schedule and agree it to the general ledger to ensure completeness and accuracy."
msgstr "Peroleh jadwal prabayar dan cocokkan dengan buku besar untuk memastikan kelengkapan dan akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_5_oswvw2a
msgid "Obtain the year-end bank statements and a few months of subsequent statements for all cash accounts."
msgstr "Peroleh rekening koran akhir tahun dan beberapa bulan berikutnya untuk semua akun kas."

