#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299_detail__diff
msgid "Percentage difference between audited and previous balances."
msgstr "Persentase selisih antara saldo diaudit dan saldo sebelumnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_530_c9wuomj
msgid "Perform Analytical Procedures on Cost Trends"
msgstr "Lakukan Prosedur Analitis atas Tren Biaya"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_571_4htlwsz
msgid "Perform Analytical Procedures on Depreciation and Amortization Expenses"
msgstr "Lakukan Prosedur Analitis atas Beban Depresiasi dan Amortisasi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_497_5ob1jjv
msgid "Perform Analytical Procedures on Interest Income"
msgstr "Lakukan Prosedur Analitis atas Pendapatan Bunga"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_522_70fhkhn
msgid "Perform Analytical Procedures on Recorded Profit or Loss"
msgstr "Lakukan Prosedur Analitis atas Laba/Rugi yang Dicatat"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_508_i59qswm
msgid "Perform Analytical Procedures on Revenue Trends"
msgstr "Lakukan Prosedur Analitis atas Tren Pendapatan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_468_on2qr9k
msgid "Perform Analytical Review of Retained Earnings"
msgstr "Lakukan Tinjauan Analitis atas Laba Ditahan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_486_038jgu8
msgid "Perform Analytical Review of Revenue Trends"
msgstr "Lakukan Tinjauan Analitis atas Tren Pendapatan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_555_5y9qk7j
msgid "Perform Analytical Review on G&A Expense Trends"
msgstr "Lakukan Tinjauan Analitis atas Tren Beban G&A"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_542_rsuo2al
msgid "Perform Analytical Review on Payroll Expenses"
msgstr "Lakukan Tinjauan Analitis atas Beban Penggajian"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_289_szt8hj8
msgid "Perform a physical inspection of a sample of fixed assets to confirm their existence and consistency with the fixed asset register."
msgstr "Lakukan inspeksi fisik sampel aset tetap untuk konfirmasi keberadaan dan konsistensi dengan register."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_356_adpoq2g
msgid "Perform a physical inspection of a sample of investment properties to confirm their existence and consistency with the investment property register."
msgstr "Lakukan inspeksi fisik sampel properti investasi untuk konfirmasi keberadaan dan konsistensi dengan register."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1010_81ryglg
msgid ""
"Perform a reasonableness test, calculating expected interest income based on"
" known interest rates and average balances, and investigate any significant "
"discrepancies."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan uji kewajaran dengan menghitung pendapatan bunga yang diharapkan "
"berdasarkan suku bunga yang diketahui dan saldo rata‑rata, serta selidiki setiap "
"selisih signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_824_csdjnwg
msgid ""
"Perform a reconciliation of total equity components, ensuring that APIC "
"aligns with share capital and any other premiums recorded."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan rekonsiliasi seluruh komponen ekuitas, pastikan APIC selaras dengan modal "
"saham dan setiap agio lain yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_819_mm4pzwu
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing APIC balances with prior periods, "
"noting any significant changes or trends in share issuances and APIC levels."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo APIC dengan periode sebelumnya, "
"catat perubahan atau tren signifikan dalam penerbitan saham dan tingkat APIC."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_396_90uby1r
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing accounts payable balances with "
"prior periods, budgeted amounts, or industry benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo utang usaha dengan periode "
"sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, atau tolok ukur industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_416_bxwuemr
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing accrual balances to prior periods,"
" budgeted amounts, and expectations based on past transactions."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo akrual terhadap periode sebelumnya, "
"jumlah yang dianggarkan, dan ekspektasi berdasarkan transaksi masa lalu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_496_6gehjil
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing accrued employee benefits to prior"
" periods, budgeted amounts, or historical trends."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan manfaat karyawan terakru dengan periode "
"sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, atau tren historis."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_687_lxggjup
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing benefit obligations, service "
"costs, interest costs, and actuarial gains/losses with prior periods and "
"budget expectations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan kewajiban imbalan, biaya jasa, biaya bunga, "
"serta laba/rugi aktuaria dengan periode sebelumnya dan ekspektasi anggaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_436_x49obbg
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing contract liability balances to "
"prior periods, budgeted amounts, and expected revenue recognition."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo kewajiban kontrak dengan periode "
"sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, dan pengakuan pendapatan yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_382_v3db7nc
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing current and prior year balances, "
"additions, disposals, and amortization or impairment adjustments to identify"
" significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo tahun berjalan dan sebelumnya, "
"penambahan, pelepasan, serta amortisasi atau penyesuaian penurunan nilai untuk mengidentifikasi "
"perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_557_ospxrpm
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing current liabilities to prior "
"periods, budgeted amounts, or expected liabilities given the company’s "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan kewajiban lancar terhadap periode sebelumnya, "
"jumlah yang dianggarkan, atau kewajiban yang diharapkan sesuai operasi perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_299_q23iee0
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing current period asset additions, "
"disposals, and depreciation expense with prior periods and budgeted amounts."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan penambahan aset, pelepasan, dan beban depresiasi periode berjalan "
"dengan periode sebelumnya dan jumlah yang dianggarkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_803_s7ifbso
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing current-period share capital "
"balances with prior periods, considering any significant changes due to "
"share issuances or redemptions."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo modal saham periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya, "
"mempertimbangkan perubahan signifikan akibat penerbitan atau penebusan saham."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_724_h5rv065
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing deferred tax liability balances "
"with prior periods and budget expectations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo liabilitas pajak tangguhan dengan periode sebelumnya dan ekspektasi anggaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_619_zrhfcs3
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing finance lease liabilities with "
"prior periods, the current asset base, and industry benchmarks to identify "
"any unusual fluctuations or trends."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan liabilitas sewa pembiayaan terhadap periode sebelumnya, basis aset kini, "
"dan tolok ukur industri untuk mengidentifikasi fluktuasi atau tren yang tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_340_cjerxhp
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing intangible asset balances, "
"amortization, and impairment with prior periods and budgeted amounts."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo aset tak berwujud, amortisasi, dan penurunan nilai dengan periode sebelumnya dan jumlah yang dianggarkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_776_z1x2zab
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing long-term liability balances with "
"prior periods, budget forecasts, or industry benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo liabilitas jangka panjang dengan periode sebelumnya, prakiraan anggaran, atau tolok ukur industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_577_08j5wg4
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing non-trade payables to prior "
"periods, budgeted amounts, or anticipated non-trade liabilities given the "
"company’s activities."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan utang non‑usaha terhadap periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, "
"atau kewajiban non‑usaha yang diantisipasi sesuai aktivitas perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_639_5wqudil
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing outstanding balances, interest "
"rates, and interest expenses with prior periods, budgeted amounts, or "
"expected financing needs."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo terutang, suku bunga, dan beban bunga dengan periode sebelumnya, angka anggaran, atau kebutuhan pembiayaan yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_478_rjq9mvk
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing provision balances to prior "
"periods, budgeted amounts, or industry benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo provisi terhadap periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, atau tolok ukur industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_742_yaswiz9
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing subordinated loan balances and "
"interest expense with prior periods and budget expectations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo pinjaman subordinasi dan beban bunga terhadap periode sebelumnya serta ekspektasi anggaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_516_364m47l
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing taxes payable to prior periods, "
"budgeted amounts, or revenue growth."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan utang pajak terhadap periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang dianggarkan, atau pertumbuhan pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_885_dq9mp4b
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the NCI balance and related "
"changes with prior periods, considering any acquisitions, disposals, or "
"dividends paid."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo NCI dan perubahan terkait dengan periode sebelumnya, mempertimbangkan akuisisi, pelepasan, atau dividen yang dibayar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_253_tozd9ta
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the balance of the joint venture "
"investment to prior periods and investigating any significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo investasi ventura bersama terhadap periode sebelumnya dan selidiki perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_319_2syjchl
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the current and prior year ROU "
"asset balances, amortization, and additions/disposals to identify "
"significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo aset ROU tahun berjalan dan sebelumnya, amortisasi, serta penambahan/pelepasan untuk mengidentifikasi perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_364_siwd4ie
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the current and prior year "
"investment property balances, fair value adjustments, and rental income to "
"identify significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo properti investasi tahun berjalan dan sebelumnya, penyesuaian nilai wajar, serta pendapatan sewa untuk mengidentifikasi perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_861_hm7dl49
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the equity component balances with"
" prior periods, considering any new bond issuances or conversions."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo komponen ekuitas terhadap periode sebelumnya, mempertimbangkan penerbitan atau konversi obligasi baru."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_931_nzuhtyd
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing the total appropriated retained "
"earnings with prior periods, considering any changes in company policy or "
"board resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan total laba ditahan yang dialokasikan terhadap periode sebelumnya, mempertimbangkan perubahan kebijakan perusahaan atau keputusan dewan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_839_wo8dk7c
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review by comparing treasury share balances with prior"
" periods, considering any significant buyback programs or changes in share "
"repurchases."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo saham treasuri terhadap periode sebelumnya, mempertimbangkan program buyback signifikan atau perubahan pembelian kembali saham."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_909_5b1y37e
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review comparing OCI components with prior periods, "
"noting any significant changes or unusual trends."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan komponen OCI dengan periode sebelumnya, catat perubahan signifikan atau tren tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_667_0gpffdq
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review comparing convertible bond balances, interest "
"expenses, and conversions with prior periods, budget expectations, and "
"similar debt instruments."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis dengan membandingkan saldo obligasi konversi, beban bunga, dan konversi terhadap periode sebelumnya, ekspektasi anggaran, dan instrumen utang serupa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_275_te7x0an
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review of DTA balances, comparing current and prior "
"year balances and investigating any significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis atas saldo DTA dengan membandingkan saldo tahun berjalan dan sebelumnya serta menyelidiki perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1125_pgamrl2
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review of G&A expenses compared to prior periods, "
"budget, and any benchmarks or industry averages."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis atas beban G&A dibanding periode sebelumnya, anggaran, dan tolok ukur atau rata‑rata industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_975_i6lynhl
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review of NCI by comparing current and prior period "
"NCI balances, considering ownership changes, earnings trends, and dividend "
"distributions."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis atas NCI dengan membandingkan saldo NCI periode berjalan dan sebelumnya, mempertimbangkan perubahan kepemilikan, tren laba, dan distribusi dividen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_599_4j9twcz
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review of borrowings by comparing outstanding "
"balances, interest rates, and interest expense with prior periods or "
"budgeted amounts."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis atas pinjaman dengan membandingkan saldo terutang, suku bunga, dan beban bunga terhadap periode sebelumnya atau angka anggaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_229_mwzavby
msgid ""
"Perform an analytical review of the investment balance by comparing it to "
"prior periods and investigating any significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan tinjauan analitis atas saldo investasi dengan membandingkan ke periode sebelumnya dan selidiki setiap perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_165_wfkxruq
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures by comparing the prepaid tax balance to prior "
"periods and to expected tax rates."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis dengan membandingkan saldo pajak dibayar di muka terhadap periode sebelumnya dan terhadap tarif pajak yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1271_131prsn
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1287_zmje9o4
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on OCI items compared to prior periods, "
"expected amounts based on changes in relevant assumptions, and other "
"financial indicators."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas item OCI dibanding periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang diharapkan berdasarkan perubahan asumsi relevan, serta indikator keuangan lainnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_15_rp0z9gf
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on cash balances to detect unusual "
"fluctuations compared to prior periods."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas saldo kas untuk mendeteksi fluktuasi tidak biasa dibanding periode sebelumnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1235_rurpnxd
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on current tax expenses compared to prior "
"periods, expected amounts based on income levels, and tax rates."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas beban pajak kini dibanding periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang diharapkan berdasarkan tingkat laba, serta tarif pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1253_ay6d0sm
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on deferred tax expenses compared to prior "
"periods, expected amounts based on income levels, and tax rates."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas beban pajak tangguhan dibanding periode sebelumnya, jumlah yang diharapkan berdasarkan tingkat laba, serta tarif pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_73_nhckuy5
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on financial assets, comparing balances to "
"prior periods, budgeted amounts, or market indices."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas aset keuangan dengan membandingkan saldo ke periode sebelumnya, angka anggaran, atau indeks pasar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1181_cvmtf8g
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on interest expense trends compared to prior "
"periods, expected financing needs, and significant borrowings."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas tren beban bunga dibanding periode sebelumnya, kebutuhan pembiayaan yang diharapkan, dan pinjaman signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1217_5xnc17h
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on profit or loss from discontinued operations"
" compared to prior periods, expected results, and budgets."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas laba/rugi operasi yang dihentikan dibanding periode sebelumnya, hasil yang diharapkan, dan anggaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1199_d7q9bv2
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures on trends in other expenses compared to prior "
"periods, budgeted amounts, and expected operational activity."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis atas tren beban lain dibanding periode sebelumnya, angka anggaran, dan aktivitas operasional yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_31_wz8thi3
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures to assess the reasonableness of accounts "
"receivable balances compared to prior periods and industry benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis untuk menilai kewajaran saldo piutang usaha dibanding periode sebelumnya dan tolok ukur industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_107_1bc9efi
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures to assess the reasonableness of derivative "
"balances compared to prior periods, hedge objectives, or risk exposure."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis untuk menilai kewajaran saldo derivatif dibanding periode sebelumnya, tujuan lindung nilai, atau eksposur risiko."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_203_spz3jr0
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures to assess the reasonableness of non-trade "
"receivables by comparing current period balances to prior periods and "
"investigating any significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis menilai kewajaran piutang non‑usaha dengan membandingkan saldo periode berjalan ke periode sebelumnya dan menyelidiki perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_183_j2qqm0o
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures to assess the reasonableness of other current "
"assets by comparing current period balances to prior periods and "
"investigating any significant changes."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis menilai kewajaran aset lancar lainnya dengan membandingkan saldo periode berjalan ke periode sebelumnya dan menyelidiki perubahan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_53_zx2y58g
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures to detect unusual trends or fluctuations in "
"contract asset balances compared to prior periods or expectations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis untuk mendeteksi tren atau fluktuasi tidak biasa pada saldo aset kontrak dibanding periode sebelumnya atau ekspektasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_145_i1rx8dg
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures, such as comparing current period prepayment "
"balances to prior periods and investigating any significant fluctuations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis seperti membandingkan saldo prabayar periode berjalan dengan periode sebelumnya dan selidiki fluktuasi signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_123_7sky3s2
msgid ""
"Perform analytical procedures, such as inventory turnover ratio analysis, to"
" assess inventory levels relative to sales and purchases."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur analitis seperti analisis rasio perputaran persediaan untuk menilai tingkat persediaan relatif terhadap penjualan dan pembelian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1059_afonzbi
msgid ""
"Perform analytical review procedures to assess the reasonableness of the "
"recorded share of profit or loss, considering the associate’s or joint "
"venture’s prior-year performance, industry trends, or recent changes in "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur tinjauan analitis untuk menilai kewajaran bagian laba/rugi yang dicatat dengan mempertimbangkan kinerja tahun sebelumnya entitas asosiasi atau ventura bersama, tren industri, atau perubahan operasional terkini."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1075_s8j5mp2
msgid ""
"Perform analytical review procedures to compare cost of revenues to prior "
"periods, revenue trends, and industry averages."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur tinjauan analitis untuk membandingkan biaya pendapatan dengan periode sebelumnya, tren pendapatan, dan rata‑rata industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1099_wdjagu6
msgid ""
"Perform analytical review procedures to compare payroll expenses to prior "
"periods, headcount changes, and industry averages."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur tinjauan analitis membandingkan beban penggajian dengan periode sebelumnya, perubahan jumlah karyawan, dan rata‑rata industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1031_blgpqsb
msgid ""
"Perform analytical review procedures to compare revenue types to prior "
"periods, budgeted amounts, or industry benchmarks."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan prosedur tinjauan analitis untuk membandingkan jenis pendapatan dengan periode sebelumnya, angka anggaran, atau tolok ukur industri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_7_8m6rsy3
msgid ""
"Perform cutoff testing to ensure that cash transactions near year-end are "
"recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan pengujian cutoff untuk memastikan transaksi kas dekat akhir tahun dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1137_k0w4kg2
msgid ""
"Perform cutoff testing to verify that expenses recorded near the end of the "
"period are in the correct reporting period."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan pengujian cutoff untuk memverifikasi bahwa beban yang dicatat dekat akhir periode berada dalam periode pelaporan yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_537_pnq85d1
msgid ""
"Perform inquiries with management and review transaction records around the "
"reporting period to identify potential liabilities omitted from the disposal"
" group classification."
msgstr ""
"Lakukan permintaan keterangan kepada manajemen dan tinjau catatan transaksi sekitar periode pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas potensial yang terlewat dari klasifikasi kelompok lepasan."

