msgstr "Tinjau Dokumentasi Pendukung Transaksi OCI"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_399_j5ea1g6
msgid "Review Supporting Documentation for Share Issuances Above Par"
msgstr "Tinjau Dokumentasi Pendukung Penerbitan Saham di Atas Nominal"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_387_9cih6oh
msgid "Review Supporting Documentation for Share Transactions"
msgstr "Tinjau Dokumentasi Pendukung Transaksi Saham"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__review_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__review_time
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__review_time
msgid "Review Time"
msgstr "Waktu Review"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_127_mndcr0z
msgid ""
"Review WIP balances by tracing to supporting documentation, such as "
"production reports or labor and material requisitions."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau saldo WIP dengan menelusuri ke dokumentasi pendukung seperti laporan produksi "
"atau permintaan tenaga kerja dan material."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_33_0u04sig
msgid ""
"Review a sample of credit memos and adjustments issued during the period to "
"ensure they are properly authorized and accurately recorded."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel memo kredit dan penyesuaian yang diterbitkan selama periode untuk memastikan "
"telah diotorisasi dengan benar dan dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_149_0rqc13z
msgid ""
"Review a sample of expense invoices to ensure that prepaid items have been "
"correctly recorded as assets rather than expenses."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel faktur beban untuk memastikan item prabayar telah dicatat sebagai aset "
"bukan sebagai beban."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_445_90ckc6b
msgid ""
"Review a sample of long-term contract liabilities and ensure that any "
"amortization or revenue recognition schedules are accurate."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel kewajiban kontrak jangka panjang dan pastikan jadwal amortisasi atau "
"pengakuan pendapatan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1119_ng1vluo
msgid ""
"Review a sample of manual adjustments or journal entries related to payroll "
"expense, focusing on significant or unusual entries."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel penyesuaian manual atau entri jurnal terkait beban penggajian, fokus pada entri yang signifikan atau tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1145_760ejud
msgid ""
"Review a sample of manual journal entries affecting G&A expenses, especially"
" those for significant or unusual items."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel entri jurnal manual yang mempengaruhi beban G&A, terutama untuk item signifikan atau tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1091_txd347e
msgid ""
"Review a sample of manual journal entries impacting cost of revenues, "
"focusing on significant or unusual entries."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel entri jurnal manual yang mempengaruhi biaya pendapatan, fokus pada entri signifikan atau tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1161_80cfudk
msgid ""
"Review a sample of manual journal entries related to depreciation and "
"amortization, especially those that adjust the expense."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel entri jurnal manual terkait depresiasi dan amortisasi, terutama yang melakukan penyesuaian beban."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_420_o1ap5d9
msgid ""
"Review a sample of prior period accruals that were reversed in the current "
"period to ensure they were appropriately reversed and that no double-"
"counting or omission occurred."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel akrual periode sebelumnya yang dibalik pada periode berjalan untuk "
"memastikan pembalikan tepat dan tidak terjadi penghitungan ganda atau kelalaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_99_fjgde2c
msgid ""
"Review a sample of realized and unrealized gains and losses on derivatives, "
"ensuring accuracy and proper classification in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau sampel laba rugi terealisasi dan belum terealisasi atas derivatif, memastikan akurasi dan klasifikasi yang tepat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_596_u64zlnw
msgid ""
"Review accrued interest at the reporting date and recalculate it based on "
"the loan agreements, verifying that it is accurately recorded as a current "
"liability if due within 12 months."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau bunga terakru pada tanggal pelaporan dan hitung ulang berdasarkan perjanjian pinjaman, verifikasi pencatatan sebagai liabilitas lancar bila jatuh tempo dalam 12 bulan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_616_s8n64tv
msgid ""
"Review accrued interest on lease liabilities as of the reporting date and "
"confirm that it is accurately recorded based on the interest rate and "
"outstanding liability balance."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau bunga terakru atas liabilitas sewa pada tanggal pelaporan dan konfirmasi pencatatan akurat berdasarkan suku bunga serta saldo liabilitas terutang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_217_aka9j8s
msgid ""
"Review adjustments recorded under the equity method, including the share of "
"the associate’s profits/losses and dividends received."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penyesuaian yang dicatat dengan metode ekuitas termasuk bagian laba/rugi entitas asosiasi dan dividen yang diterima."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_245_4r5dy9k
msgid "Review and Recalculate Accrued Liabilities"
msgstr "Tinjau dan Hitung Ulang Liabilitas Terakru"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_570_uxtx4p4
msgid "Review and Test Useful Life and Residual Value Estimates"
msgstr "Tinjau dan Uji Estimasi Umur Manfaat dan Nilai Residu"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_665_pvz620a
msgid ""
"Review any conversions that occurred during the period, confirming that they"
" were recorded accurately, with the reduction in debt and increase in equity"
" properly reflected in the financial statements."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap konversi yang terjadi selama periode, konfirmasi pencatatan akurat serta penurunan utang dan peningkatan ekuitas tercermin dengan benar dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_627_b6lbvj7
msgid ""
"Review any covenants related to finance lease liabilities to ensure "
"compliance, such as limits on additional debt or maintenance of specific "
"financial ratios."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap kovenan terkait liabilitas sewa pembiayaan untuk memastikan kepatuhan (batas penambahan utang atau pemeliharaan rasio keuangan tertentu)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_563_g85aumk
msgid ""
"Review any disclosures or liabilities related to contingent obligations, "
"such as warranties or potential litigation settlements."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan atau liabilitas terkait kewajiban kontinjensi seperti garansi atau potensi penyelesaian litigasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_228_oycftdg
msgid ""
"Review any documentation related to changes in ownership, and ensure that "
"the impact of changes on the investment valuation is correctly recorded."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi terkait perubahan kepemilikan dan pastikan dampaknya terhadap penilaian investasi dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_131_j77vfza
msgid ""
"Review any outstanding inventory purchase commitments for disclosure and "
"valuation implications."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap komitmen pembelian persediaan yang masih ada untuk implikasi pengungkapan dan penilaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_536_5gccnqo
msgid ""
"Review any prior disposal plans to confirm that all related liabilities have"
" been identified and appropriately classified."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau rencana pelepasan sebelumnya untuk mengonfirmasi semua liabilitas terkait telah diidentifikasi dan diklasifikasikan dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_915_mrbz38l
msgid ""
"Review any reclassification adjustments in OCI that may have been "
"transferred to profit or loss, such as upon sale of an available-for-sale "
"investment."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penyesuaian reklasifikasi dalam OCI yang mungkin telah dipindahkan ke laba rugi, misalnya saat penjualan investasi tersedia untuk dijual."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_39_q08nnpk
msgid ""
"Review any related party receivables to ensure they are separately disclosed"
" and properly valued."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap piutang pihak berelasi untuk memastikan diungkap terpisah dan dinilai dengan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_844_gw0wcvy
msgid ""
"Review any restrictions on the resale or retirement of treasury shares and "
"confirm compliance with any relevant provisions."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pembatasan atas penjualan kembali atau penghentian saham treasuri dan konfirmasi kepatuhan terhadap ketentuan relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_55_rsyfsbe
msgid ""
"Review any reversals or adjustments to contract asset balances to ensure "
"they are properly authorized, documented, and accurately recorded."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap pembalikan atau penyesuaian saldo aset kontrak untuk memastikan diotorisasi, didokumentasi, dan dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_538_ij02wio
msgid ""
"Review any sale or purchase agreements associated with the disposal group to"
" confirm that all related liabilities are accurately included."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau setiap perjanjian jual atau beli terkait kelompok lepasan untuk mengonfirmasi semua liabilitas terkait telah termasuk secara akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1141_w4r3nia
msgid ""
"Review any shared or allocated G&A expenses (e.g., shared corporate "
"overhead) to confirm the basis for allocation."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau beban G&A yang dibagi atau dialokasikan (mis. overhead korporat bersama) untuk mengonfirmasi dasar alokasinya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_504_e1ixsbd
msgid ""
"Review board minutes, employee agreements, or subsequent payroll "
"transactions to identify any unrecorded employee benefits liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau risalah dewan, perjanjian karyawan, atau transaksi penggajian setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas imbalan karyawan yang belum dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_637_5ic2zsx
msgid ""
"Review borrowing transactions around the period-end to ensure that any new "
"borrowings, repayments, or accrued interest are recorded in the correct "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi pinjaman sekitar akhir periode untuk memastikan pinjaman baru, pelunasan, atau bunga terakru dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_45_9pyncyb
msgid ""
"Review calculations for the percentage of completion or other methods used "
"to recognize revenue on a sample of contracts."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau perhitungan persentase penyelesaian atau metode lain yang digunakan untuk pengakuan pendapatan pada sampel kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_23_f451gco
msgid ""
"Review cash receipts after year-end to verify the accuracy and existence of "
"accounts receivable as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penerimaan kas setelah akhir tahun untuk memverifikasi akurasi dan keberadaan piutang usaha pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_69_0ghdlpw
msgid ""
"Review classification of financial assets (e.g., fair value through profit "
"or loss, fair value through other comprehensive income, amortized cost) for "
"compliance with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau klasifikasi aset keuangan (mis. nilai wajar melalui laba rugi, nilai wajar melalui OCI, biaya diamortisasi) untuk kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_795_18glaq5
msgid ""
"Review compliance with any legal or regulatory requirements governing share "
"capital, such as minimum capitalization or regulatory filings."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau kepatuhan terhadap setiap persyaratan hukum atau regulasi yang "
"mengatur modal saham, seperti ketentuan kapitalisasi minimum atau "
"pengajuan regulatori."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_57_5upsipi
msgid ""
"Review contract asset balances for any related party transactions to ensure "
"they are disclosed and valued appropriately."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau saldo aset kontrak atas setiap transaksi pihak berelasi untuk "
"memastikan telah diungkap dan dinilai secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_661_gdwdvuz
msgid ""
"Review convertible bond transactions around the period-end to ensure "
"accurate cutoff. Confirm that any new issuances, conversions, or repayments "
"are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi obligasi konversi di sekitar akhir periode untuk memastikan "
"cutoff akurat. Konfirmasi bahwa penerbitan baru, konversi, atau pelunasan "
"dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_783_bd79tdw
msgid ""
"Review correspondence with creditors or other stakeholders regarding "
"compliance status, waivers, or amendments if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau korespondensi dengan kreditur atau pemangku kepentingan lain terkait "
"status kepatuhan, dispensasi, atau amandemen bila ada."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_523_llvssec
msgid ""
"Review correspondence with tax authorities for evidence of any interest or "
"penalties due and confirm they are recorded as liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau korespondensi dengan otoritas pajak untuk bukti bunga atau denda yang "
"terutang dan konfirmasi pencatatan sebagai liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_466_ji37ms2
msgid ""
"Review covenant requirements related to overdrafts (e.g., maintenance of "
"specific ratios or minimum balances) to ensure compliance."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau persyaratan kovenan terkait cerukan (mis. pemeliharaan rasio tertentu "
"atau saldo minimum) untuk memastikan kepatuhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1047_ilvzx3d
msgid ""
"Review deferred revenue accounts to confirm that revenue is recognized over "
"the appropriate periods based on service delivery or contract milestones."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau akun pendapatan tangguhan untuk mengonfirmasi pendapatan diakui selama "
"periode yang sesuai berdasarkan penyediaan jasa atau tonggak kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1071_c5ico6t
msgid ""
"Review disclosures in the financial statements related to investments in "
"associates and joint ventures, including the entity’s share of profit or "
"loss, material transactions, and any impairment adjustments."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan terkait investasi pada entitas "
"asosiasi dan ventura bersama termasuk bagian laba/rugi entitas, transaksi "
"material, dan setiap penyesuaian penurunan nilai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1025_b6ocnu7
msgid ""
"Review disclosures related to interest income, including the types of "
"interest-bearing assets, interest rate ranges, and any significant changes "
"in interest income sources."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan terkait pendapatan bunga termasuk jenis aset berbunga, "
"rentang suku bunga, dan perubahan signifikan sumber pendapatan bunga."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_849_6l7hujj
msgid ""
"Review disclosures related to treasury shares, including information on the "
"number of shares repurchased, cost of repurchase, purpose of buybacks, and "
"impact on total equity."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan terkait saham treasuri termasuk jumlah saham dibeli "
"kembali, biaya pembelian kembali, tujuan buyback, dan dampaknya terhadap "
"total ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_954_pw18osp
msgid ""
"Review dividend declarations made after the reporting date to confirm they "
"are not recorded in the current period but disclosed as subsequent events if"
" required."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau deklarasi dividen setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengonfirmasi tidak "
"dicatat pada periode berjalan tetapi diungkap sebagai peristiwa setelah tanggal "
"pelaporan bila diperlukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_766_cd3gmqf
msgid ""
"Review documentation and invoices for liabilities incurred at the reporting "
"date to confirm that they are accurately recorded."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi dan faktur atas liabilitas yang timbul pada tanggal "
"pelaporan guna mengonfirmasi pencatatan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_738_baiubp3
msgid ""
"Review documentation and verify compliance with subordination provisions "
"(e.g., confirming that no repayments were made to subordinated lenders "
"before satisfying senior debt requirements)."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi dan verifikasi kepatuhan terhadap ketentuan subordinasi "
"(mis. memastikan tidak ada pelunasan kepada pemberi pinjaman subordinasi "
"sebelum memenuhi persyaratan utang senior)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_93_q820oo2
msgid ""
"Review documentation supporting hedge designations (e.g., fair value, cash "
"flow, or net investment hedge) to ensure compliance with accounting "
"standards."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi yang mendukung penetapan lindung nilai (mis. lindung nilai "
"nilai wajar, arus kas, atau investasi neto) untuk memastikan kepatuhan terhadap "
"standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_728_ldip050
msgid ""
"Review events after the reporting date that could impact deferred tax "
"liabilities, such as regulatory changes, acquisitions, or asset impairments."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan yang dapat memengaruhi liabilitas "
"pajak tangguhan seperti perubahan regulasi, akuisisi, atau penurunan nilai aset."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_700_75nupof
msgid ""
"Review events after the reporting date to identify any changes in plan "
"assets, new obligations, or settlements that could impact the liability."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi perubahan "
"aset program, kewajiban baru, atau penyelesaian yang dapat memengaruhi liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_755_5uuru0c
msgid ""
"Review events after the reporting date to identify any significant changes "
"to subordinated loans, such as refinancing, amendments, or repayments."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi perubahan "
"signifikan pada pinjaman subordinasi seperti refinancing, amandemen, atau pelunasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_905_12k2bbg
msgid ""
"Review fair value adjustments on available-for-sale financial assets or "
"other revalued assets included in OCI."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penyesuaian nilai wajar atas aset keuangan tersedia untuk dijual atau "
"aset direvaluasi lain yang termasuk dalam OCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_798_30ofo98
msgid ""
"Review financial statement disclosures related to share capital to ensure "
"they comply with applicable accounting standards (e.g., IFRS or GAAP), "
"including:"
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan laporan keuangan terkait modal saham untuk memastikan "
"kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi yang berlaku (mis. IFRS atau GAAP), "
"meliputi:"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_750_qzdi6t6
msgid ""
"Review financial statement disclosures related to subordinated loans, "
"ensuring compliance with accounting standards, such as:"
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan laporan keuangan terkait pinjaman subordinasi, memastikan "
"kepatuhan terhadap standar akuntansi, seperti:"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_295_2dn1gu4
msgid ""
"Review fixed asset additions and disposals around the period-end to confirm "
"proper cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penambahan dan pelepasan aset tetap sekitar akhir periode untuk "
"mengonfirmasi cutoff yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_405_5ua9dlw
msgid "Review for Compliance with Accounting Standards"
msgstr "Tinjau Kepatuhan terhadap Standar Akuntansi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_536_z50awl7
msgid "Review for Consistency in Cost Allocation Methods"
msgstr "Tinjau Konsistensi Metode Alokasi Biaya"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_199_mb38etq
msgid "Review for Duplicate Payments or Errors"
msgstr "Tinjau Pembayaran Duplikat atau Kesalahan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_210_iakuecx
msgid "Review for Reversal of Prior Period Accruals"
msgstr "Tinjau Pembalikan Akrual Periode Sebelumnya"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_221_x1843lv
msgid ""
"Review for any indicators of impairment in the investment, such as "
"significant losses, adverse market conditions, or decline in the associate’s"
" net assets."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau indikator penurunan nilai pada investasi seperti kerugian signifikan, "
"kondisi pasar tidak menguntungkan, atau penurunan aset neto entitas asosiasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_311_lu62b0y
msgid ""
"Review for indicators of impairment, such as reduced usage, sublease "
"arrangements, or adverse changes in the economic environment."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau indikator penurunan nilai seperti penurunan penggunaan, pengaturan "
"subsewa, atau perubahan lingkungan ekonomi yang merugikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_888_3sloaen
msgid ""
"Review if adjustments due to NCI changes are reflected in the equity section"
" without affecting consolidated profit or loss."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau apakah penyesuaian akibat perubahan NCI tercermin di bagian ekuitas "
"tanpa memengaruhi laba rugi konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_374_0nrz8as
msgid ""
"Review indicators of impairment for assets, such as changes in market "
"conditions or reduced economic benefits."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau indikator penurunan nilai aset seperti perubahan kondisi pasar atau "
"penurunan manfaat ekonomi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_287_fo3snk7
msgid ""
"Review indicators of impairment, such as underutilization, technological "
"obsolescence, or physical damage."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau indikator penurunan nilai seperti kurang dimanfaatkan, keusangan "
"teknologi, atau kerusakan fisik."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1017_xsrmhkf
msgid ""
"Review interest income transactions near the reporting date to confirm that "
"income is recognized in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi pendapatan bunga dekat tanggal pelaporan untuk mengonfirmasi "
"pengakuan pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_414_8df4wrn
msgid ""
"Review invoices and subsequent cash disbursements after the balance sheet "
"date to identify any unrecorded accruals at year-end."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau faktur dan pengeluaran kas setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi "
"akrual yang belum dicatat pada akhir tahun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_617_p83ghes
msgid ""
"Review lease transactions near the period-end to ensure that any newly "
"recognized or modified finance leases are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sewa dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan setiap sewa "
"pembiayaan baru atau termodifikasi dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_484_35s3naf
msgid ""
"Review legal correspondence, board minutes, or management discussions to "
"identify any potential unrecorded liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau korespondensi hukum, risalah dewan, atau diskusi manajemen untuk "
"mengidentifikasi potensi liabilitas yang belum dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_601_yb5xaqe
msgid ""
"Review loan covenants for each borrowing to identify compliance "
"requirements, such as debt-to-equity ratios, liquidity ratios, or "
"profitability thresholds."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau kovenan pinjaman tiap fasilitas untuk mengidentifikasi persyaratan "
"kepatuhan seperti rasio utang terhadap ekuitas, rasio likuiditas, atau ambang "
"profitabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_641_1fa655c
msgid ""
"Review loan covenants for each borrowing to identify compliance "
"requirements, such as leverage ratios, liquidity requirements, or other "
"financial ratios."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau kovenan pinjaman untuk mengidentifikasi persyaratan kepatuhan seperti "
"rasio leverage, persyaratan likuiditas, atau rasio keuangan lainnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_597_5fxatb9
msgid ""
"Review loan transactions near the period-end to ensure that any new "
"borrowings, repayments, or accrued interest are recorded in the correct "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi pinjaman dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan pinjaman baru, "
"pelunasan, atau bunga terakru dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1065_lhpwfx8
msgid ""
"Review management’s assessment of any potential impairment in the value of "
"the investment if the associate or joint venture is incurring losses or has "
"negative equity."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian manajemen atas potensi penurunan nilai investasi jika entitas "
"asosiasi atau ventura bersama mengalami kerugian atau ekuitas negatif."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_119_hrrv7u0
msgid ""
"Review management’s assessment of obsolete, damaged, or slow-moving "
"inventory, ensuring items are appropriately written down to net realizable "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian manajemen atas persediaan usang, rusak, atau lambat bergerak "
"memastikan item diturunkan ke nilai realisasi bersih secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_265_2gez3ep
msgid ""
"Review management’s assessment of the need for valuation allowances on "
"deferred tax assets."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian manajemen atas kebutuhan penyisihan penilaian pada aset pajak "
"tangguhan (DTA)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_332_gvlqume
msgid ""
"Review management’s assessment of useful lives and residual values for "
"intangible assets, particularly for assets such as technology or patents "
"that may have shortened useful lives."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian manajemen atas umur manfaat dan nilai residu aset tak berwujud "
"terutama aset teknologi atau paten yang mungkin memiliki umur manfaat lebih pendek."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_362_3iffkwx
msgid ""
"Review management’s assessment of useful lives and residual values, "
"particularly if properties are subject to significant changes in usage or "
"market conditions."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian manajemen atas umur manfaat dan nilai residu terutama bila "
"properti mengalami perubahan signifikan penggunaan atau kondisi pasar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_933_wl9md6r
msgid ""
"Review management’s periodic assessment of appropriated retained earnings to"
" determine if amounts continue to be needed for their designated purpose."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian berkala manajemen atas laba ditahan yang dialokasikan untuk "
"menentukan apakah jumlah tersebut masih diperlukan bagi tujuan yang ditetapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_681_8gr70kq
msgid ""
"Review management’s process for setting assumptions and perform a "
"sensitivity analysis to understand the impact of changes in key assumptions "
"(e.g., discount rate, inflation rate) on the obligation."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau proses manajemen menetapkan asumsi dan lakukan analisis sensitivitas "
"untuk memahami dampak perubahan asumsi kunci (mis. tingkat diskonto, inflasi) "
"terhadap kewajiban."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1069_bzguf3t
msgid ""
"Review manual journal entries affecting the recorded share of profit or loss"
" and the investment balance, focusing on unusual or non-recurring entries."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau entri jurnal manual yang memengaruhi bagian laba/rugi yang dicatat dan "
"saldo investasi, fokus pada entri tidak biasa atau non‑berulang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_202_tzasjct
msgid "Review of Accrued Expenses"
msgstr "Tinjau Beban Terakru"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_15_ngw41b8
msgid "Review of Aged Receivables and Allowance for Doubtful Accounts"
msgstr "Tinjau Piutang Kadaluarsa dan Cadangan Piutang Ragu‑Ragu"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_108_dnh67cb
msgid "Review of Associate’s Financial Statements"
msgstr "Tinjau Laporan Keuangan Entitas Asosiasi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_229_4keivsa
msgid "Review of Bank Reconciliations"
msgstr "Tinjau Rekonsiliasi Bank"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_9_zc69kfs
msgid "Review of Cash Restrictions"
msgstr "Tinjau Pembatasan Kas"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_114_c18b50u
msgid "Review of Changes in Ownership Percentage"
msgstr "Tinjau Perubahan Persentase Kepemilikan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_238_duatt7f
msgid "Review of Changes in Provisions"
msgstr "Tinjau Perubahan Provisi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_35_3xwy309
msgid "Review of Classification and Accounting Treatment"
msgstr "Tinjau Klasifikasi dan Perlakuan Akuntansi"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_220_wscitgf
