"Review petty cash vouchers for proper documentation, approval, and "
"completeness."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau bukti kas kecil untuk memastikan dokumentasi, persetujuan, dan "
"kelengkapannya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_685_7mrnhzv
msgid ""
"Review post-employment benefit transactions around the period-end to verify "
"that all contributions, benefit payments, and adjustments are recorded in "
"the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi imbalan pasca‑kerja sekitar akhir periode untuk memverifikasi "
"semua kontribusi, pembayaran manfaat, dan penyesuaian dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_153_cby8ikm
msgid ""
"Review prepayment balances to confirm proper classification as current or "
"non-current assets, depending on the period of benefit."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau saldo prabayar untuk mengonfirmasi klasifikasi tepat sebagai aset lancar "
"atau tidak lancar sesuai periode manfaatnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_139_245ex55
