"Review prepayment transactions recorded near the period-end to ensure they "
"are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi prabayar yang dicatat dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan "
"pencatatan pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_360_zasdg0k
