"Review property acquisitions, disposals, and rental income transactions "
"around the period-end to confirm they are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau akuisisi, pelepasan, dan transaksi pendapatan sewa properti sekitar akhir "
"periode untuk mengonfirmasi pencatatan pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_720_gjtn5j3
msgid ""
"Review recent changes in tax laws or rates that could affect deferred tax "
"liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau perubahan terbaru undang‑undang atau tarif pajak yang dapat memengaruhi "
"liabilitas pajak tangguhan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_269_1t9kotj
msgid ""
"Review recent tax law changes that may affect deferred tax assets, including"
" changes in tax rates or allowable deductions."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau perubahan terbaru peraturan pajak yang dapat memengaruhi aset pajak "
"tangguhan termasuk perubahan tarif atau pengurang yang diperbolehkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_462_hx6jumb
msgid ""
"Review subsequent bank statements after the balance sheet date to ensure all"
" overdrafts that existed at year-end have been captured."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau rekening koran bank setelah tanggal neraca untuk memastikan semua cerukan "
"akhir tahun telah dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_47_ddq47mh
msgid ""
"Review subsequent billing records to confirm that contract assets are "
"converted to receivables or revenue in a timely manner."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau catatan penagihan setelah periode untuk mengonfirmasi aset kontrak "
"dikonversi menjadi piutang atau pendapatan secara tepat waktu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_394_j8sk08b
msgid ""
"Review subsequent cash disbursements after year-end to identify any "
"unrecorded liabilities at the balance sheet date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengeluaran kas setelah akhir tahun untuk mengidentifikasi liabilitas "
"yang belum dicatat pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_442_tixs2tt
msgid ""
"Review subsequent cash receipts and contract invoices after the balance "
"sheet date to identify any contract liabilities that were not recorded at "
"year-end."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penerimaan kas dan faktur kontrak setelah tanggal neraca untuk "
"mengidentifikasi kewajiban kontrak yang belum dicatat pada akhir tahun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_482_66zefyc
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events and transactions after the balance sheet date to "
"determine if there have been any changes or settlements that affect the "
"valuation or existence of recorded provisions."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa dan transaksi setelah tanggal neraca untuk menentukan apakah ada "
"perubahan atau penyelesaian yang memengaruhi penilaian atau keberadaan provisi yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_891_lft72xm
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events for any NCI transactions occurring after the "
"reporting date, such as additional acquisitions or divestments."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan atas setiap transaksi NCI seperti "
"akuisisi tambahan atau divestasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_983_igwc8kt
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events for any changes in NCI ownership or significant "
"transactions involving NCI, such as additional equity contributions or "
"restructuring."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk perubahan kepemilikan NCI atau "
"transaksi signifikan terkait NCI seperti kontribusi ekuitas tambahan atau restrukturisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_778_38a3siv
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events for any changes that may impact long-term "
"liabilities, such as new contracts, settlements, or regulatory changes."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan atas perubahan yang dapat "
"mempengaruhi liabilitas jangka panjang seperti kontrak baru, penyelesaian, atau perubahan regulasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_829_xkn96t4
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events for any share issuances, redemptions, or changes in"
" APIC that occurred after the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan atas setiap penerbitan, penebusan saham, "
"atau perubahan APIC yang terjadi setelah tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_851_f1q6b7b
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events for any treasury share transactions, such as "
"additional repurchases or reissuances, that occurred after the reporting "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan atas transaksi saham treasuri seperti "
"buyback tambahan atau penerbitan kembali setelah tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_917_9rngbnl
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events to identify any OCI-related adjustments or "
"transactions that may have occurred after the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi penyesuaian atau "
"transaksi terkait OCI yang mungkin terjadi setelah tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_869_81i12th
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events to identify any bond conversions or other "
"transactions affecting the equity component after the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi konversi obligasi "
"atau transaksi lain yang memengaruhi komponen ekuitas setelah tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_937_tu9b1f4
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events to identify any changes in appropriated retained "
"earnings occurring after the reporting date, such as the completion of a "
"project for which funds were reserved."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk perubahan pada laba ditahan "
"yang dialokasikan seperti penyelesaian proyek yang didanai dari apropriasi tersebut."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_809_74af0c4
msgid ""
"Review subsequent events to identify any share issuances, redemptions, or "
"changes in share capital that occurred after the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau peristiwa setelah tanggal pelaporan untuk mengidentifikasi penerbitan, penebusan, "
"atau perubahan modal saham yang terjadi setelah tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_967_jqvbdqr
msgid ""
"Review supporting documentation for any changes in ownership interest in "
"subsidiaries, including purchases, sales, or contributions, and confirm that"
" they are properly reflected in the NCI."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi pendukung atas perubahan kepemilikan di entitas anak termasuk "
"pembelian, penjualan, atau kontribusi dan konfirmasi pencerminan yang tepat dalam NCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_433_b5krivf
msgid ""
"Review supporting documentation, such as delivery records or service "
"completion confirmations, to validate that performance obligations have been"
" met."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi pendukung seperti catatan pengiriman atau konfirmasi "
"penyelesaian jasa untuk memvalidasi pemenuhan kewajiban pelaksanaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_96_iy780nq
msgid ""
"Review supporting documentation, such as trade confirmations and settlement "
"records, to verify proper cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi pendukung seperti konfirmasi transaksi dan catatan "
"penyelesaian untuk memverifikasi cutoff yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_76_puf1s2g
msgid ""
"Review supporting documentation, such as trade confirmations and settlement "
"statements, to confirm appropriate cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumentasi pendukung seperti konfirmasi transaksi dan pernyataan "
"penyelesaian untuk mengonfirmasi cutoff yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1118_xj8uq6m
msgid ""
"Review supporting documents for new hires, terminations, and pay rate "
"changes to confirm that employee data is up-to-date and accurate."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumen pendukung untuk karyawan baru, pemutusan hubungan kerja, dan "
"perubahan tingkat gaji guna mengonfirmasi data karyawan mutakhir dan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_822_8u38lcr
msgid ""
"Review supporting documents for transactions near the year-end and ensure "
"APIC and share capital amounts are recorded based on issuance dates."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dokumen pendukung transaksi dekat akhir tahun dan pastikan jumlah APIC "
"dan modal saham dicatat berdasarkan tanggal penerbitan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_514_cnnpnnx
msgid ""
"Review tax transactions around the period-end to confirm that taxes payable "
"are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi pajak sekitar akhir periode untuk mengonfirmasi utang pajak "
"dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_965_bejbj5v
msgid ""
"Review the allocation of consolidated profit or loss and other comprehensive"
" income between the parent and NCI."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau alokasi laba atau rugi konsolidasian dan OCI antara entitas induk dan NCI."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_881_24guzwd
msgid ""
"Review the allocation of profits and losses to NCI to ensure the correct "
"portion of net income is attributed to NCI based on ownership percentages."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau alokasi laba dan rugi ke NCI untuk memastikan porsi laba bersih yang tepat "
"diatribusikan sesuai persentase kepemilikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_726_waitqji
msgid ""
"Review the balance of deferred tax assets (DTA) to verify that deferred tax "
"liabilities are netted against DTAs in accordance with tax law."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau saldo aset pajak tangguhan (DTA) untuk memverifikasi bahwa liabilitas pajak "
"tangguhan disalinghapuskan dengan DTA sesuai ketentuan pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_911_nfea83s
msgid ""
"Review the classification of items recorded in OCI to confirm compliance "
"with applicable accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau klasifikasi item yang dicatat dalam OCI untuk mengonfirmasi kepatuhan "
"terhadap standar akuntansi yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_923_j96a59t
msgid ""
"Review the company’s policies to verify that appropriations are consistent "
"with approved policies or legal requirements (e.g., statutory reserves)."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau kebijakan perusahaan untuk memverifikasi bahwa apropriasi konsisten dengan "
"kebijakan yang disetujui atau persyaratan hukum (mis. cadangan wajib)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_952_wr7nt2h
msgid ""
"Review the components of the retained earnings balance, including "
"adjustments, to identify unusual items or trends."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau komponen saldo laba ditahan termasuk penyesuaian untuk mengidentifikasi "
"item atau tren yang tidak biasa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_9_q9bcja2
msgid ""
"Review the composition of cash equivalents, ensuring compliance with the "
"entity’s policies and accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau komposisi setara kas memastikan kepatuhan terhadap kebijakan entitas dan "
"standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_317_4pscia0
msgid ""
"Review the discount rates applied in calculating the ROU asset and lease "
"liability, ensuring that they reflect either the rate implicit in the lease "
"or the lessee’s incremental borrowing rate."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau tingkat diskonto yang diterapkan dalam perhitungan aset hak‑guna (ROU) dan "
"liabilitas sewa memastikan mencerminkan tingkat implisit sewa atau tingkat pinjaman "
"inkremental lessee."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1133_cj7xq1o
msgid ""
"Review the entity’s accrued G&A expenses and verify that accruals reflect "
"obligations incurred by period-end."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau beban G&A terakru entitas dan verifikasi akrual mencerminkan kewajiban yang "
"timbul hingga akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1295_ovunjma
msgid ""
"Review the entries made to reclassify OCI items to profit or loss during the"
" reporting period to ensure they are appropriately calculated and recorded."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau entri yang dibuat untuk mereklasifikasi item OCI ke laba rugi selama periode "
"pelaporan guna memastikan perhitungan dan pencatatan yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1003_zzqqo70
msgid ""
"Review the financial statement disclosures related to revenue, ensuring they"
" include information on revenue sources, recognition policies, significant "
"judgments, and performance obligations."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan laporan keuangan terkait pendapatan memastikan mencakup "
"informasi sumber pendapatan, kebijakan pengakuan, pertimbangan signifikan, dan "
"kewajiban pelaksanaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_329_vw6h0l1
msgid ""
"Review the indicators of impairment, such as legal challenges, reduced cash "
"flows, or technological obsolescence."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau indikator penurunan nilai seperti tantangan hukum, penurunan arus kas, atau "
"keusangan teknologi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_761_ju65ux7
msgid ""
"Review the methodologies and key assumptions used in valuing significant "
"long-term liabilities, such as discount rates for deferred compensation or "
"future cost estimates for asset retirement obligations."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau metodologi dan asumsi kunci yang digunakan menilai liabilitas jangka panjang "
"signifikan seperti tingkat diskonto kompensasi tangguhan atau estimasi biaya masa "
"depan kewajiban penutupan aset."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1050_jk58ih2
msgid ""
"Review the notes to financial statements to ensure disclosures provide "
"transparency on revenue recognition methods, any contractual risks, or "
"changes in revenue policies."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau catatan atas laporan keuangan untuk memastikan pengungkapan memberikan "
"transparansi metode pengakuan pendapatan, risiko kontraktual, atau perubahan kebijakan pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_492_djc5ivg
msgid ""
"Review the payroll accruals recorded at the end of the period to confirm "
"they include wages, salaries, and other benefits for days worked but not yet"
" paid."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau akrual penggajian yang dicatat akhir periode untuk mengonfirmasi mencakup "
"upah, gaji, dan manfaat lain atas hari kerja yang belum dibayar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_167_7i4akg2
msgid ""
"Review the prepaid tax balances to determine if any part is refundable, "
"especially for overpaid taxes or tax credits."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau saldo pajak dibayar di muka untuk menentukan apakah ada bagian yang dapat "
"direstitusi terutama atas kelebihan bayar atau kredit pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_546_st8hkth
msgid ""
"Review the presentation of liabilities in the disposal group section of the "
"balance sheet, ensuring they are classified as current if the sale is "
"expected within one year."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penyajian liabilitas dalam bagian kelompok lepasan di neraca memastikan "
"diklasifikasikan sebagai lancar jika penjualan diharapkan dalam satu tahun."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_77_5yabyxx
msgid ""
"Review the recorded gains and losses for accuracy, ensuring that realized "
"gains/losses reflect proper sale dates and unrealized gains/losses reflect "
"correct valuation."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau laba rugi yang dicatat untuk akurasi memastikan laba/rugi terealisasi "
"mencerminkan tanggal penjualan yang benar dan laba/rugi belum terealisasi "
"mencerminkan penilaian yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_714_0eefsjn
msgid ""
"Review the tax disclosures in the financial statements, including those "
"specific to deferred tax liabilities, to confirm completeness and compliance"
" with accounting standards."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau pengungkapan pajak dalam laporan keuangan termasuk yang spesifik atas "
"liabilitas pajak tangguhan untuk mengonfirmasi kelengkapan dan kepatuhan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_261_8du7lvu
msgid ""
"Review the tax rates used in DTA calculations and verify that they are based"
" on enacted tax rates expected to apply when the temporary differences are "
"realized."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau tarif pajak yang digunakan dalam perhitungan DTA dan verifikasi bahwa "
"berdasarkan tarif yang berlaku yang diharapkan terpakai saat perbedaan temporer "
"direalisasikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_452_3xp1mml
msgid ""
"Review the terms of the overdraft agreement for each facility, including "
"interest rates, fees, repayment terms, and covenants."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau ketentuan perjanjian cerukan tiap fasilitas termasuk suku bunga, biaya, "
"syarat pelunasan, dan kovenan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_704_4133eix
msgid ""
"Review the underlying fixed asset schedules, provisions, and other accounts "
"to identify temporary differences that create deferred tax liabilities "
"(e.g., accelerated depreciation, deferred revenue)."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau jadwal aset tetap, provisi, dan akun lain yang mendasari untuk "
"mengidentifikasi perbedaan temporer yang menimbulkan liabilitas pajak tangguhan "
"(mis. depresiasi dipercepat, pendapatan tangguhan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_179_196szn1
msgid ""
"Review the valuation basis of each category of other current assets, "
"ensuring that they are recorded at realizable value."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dasar penilaian tiap kategori aset lancar lainnya memastikan dicatat pada "
"nilai yang dapat direalisasikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_197_wdgi4nu
msgid ""
"Review the valuation of non-trade receivables to ensure they are recorded at"
" realizable value, considering any indicators of impairment."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian piutang non‑usaha untuk memastikan pencatatan pada nilai yang "
"dapat direalisasikan dengan mempertimbangkan indikator penurunan nilai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_81_49sf575
msgid ""
"Review the valuation, classification, and disclosures of any derivative "
"financial instruments."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau penilaian, klasifikasi, dan pengungkapan atas setiap instrumen keuangan "
"derivatif."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_267_mowctqv
msgid ""
"Review transactions and changes in temporary differences recorded near the "
"period-end to ensure they are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi dan perubahan perbedaan temporer yang dicatat dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_418_7verada
msgid ""
"Review transactions around the period-end to confirm that accruals and other"
" payables are recorded in the correct accounting period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sekitar akhir periode untuk mengonfirmasi akrual dan utang lain dicatat pada periode akuntansi yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_456_lbixerd
msgid ""
"Review transactions around the period-end to confirm that all overdraft "
"balances and related interest expenses are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sekitar akhir periode untuk mengonfirmasi seluruh saldo cerukan dan beban bunga terkait dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_434_qltmfuv
msgid ""
"Review transactions around the period-end to confirm that contract "
"liabilities are recorded in the correct accounting period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sekitar akhir periode untuk mengonfirmasi kewajiban kontrak dicatat pada periode akuntansi yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_474_fpfhzqn
msgid ""
"Review transactions around the period-end to confirm that provisions are "
"recorded in the correct accounting period, ensuring completeness."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sekitar akhir periode untuk memastikan provisi dicatat pada periode akuntansi yang benar dan lengkap."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_392_x7427yc
msgid ""
"Review transactions around the period-end, including invoices and receiving "
"reports, to confirm that accounts payable are recorded in the correct "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi sekitar akhir periode termasuk faktur dan laporan penerimaan untuk memastikan utang usaha dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_336_d7wh6lo
msgid ""
"Review transactions for intangible asset acquisitions, disposals, and "
"amortization around the period-end to ensure proper cutoff."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi perolehan, pelepasan, dan amortisasi aset tak berwujud sekitar akhir periode untuk memastikan cutoff tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_378_4hi6n1v
msgid ""
"Review transactions involving additions, disposals, and amortization around "
"the period-end to ensure they are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi penambahan, pelepasan, dan amortisasi sekitar akhir periode untuk memastikan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1111_lfkn7gy
msgid ""
"Review transactions near the end of the reporting period to confirm that "
"payroll expenses are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi dekat akhir periode pelaporan untuk mengonfirmasi beban penggajian dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1085_07b5tw2
msgid ""
"Review transactions near the end of the reporting period to verify that "
"direct costs are recognized in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi dekat akhir periode pelaporan untuk memverifikasi biaya langsung diakui pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_673_ineqqqn
msgid ""
"Review transactions occurring after the balance sheet date to identify any "
"conversions, payments, or new issuances that could affect the convertible "
"bond balance."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi setelah tanggal neraca untuk mengidentifikasi konversi, pembayaran, atau penerbitan baru yang dapat memengaruhi saldo obligasi konversi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_722_e04v31z
msgid ""
"Review transactions occurring near the period-end to ensure deferred tax "
"liabilities are accurately recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan liabilitas pajak tangguhan dicatat akurat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_219_78wqyey
msgid ""
"Review transactions recorded near the balance sheet date to ensure they are "
"recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi yang dicatat dekat tanggal neraca untuk memastikan berada pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_115_013wk7i
msgid ""
"Review transactions recorded near the end of the period to ensure inventory "
"purchases and sales are recorded in the correct period."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau transaksi yang dicatat dekat akhir periode untuk memastikan pembelian dan penjualan persediaan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

