msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi G&A dan telusuri ke dokumen pendukung (faktur, tanda terima, formulir persetujuan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1265_2pjlswg
msgid ""
"Select a sample of OCI transactions and review the supporting documentation "
