"valid and accurately calculated."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi OCI dan tinjau dokumentasi pendukung (valuasi aktuaria, laporan revaluasi) untuk memastikan valid dan dihitung akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1281_685s6zb
msgid ""
"Select a sample of OCI transactions and review the supporting documentation "
"(e.g., market valuations, foreign currency rates) to ensure that they are "
"valid and accurately calculated."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi OCI dan tinjau dokumentasi pendukung (valuasi pasar, kurs valas) untuk memastikan valid dan dihitung akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_305_bc0mibu
msgid ""
"Select a sample of ROU assets and inspect the underlying lease agreements, "
"verifying that they meet the criteria for capitalization."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel aset ROU dan periksa perjanjian sewa terkait untuk verifikasi memenuhi kriteria kapitalisasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_307_bb7zqpz
msgid ""
