"depreciation expense based on the lease term and depreciation method."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel aset ROU dan hitung ulang beban amortisasi atau depresiasi berdasarkan masa sewa dan metode yang digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1013_ufotxtb
