msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel penambahan dari register aset tetap dan periksa dokumen pendukung (faktur pembelian, persetujuan, kontrak)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_384_wuqin7x
msgid ""
"Select a sample of asset disposals or retirements during the period and "
"inspect documentation such as sales agreements and evidence of proceeds."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pelepasan/penghentian aset selama periode dan periksa dokumen (perjanjian penjualan, bukti penerimaan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_285_ijjfyks
msgid ""
"Select a sample of assets and verify the accuracy of the depreciation "
"calculations, including the method, useful life, and residual value applied."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel aset dan verifikasi akurasi perhitungan depresiasi (metode, umur manfaat, nilai residu)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_8_tt6da4m
msgid ""
"Select a sample of cash receipts and cash disbursements around period-end, "
"tracing them to supporting documentation to verify proper cutoff."
