"Pilih sampel kewajiban kontrak dan periksa kontrak dasar untuk konfirmasi jumlah diakui sesuai ketentuan kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1247_hmmeqnn
msgid ""
"Select a sample of deferred tax transactions and review the supporting "
"documentation (e.g., tax calculations, prior year tax returns) to ensure "
