msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel operasi yang dihentikan dan tinjau dokumen pendukung (risalah dewan, laporan manajemen) untuk memastikan keputusan sesuai kebijakan entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_283_g9lx0un
msgid ""
"Select a sample of disposals and inspect documentation such as sale "
"agreements, disposal authorizations, and evidence of cash receipts."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pelepasan dan periksa dokumen (perjanjian jual, otorisasi pelepasan, bukti penerimaan kas)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1103_gkvt8a2
