"documentation, such as acquisition agreements, invoices, and legal filings."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel penambahan aset tak berwujud dan periksa dokumen pendukung (perjanjian akuisisi, faktur, dokumen legal)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_454_gyr0z8d
