"Pilih sampel akuisisi properti investasi dan periksa dokumen pendukung (kontrak pembelian, sertifikat, bukti pembayaran)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_354_e2rbrzb
msgid ""
"Select a sample of investment property disposals and inspect supporting "
"documentation, such as sales agreements and evidence of proceeds."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pelepasan properti investasi dan periksa dokumen (perjanjian penjualan, bukti hasil penjualan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1079_52lcul7
msgid ""
"Select a sample of labor costs included in the cost of revenues and trace to"
