msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel biaya tenaga kerja dalam biaya pendapatan dan telusuri ke catatan penggajian, timesheet, atau laporan job costing."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1175_w1g3vr9
msgid ""
