msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pinjaman dan tinjau perjanjian pinjaman terkait untuk memastikan seluruh ketentuan relevan (suku bunga, jadwal pembayaran) tercakup."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1135_1ehfrxm
msgid ""
"Select a sample of maintenance and repair expenses and trace to supporting "
