msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel beban pemeliharaan dan perbaikan dan telusuri ke dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_370_f5fgagy
msgid ""
"Select a sample of new acquisitions or investments classified as other non-"
"current assets and inspect supporting documentation, such as acquisition "
"agreements, invoices, or confirmation statements."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel akuisisi atau investasi baru yang diklasifikasikan sebagai aset tidak lancar lain dan periksa dokumen (perjanjian akuisisi, faktur, konfirmasi)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1153_skkdcjz
msgid ""
"Select a sample of newly acquired or disposed assets and trace them to "
"supporting documentation, such as invoices and disposal records."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel aset baru diperoleh atau dilepas dan telusuri ke faktur serta catatan pelepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_398_7frs5tf
msgid ""
"Select a sample of payments and review for duplicate invoices or incorrect "
