msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pembayaran dan tinjau potensi faktur duplikat atau jumlah salah dalam utang usaha."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1115_94nka0i
msgid ""
"Select a sample of payroll payments and trace each payment to the bank "
"statement to confirm that disbursements occurred as recorded."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pembayaran penggajian dan telusuri ke rekening koran untuk konfirmasi pengeluaran sesuai pencatatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1101_7jx81f4
msgid ""
"Select a sample of payroll transactions for detailed testing, tracing each "
"transaction to supporting documentation such as timecards, payroll records, "
"and HR approval."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi penggajian untuk pengujian rinci, telusuri ke timecard, catatan penggajian, dan persetujuan HR."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_161_yggn43b
msgid ""
"Select a sample of prepaid tax payments made close to the balance sheet date"
" to ensure they are recorded in the appropriate period."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel pembayaran pajak dibayar di muka dekat tanggal neraca untuk memastikan dicatat pada periode yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_142_klm4krg
msgid ""
"Select a sample of prepayments and recalculate the amortization amount for "
