msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel prabayar dan hitung ulang jumlah amortisasi periode berjalan untuk memastikan akurasi dan konsistensi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_116_kfbt3nc
msgid ""
"Select a sample of receiving and shipping documents around year-end and "
"verify that they are recorded in the appropriate period."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel dokumen penerimaan dan pengiriman sekitar akhir tahun dan verifikasi pencatatan pada periode yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1129_gueerun
msgid ""
"Select a sample of rent and utilities expenses, tracing to lease agreements "
"or utility invoices."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel beban sewa dan utilitas lalu telusuri ke perjanjian sewa atau faktur utilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_352_9po0m5s
msgid ""
"Select a sample of rental income transactions and inspect lease agreements, "
"rental receipts, and bank statements to verify accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi pendapatan sewa dan periksa perjanjian sewa, bukti penerimaan, serta rekening koran untuk verifikasi akurasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_989_gnp7ku6
msgid ""
"Select a sample of revenue transactions occurring near the reporting date "
"and verify that they are recorded in the appropriate period."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi pendapatan dekat tanggal pelaporan dan verifikasi pencatatan pada periode yang sesuai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1033_kooycqh
msgid ""
"Select a sample of revenue-generating contracts (e.g., service agreements, "
