#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_27_cqm6o8x
msgid ""
"Select a sample of sales transactions around period-end to verify that they "
"are recorded in the correct accounting period."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi penjualan sekitar akhir periode untuk verifikasi pencatatan pada periode akuntansi yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_410_f0qklgn
msgid ""
"Select a sample of significant accruals and verify the calculation by "
"reviewing supporting documents, such as contracts, historical invoices, or "
"rate agreements."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel akrual signifikan dan verifikasi perhitungan dengan meninjau dokumen pendukung (kontrak, faktur historis, atau perjanjian tarif)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1077_3ds10a1
msgid ""
"Select a sample of significant material costs and trace them to supporting "
"documents such as purchase orders, invoices, and receiving reports."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel biaya material signifikan dan telusuri ke dokumen pendukung (purchase order, faktur, laporan penerimaan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1229_v5sta62
msgid ""
"Select a sample of tax expense transactions and review the supporting "
"documentation (e.g., tax returns, tax calculations, correspondence with tax "
"authorities) to ensure that they are valid and accurately calculated."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi beban pajak dan tinjau dokumentasi pendukung (SPT, perhitungan pajak, korespondensi otoritas pajak) untuk memastikan valid dan akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1195_wmxo7qu
msgid ""
"Select a sample of transactions and review supporting documentation (e.g., "
"invoices, receipts, and contracts) to ensure that expenses are valid, "
"properly authorized, and appropriately classified."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi dan tinjau dokumen pendukung (faktur, tanda terima, kontrak) untuk memastikan beban valid, diotorisasi, dan diklasifikasikan tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1039_jl0e8fr
msgid ""
"Select a sample of transactions involving royalties or usage-based revenue "
"and confirm calculations based on the terms in contracts."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi royalti atau pendapatan berbasis penggunaan dan konfirmasi perhitungan sesuai ketentuan kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_995_cz9tff9
msgid ""
"Select a sample of transactions with discounts, allowances, or returns and "
"verify that they comply with company policies."
msgstr ""
"Pilih sampel transaksi berisi diskon, potongan, atau retur dan verifikasi kepatuhan terhadap kebijakan perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_b26d482__conclusion_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_e51bb1c__conclusion_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.field_general_audit_ws_f9f3299__conclusion_id
msgid "Selected conclusion summarizing the worksheet's assessment."
msgstr "Kesimpulan terpilih yang merangkum penilaian lembar kerja."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_450_g5xugri
msgid ""
"Send bank confirmations to each financial institution with overdraft "
"facilities to confirm the balance, terms, interest rate, and any outstanding"
" obligations."
msgstr ""
"Kirim konfirmasi bank ke setiap institusi dengan fasilitas cerukan untuk mengonfirmasi saldo, ketentuan, suku bunga, dan kewajiban terutang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1045_mqwdwat
msgid ""
"Send confirmation requests to a sample of customers for significant non-"
"interest revenue transactions to verify their accuracy and existence."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke sampel pelanggan atas transaksi pendapatan non‑bunga signifikan untuk verifikasi akurasi dan keberadaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_997_2je6iar
msgid ""
"Send confirmation requests to a sample of major customers to verify the "
"accuracy and existence of recorded revenue."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke sampel pelanggan utama untuk verifikasi akurasi dan keberadaan pendapatan yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_591_1ktia5u
msgid ""
"Send confirmation requests to all lending banks to verify the outstanding "
"balance, interest rate, maturity date, and any collateral requirements as of"
" the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke semua bank pemberi pinjaman untuk verifikasi saldo terutang, suku bunga, jatuh tempo, dan persyaratan agunan pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1015_x1m15ss
msgid ""
"Send confirmation requests to banks and other financial institutions to "
"verify the interest income earned on deposits, loans, and investments."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke bank dan institusi keuangan lain untuk verifikasi pendapatan bunga atas deposito, pinjaman, dan investasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_655_ht8f4rv
