"Send confirmation requests to lenders to verify the outstanding balance, "
"terms, and conditions of subordinated loans as of the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke pemberi pinjaman untuk verifikasi saldo terutang, syarat, dan ketentuan pinjaman subordinasi pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_788_cp0wxuy
msgid ""
