"verify the number of issued and outstanding shares as of the reporting date."
msgstr ""
"Kirim permintaan konfirmasi ke pencatat saham atau agen transfer untuk verifikasi jumlah saham diterbitkan dan beredar pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1_t0q6wr0
msgid ""
"Send confirmations directly to banks to verify cash balances, interest "
"rates, and any restrictions on the cash."
msgstr ""
"Kirim konfirmasi langsung ke bank untuk verifikasi saldo kas, suku bunga, dan pembatasan atas kas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_87_4kotx85
msgid ""
