"counting the cash on hand, and reconciling it to recorded amounts."
msgstr "Verifikasi kas kecil dengan inspeksi fisik saldo, menghitung kas tersedia, dan merekonsiliasi ke jumlah yang dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_818_spa0dzl
msgid ""
"Verify that APIC is not recorded as retained earnings, share capital, or any"
" other equity category."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa APIC tidak dicatat sebagai laba ditahan, modal saham, atau kategori ekuitas lain."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_972_9kbvlu6
msgid ""
"Verify that NCI allocations in the subsidiary’s financial statements, such "
"as earnings and dividends, are consistent with amounts recorded at the group"
" level."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa alokasi NCI dalam laporan keuangan entitas anak (laba dan dividen) konsisten dengan jumlah pada tingkat grup."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_883_1ut6v57
msgid ""
"Verify that NCI transactions recorded near the reporting date are recognized"
" in the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi transaksi NCI yang dicatat dekat tanggal pelaporan diakui pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_982_qbvnu7t
msgid ""
"Verify that NCI-related disclosures, including rights, restrictions, and "
"risks, comply with accounting and regulatory requirements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait NCI (hak, pembatasan, risiko) mematuhi persyaratan akuntansi dan regulasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_379_cp84ga3
msgid ""
"Verify that acquisition and disposal dates are consistent with supporting "
"documentation."
msgstr "Verifikasi tanggal akuisisi dan pelepasan konsisten dengan dokumentasi pendukung."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_110_q6crvu2
msgid ""
"Verify that adequate disclosures are made regarding the types of "
"derivatives, risk exposures, hedging relationships, and significant terms."
msgstr "Verifikasi pengungkapan memadai tentang jenis derivatif, eksposur risiko, hubungan lindung nilai, dan ketentuan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_268_z43qku3
msgid ""
"Verify that adjustments to DTAs are recorded promptly in the financial "
"statements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa penyesuaian terhadap DTA dicatat segera dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_901_m9dj7nc
msgid ""
"Verify that all OCI items are appropriately classified within the OCI "
"section of the Statement of Comprehensive Income."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa seluruh item OCI diklasifikasikan dengan tepat dalam bagian OCI pada Laporan Laba Rugi Komprehensif."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_826_tjhrbgx
msgid ""
"Verify that all information regarding APIC is disclosed as required, "
"including significant transactions, issuance prices, and terms for various "
"share classes."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa seluruh informasi mengenai APIC diungkap sesuai ketentuan (transaksi signifikan, harga penerbitan, ketentuan tiap kelas saham)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_648_ezp9csb
msgid ""
"Verify that all required disclosures comply with accounting standards, "
"including information on maturity dates, interest rates, covenants, "
"collateral, and any instances of default or covenant breaches."
msgstr "Verifikasi seluruh pengungkapan wajib sesuai standar akuntansi (tanggal jatuh tempo, suku bunga, kovenan, agunan, serta kejadian wanprestasi/pelanggaran kovenan)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_705_qggw3t2
msgid ""
"Verify that all significant temporary differences are identified, and that "
"any material differences have been included in the DTL calculation."
msgstr "Verifikasi seluruh perbedaan temporer signifikan telah diidentifikasi dan setiap perbedaan material sudah dimasukkan dalam perhitungan DTL."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_654_sipjfon
msgid ""
"Verify that all terms are accurately recorded in the company’s accounting "
"system and that the bond is correctly classified according to accounting "
"standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa seluruh ketentuan dicatat secara akurat dalam sistem akuntansi perusahaan dan obligasi diklasifikasikan dengan benar sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_694_acn5k8i
msgid ""
"Verify that amendments or curtailments are accurately recorded, with any "
"gains or losses recognized according to accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa amandemen atau pengurangan dicatat akurat, dan setiap laba atau rugi diakui sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1166_y16d4vk
msgid ""
"Verify that amortization for intangible assets (e.g., patents, software) is "
"classified separately from tangible assets."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa amortisasi aset tak berwujud (mis. paten, perangkat lunak) diklasifikasikan terpisah dari aset berwujud."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_158_v7won32
msgid ""
"Verify that amounts recorded as prepaid tax agree with tax authority "
"receipts and records."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa jumlah yang dicatat sebagai pajak dibayar di muka sesuai dengan tanda terima dan catatan otoritas pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_979_g9zqsg3
msgid ""
"Verify that any NCI-related transactions, such as ownership changes or "
"dividends, are recorded in the appropriate period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap transaksi terkait NCI seperti perubahan kepemilikan atau dividen dicatat pada periode yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_515_06bk19n
msgid ""
"Verify that any accrued liabilities for the reporting period include amounts"
" for taxes incurred before year-end but unpaid as of the balance sheet date."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa liabilitas terakru periode pelaporan mencakup jumlah pajak yang timbul sebelum akhir tahun namun belum dibayar pada tanggal neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_220_u18qzbz
msgid ""
"Verify that any changes in ownership or transactions affecting the "
"investment in the associate are recorded accurately."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap perubahan kepemilikan atau transaksi yang mempengaruhi investasi pada entitas asosiasi dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_878_7h4p6wb
msgid ""
"Verify that any difference between the fair value of consideration "
"paid/received and the carrying amount of the NCI is adjusted in the parent’s"
" equity, without affecting the consolidated profit or loss."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap selisih antara nilai wajar imbalan dibayar/diterima dan nilai tercatat NCI disesuaikan pada ekuitas induk tanpa mempengaruhi laba rugi konsolidasian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_666_9lx4w5h
msgid ""
"Verify that any equity issued upon conversion is consistent with the bond’s "
"conversion ratio and terms."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap ekuitas yang diterbitkan saat konversi konsisten dengan rasio dan ketentuan konversi obligasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_104_9i2xbmj
msgid ""
"Verify that any interest income or expense arising from derivatives is "
"recorded accurately."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap pendapatan atau beban bunga yang timbul dari derivatif dicatat akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_779_0yot1pk
msgid ""
"Verify that any material subsequent events are appropriately disclosed and "
"evaluated for potential adjustment to long-term liability balances."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap peristiwa subsekuen material diungkap tepat dan dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian saldo liabilitas jangka panjang."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_644_8st45tt
msgid ""
"Verify that any modifications are reflected correctly in the financial "
"statements, with updated amortization schedules if applicable."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap modifikasi tercermin dengan benar dalam laporan keuangan, dengan jadwal amortisasi diperbarui bila berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_475_lz97ods
msgid ""
"Verify that any new obligations arising from events before the period-end "
"are appropriately recognized, and provisions for resolved obligations are "
"released."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa kewajiban baru yang timbul dari peristiwa sebelum akhir periode diakui secara tepat, dan provisi atas kewajiban yang telah terselesaikan dilepas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_178_0ii5rrf
msgid ""
"Verify that any receipts or disbursements related to these assets were "
"appropriately recorded in the period to which they pertain."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap penerimaan atau pengeluaran terkait aset tersebut dicatat secara tepat pada periode terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_622_djjpsno
msgid ""
"Verify that any remeasurement is based on revised future cash flows, updated"
" discount rates, or changes in the lease term."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap pengukuran ulang didasarkan pada arus kas masa depan yang direvisi, tingkat diskonto yang diperbarui, atau perubahan masa sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1112_l0hscih
msgid ""
"Verify that any salary, overtime, or other payments for the period ending "
"after the year-end are not included in the current period’s expenses."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa gaji, lembur, atau pembayaran lain untuk periode yang berakhir setelah akhir tahun tidak termasuk dalam beban periode berjalan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1260_o81od61
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in deferred tax expense recognition are "
"adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan dalam pengakuan beban pajak tangguhan diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1206_4te0q49
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in expense classifications or amounts "
"are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan klasifikasi atau jumlah beban diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1188_cpm7z8i
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in interest expense or financing "
"arrangements are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan beban bunga atau pengaturan pembiayaan diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1122_y0w9zpe
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in payroll structure or benefits "
"programs are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan struktur penggajian atau program manfaat diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1242_l7ubk3s
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in tax expense recognition are "
"adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan pengakuan beban pajak diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1276_6zvzwcg
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1292_2zdknc2
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in the recognition or measurement of OCI"
" items are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan dalam pengakuan atau pengukuran item OCI diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1224_kyvj1ga
msgid ""
"Verify that any significant changes in the treatment of discontinued "
"operations are adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan signifikan perlakuan operasi yang dihentikan diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_962_49woqv3
msgid ""
"Verify that any statutory limitations due to accumulated deficits are "
"documented and disclosed, especially if they affect dividend declarations or"
" borrowing capacity."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap pembatasan hukum akibat akumulasi defisit didokumentasikan dan diungkap, khususnya bila mempengaruhi deklarasi dividen atau kapasitas pinjaman."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_940_hgkzay7
msgid ""
"Verify that appropriated amounts meet any applicable legal requirements, "
"ensuring that they are sufficient and correctly classified as required."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa jumlah apropriasi memenuhi ketentuan hukum yang berlaku, memastikan memadai dan diklasifikasikan dengan benar sebagaimana disyaratkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_925_tfl7lee
msgid ""
"Verify that appropriated retained earnings are classified separately from "
"unappropriated retained earnings within the equity section of the balance "
"sheet."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa laba ditahan yang dialokasikan diklasifikasikan terpisah dari laba ditahan tidak dialokasikan dalam bagian ekuitas neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_929_vm1us2b
msgid ""
"Verify that appropriations recorded near the reporting date are recognized "
"in the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa apropriasi yang dicatat dekat tanggal pelaporan diakui pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_864_nu7pkdp
msgid ""
"Verify that bonds issued or converted post-reporting date are excluded from "
"the equity component as of the reporting period end."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa obligasi yang diterbitkan atau dikonversi setelah tanggal pelaporan dikecualikan dari komponen ekuitas per akhir periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_680_89y1fv7
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations align with the assumptions and that all elements of"
" the obligation (e.g., past service cost) are accurately reflected."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan selaras dengan asumsi dan seluruh elemen kewajiban (mis. biaya jasa lalu) tercermin akurat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1152_pnx4yhv
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the depreciation or "
"amortization method (e.g., straight-line, declining balance), useful life, "
"and residual value."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan metode depresiasi atau amortisasi (mis. garis lurus, saldo menurun), umur manfaat, dan nilai residu."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1174_d1ls8o6
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the entity’s accounting "
"policies and relevant accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan kebijakan akuntansi entitas dan standar akuntansi relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1194_wu6ltnf
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the organization's expense "
"recognition policies and relevant accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan kebijakan pengakuan beban organisasi dan standar akuntansi relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1250_rwj5bnc
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the organization's policies and"
" accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan kebijakan organisasi dan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1232_orind27
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the organization's policies and"
" tax regulations."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan kebijakan organisasi dan regulasi pajak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1214_dqfwjuc
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1268_tpza9we
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1284_boezrbs
msgid ""
"Verify that calculations are consistent with the organization’s policies and"
" accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan konsisten dengan kebijakan organisasi dan standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_968_hpjz35m
msgid ""
"Verify that changes in NCI resulting from ownership changes are calculated "
"accurately and recorded in accordance with accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan NCI akibat perubahan kepemilikan dihitung akurat dan dicatat sesuai standar akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_956_p4d1rc6
msgid ""
"Verify that changes in retained earnings due to changes in accounting policy"
" or prior period adjustments are appropriately disclosed and accounted for."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perubahan laba ditahan akibat perubahan kebijakan akuntansi atau penyesuaian periode sebelumnya diungkap dan dicatat secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1148_ejaidf7
msgid ""
"Verify that classifications and disclosures are consistent with accounting "
"standards and management policies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa klasifikasi dan pengungkapan konsisten dengan standar akuntansi dan kebijakan manajemen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_604_25cqsdg
msgid ""
"Verify that collateral assets are correctly classified and that any liens or"
" encumbrances are appropriately disclosed in the financial statements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa aset agunan diklasifikasikan benar dan setiap hak tanggungan atau beban diungkap tepat dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_118_s99y90i
msgid ""
"Verify that costing calculations, such as cost per unit and total cost for "
"each item, are accurate and consistent with the entity’s records."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan biaya seperti biaya per unit dan total biaya tiap item akurat dan konsisten dengan catatan entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_712_w464tu7
msgid ""
"Verify that deferred tax liabilities are classified as either current or "
"non-current based on the expected timing of reversal."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa liabilitas pajak tangguhan diklasifikasikan sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan waktu pembalikan yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1160_egdgywe
msgid ""
"Verify that depreciation and amortization expenses reflect the appropriate "
"time in use within the reporting period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa beban depresiasi dan amortisasi mencerminkan masa penggunaan yang tepat dalam periode pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_608_xjytyp0
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures comply with accounting standards, including details "
"of maturity dates, interest rates, covenants, collateral, and any defaults "
"or covenant breaches."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk rincian jatuh tempo, suku bunga, kovenan, agunan, dan setiap wanprestasi atau pelanggaran kovenan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_672_fcxc5gq
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures comply with accounting standards, including details "
"on the maturity date, conversion option, interest rate, discount "
"amortization, fair value of embedded derivatives (if applicable), and any "
"covenant requirements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk rincian tanggal jatuh tempo, opsi konversi, suku bunga, amortisasi diskonto, nilai wajar derivatif tertanam (jika berlaku), dan setiap persyaratan kovenan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_322_vt01mys
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures comply with accounting standards, including the "
"nature of ROU assets, amortization methods, remaining lease terms, and any "
"impairment."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk sifat aset ROU, metode amortisasi, sisa masa sewa, dan setiap penurunan nilai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_343_p5p0ssp
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including details on asset classes, useful lives, amortization "
"methods, impairment losses, and the carrying amounts of major categories."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk rincian kelas aset, umur manfaat, metode amortisasi, rugi penurunan nilai, dan nilai tercatat kategori utama."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_387_du40d3q
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including details on significant asset classes, impairment "
"losses, amortization, and accounting policies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk rincian kelas aset signifikan, rugi penurunan nilai, amortisasi, dan kebijakan akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_624_uq83slh
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including maturity analysis, lease terms, discount rates, "
"interest expense, and any covenants or collateral arrangements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk analisis jatuh tempo, ketentuan sewa, tingkat diskonto, beban bunga, dan setiap kovenan atau pengaturan agunan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_427_snbnw2y
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including significant accounting policies, accrual basis, and any"
" material obligations."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk kebijakan akuntansi signifikan, basis akrual, dan setiap kewajiban material."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_487_v548qj0
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including significant accounting policies, nature of the "
"provisions, estimation uncertainties, and any material contingencies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk kebijakan akuntansi signifikan, sifat provisi, ketidakpastian estimasi, dan setiap kontinjensi material."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_447_umnknhy
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including significant accounting policies, the nature of "
"performance obligations, and the timing of revenue recognition."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk kebijakan akuntansi signifikan, sifat kewajiban pelaksanaan, dan waktu pengakuan pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_407_0vroxc7
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including significant supplier balances, payment terms, foreign "
"currency liabilities, and any collateral or guarantees."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk saldo pemasok signifikan, ketentuan pembayaran, liabilitas mata uang asing, dan setiap agunan atau jaminan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_465_8e68bc4
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including terms, covenants, and any restrictions on cash "
"associated with overdraft facilities."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk ketentuan, kovenan, dan setiap pembatasan kas terkait fasilitas cerukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_527_n0i7cas
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including the types of taxes payable, tax contingencies, and any "
"significant assessments."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk jenis utang pajak, kontinjensi pajak, dan setiap penetapan signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_367_cbxlh1m
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with accounting "
"standards, including the valuation method, fair value gains/losses, rental "
"income, and any restrictions on disposal."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi termasuk metode penilaian, laba/rugi nilai wajar, pendapatan sewa, dan pembatasan pelepasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_568_xr1sqk1
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with applicable "
"accounting standards, detailing the nature and amount of other current "
"liabilities, any material contingencies, and significant judgments or "
"estimates."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi yang berlaku dengan merinci sifat dan jumlah kewajiban lancar lain, kontinjensi material, serta pertimbangan atau estimasi signifikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_507_i798t6z
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with applicable "
"accounting standards, including the nature of short-term employee benefits, "
"calculation policies, and any material contingencies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar akuntansi yang berlaku termasuk sifat imbalan karyawan jangka pendek, kebijakan perhitungan, dan setiap kontinjensi material."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_588_4pek40g
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements comply with applicable "
"standards, including any disclosures of significant non-trade payables, "
"contingent liabilities, and related-party transactions."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan mematuhi standar yang berlaku termasuk utang non‑usaha signifikan, liabilitas kontinjensi, dan transaksi pihak berelasi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_935_287p36b
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures in the financial statements provide details about "
"each appropriation, including the purpose, amounts, and changes during the "
"period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan memberikan rincian tiap apropriasi termasuk tujuan, jumlah, dan perubahan selama periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_889_urupsek
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures include information on NCI, such as the percentage "
"ownership interest of NCI in each subsidiary, details of significant "
"transactions, and their impact on equity."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan mencakup informasi NCI seperti persentase kepemilikan NCI tiap entitas anak, rincian transaksi signifikan, dan dampaknya pada ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_850_0ocmmvg
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures meet the requirements of accounting standards, "
"including any restrictions or potential plans for reissuance or retirement "
"of treasury shares."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan memenuhi persyaratan standar akuntansi termasuk pembatasan atau rencana potensial penerbitan kembali atau penghentian saham treasuri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_913_b4is3ys
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures of OCI in the financial statements provide a "
"breakdown of each component (e.g., revaluation, unrealized gains, foreign "
"currency adjustments)."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan OCI dalam laporan keuangan memberikan rincian tiap komponen (mis. revaluasi, laba belum terealisasi, penyesuaian mata uang asing)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_802_3rdj7ih
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures provide clear information about ownership structure "
"and any changes in share capital."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan memberikan informasi jelas tentang struktur kepemilikan dan setiap perubahan modal saham."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_699_zkpjl0i
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures provide sufficient information on sensitivity to "
"changes in key assumptions and any funding policies for the benefit plans."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan memberikan informasi memadai tentang sensitivitas terhadap perubahan asumsi kunci dan setiap kebijakan pendanaan rencana manfaat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_977_7tov1jb
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures related to NCI, including ownership percentages, "
"restrictions on subsidiaries, and rights of NCI holders, are accurate and "
"complete."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait NCI termasuk persentase kepemilikan, pembatasan pada entitas anak, dan hak pemegang NCI akurat dan lengkap."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_957_z38cwfh
msgid ""
"Verify that disclosures related to retained earnings in the financial "
"statements include sufficient detail about the unappropriated balance, any "
"restrictions, and significant changes during the period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan terkait laba ditahan dalam laporan keuangan mencakup rincian memadai tentang saldo tidak dialokasikan, pembatasan, dan perubahan signifikan selama periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_226_vn905fm
msgid ""
"Verify that dividend income is correctly recorded as a reduction in the "
"carrying amount of the investment, per equity method guidelines."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pendapatan dividen dicatat benar sebagai pengurang nilai tercatat investasi sesuai pedoman metode ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_805_xpoqmz0
msgid ""
"Verify that dividends are calculated accurately based on shares outstanding "
"and the dividend rate."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa dividen dihitung akurat berdasarkan saham beredar dan tingkat dividen."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_282_s8h2vpq
msgid ""
"Verify that each addition is recorded at cost, correctly classified, and "
"authorized per company policy."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap penambahan dicatat pada biaya, diklasifikasikan benar, dan diotorisasi sesuai kebijakan perusahaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1108_8m6wdlw
msgid ""
"Verify that each bonus is approved per policy, calculated according to "
"performance metrics or other criteria, and properly recorded."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap bonus disetujui sesuai kebijakan, dihitung menurut metrik kinerja atau kriteria lain, dan dicatat dengan benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1146_re9rv2l
msgid ""
"Verify that each entry is supported by proper documentation and reflects "
"legitimate adjustments to G&A expenses."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap entri didukung dokumentasi yang tepat dan mencerminkan penyesuaian sah atas beban G&A."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_491_j2rz7zu
msgid ""
"Verify that each liability is calculated in line with company policy and "
"contractual obligations, especially for bonuses and unused vacation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa setiap liabilitas dihitung sesuai kebijakan perusahaan dan kewajiban kontraktual, khususnya untuk bonus dan cuti belum digunakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_363_c71x36r
msgid ""
"Verify that estimates are reasonable and supported by relevant "
"documentation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa estimasi wajar dan didukung dokumentasi relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_904_qjf0ise
msgid ""
"Verify that exchange rates used align with applicable standards and confirm "
"calculations using the foreign subsidiaries’ financial statements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa kurs yang digunakan selaras dengan standar berlaku dan konfirmasi perhitungan menggunakan laporan keuangan entitas anak luar negeri."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_301_g99n556
msgid ""
"Verify that fixed assets are classified and presented correctly in the "
"balance sheet as non-current assets."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa aset tetap diklasifikasikan dan disajikan benar di neraca sebagai aset tidak lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1178_inrl0kt
msgid ""
"Verify that interest accruals at period-end reflect the amounts owed based "
"on the loan agreements and are recorded in the appropriate accounting "
"period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa akrual bunga akhir periode mencerminkan jumlah terutang berdasarkan perjanjian pinjaman dan dicatat pada periode akuntansi yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_455_r629rm1
msgid ""
"Verify that interest and fees have been recorded accurately in the general "
"ledger."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa bunga dan biaya telah dicatat akurat dalam buku besar umum."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_735_oydffry
msgid ""
"Verify that interest expense is accurately calculated based on the agreed "
"rate and is properly accrued in the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa beban bunga dihitung akurat berdasarkan tingkat yang disepakati dan diakru dengan benar pada periode yang tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_133_yeareu5
msgid ""
"Verify that inventory is appropriately classified and disclosed in the "
"financial statements, including costing methods and valuation adjustments."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa persediaan diklasifikasikan dan diungkap secara tepat dalam laporan keuangan termasuk metode penentuan biaya dan penyesuaian penilaian."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_399_uavwufh
msgid ""
"Verify that invoice numbers are unique and check for potential duplicates by"
" performing data analysis on vendor payments."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa nomor faktur unik dan periksa potensi duplikasi melalui analisis data atas pembayaran vendor."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_765_3hyn9z1
msgid ""
"Verify that liabilities are recorded in the correct period, especially those"
" recognized near period-end."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa liabilitas dicatat pada periode yang benar khususnya yang diakui dekat akhir periode."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1024_pta0gbl
msgid ""
"Verify that new sources of interest income are included in the income "
"schedule and reconciled with the general ledger."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa sumber pendapatan bunga baru dimasukkan dalam jadwal pendapatan dan direkonsiliasi dengan buku besar umum."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_209_v7rq2et
msgid ""
"Verify that non-trade receivables are classified correctly on the balance "
"sheet, distinguishing between current and non-current assets."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa piutang non‑usaha diklasifikasikan benar di neraca, membedakan antara aset lancar dan tidak lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_292_i1ipxrg
msgid ""
"Verify that only expenditures that meet the capitalization criteria are "
"added to the fixed asset register, while repairs and maintenance are "
"expensed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa hanya pengeluaran yang memenuhi kriteria kapitalisasi ditambahkan ke register aset tetap, sedangkan perbaikan dan pemeliharaan dibebankan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_189_hlon0to
msgid ""
"Verify that other current assets are correctly classified in the balance "
"sheet, ensuring only short-term items expected to be realized within the "
"next 12 months are included."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa aset lancar lain diklasifikasikan benar di neraca, memastikan hanya item jangka pendek yang diharapkan direalisasikan dalam 12 bulan berikutnya yang disertakan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1116_tvsiby8
msgid ""
"Verify that payroll disbursements match the approved payroll register and "
"bank records, ensuring no discrepancies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengeluaran penggajian cocok dengan register penggajian yang disetujui dan catatan bank tanpa selisih."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_691_t1em10z
msgid ""
"Verify that post-employment benefit obligations are classified correctly as "
"current or non-current based on their expected timing of settlement."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa kewajiban imbalan pasca‑kerja diklasifikasikan benar sebagai lancar atau tidak lancar berdasarkan waktu penyelesaian yang diharapkan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_872_78e2iq6
msgid ""
"Verify that potential dilutive effects are disclosed in the financial "
"statements as required, including information on the conversion terms and "
"number of shares involved."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa potensi efek dilutif diungkap dalam laporan keuangan sebagaimana disyaratkan termasuk informasi ketentuan konversi dan jumlah saham terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_171_wl825at
msgid ""
"Verify that prepaid taxes are correctly classified as current or non-current"
" assets, depending on when the benefit is expected to be realized."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pajak dibayar di muka diklasifikasikan benar sebagai aset lancar atau tidak lancar sesuai waktu manfaat yang diharapkan direalisasikan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_100_n2b7p8k
msgid ""
"Verify that realized gains and losses reflect accurate settlement amounts "
"and that unrealized gains and losses align with fair values."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa laba rugi terealisasi mencerminkan jumlah penyelesaian akurat dan laba rugi belum terealisasi selaras dengan nilai wajar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1038_jnkw1ch
msgid ""
"Verify that rental income is accrued accurately for partial periods and is "
"adjusted for any rent concessions or adjustments."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pendapatan sewa diakru akurat untuk periode parsial dan disesuaikan atas setiap konsesi atau penyesuaian sewa."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_953_s288k8u
msgid ""
"Verify that retained earnings adjustments recorded near the reporting date "
"are recognized in the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa penyesuaian laba ditahan yang dicatat dekat tanggal pelaporan diakui pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1040_p30tzyv
msgid ""
"Verify that royalty or usage reports from customers align with amounts "
"recognized as revenue and investigate any discrepancies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa laporan royalti atau penggunaan dari pelanggan selaras dengan jumlah yang diakui sebagai pendapatan dan selidiki setiap selisih."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_821_66qlwzv
msgid ""
"Verify that share issuances recorded close to the reporting date are "
"recorded in the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa penerbitan saham yang dicatat dekat tanggal pelaporan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_791_2g7jtwx
msgid ""
"Verify that share premium or additional paid-in capital is accurately "
"recorded in the equity section, particularly for shares issued above par "
"value."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa agio saham atau APIC dicatat akurat di bagian ekuitas terutama untuk saham yang diterbitkan di atas nilai nominal."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_908_c2dd9rh
msgid ""
"Verify that significant OCI events occurring after the reporting date are "
"disclosed appropriately if they provide insight into conditions at the "
"reporting date."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa peristiwa OCI signifikan setelah tanggal pelaporan diungkap secara tepat bila memberikan wawasan atas kondisi pada tanggal pelaporan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_86_kdjmft2
msgid ""
"Verify that significant terms, risks, and fair value hierarchy levels are "
"adequately disclosed."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa ketentuan signifikan, risiko, dan tingkat hierarki nilai wajar diungkap memadai."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_584_rbdmnmm
msgid ""
"Verify that significant transactions are supported by appropriate "
"documentation and that the amounts recorded align with contract terms."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa transaksi signifikan didukung dokumentasi yang sesuai dan jumlah yang dicatat selaras dengan ketentuan kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_746_suogwet
msgid ""
"Verify that subordinated loans are classified accurately between current and"
" non-current liabilities based on repayment terms."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pinjaman subordinasi diklasifikasikan akurat antara liabilitas lancar dan tidak lancar berdasarkan ketentuan pelunasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_736_9qf0qmt
msgid ""
"Verify that subordinated loans are classified appropriately in the balance "
"sheet and disclosed as subordinated to other liabilities."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pinjaman subordinasi diklasifikasikan tepat di neraca dan diungkap sebagai subordinasi terhadap liabilitas lain."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_756_0ktrnkc
msgid ""
"Verify that subsequent events are evaluated for potential adjustments to the"
" loan balance or additional disclosures."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa peristiwa subsekuen dievaluasi untuk potensi penyesuaian saldo pinjaman atau pengungkapan tambahan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_626_vcw6cfm
msgid ""
"Verify that subsequent payments align with recorded lease liabilities and "
"investigate any discrepancies or omitted liabilities."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pembayaran setelah tanggal pelaporan selaras dengan liabilitas sewa yang dicatat dan selidiki setiap selisih atau liabilitas yang terlewat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_566_tcxrbq1
msgid ""
"Verify that subsequent payments align with recorded liabilities and "
"investigate any variances."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pembayaran setelah tanggal pelaporan selaras dengan liabilitas yang dicatat dan selidiki setiap perbedaan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1094_0f2jy1b
msgid ""
"Verify that such adjustments are supported by appropriate valuation or "
"impairment analysis and comply with relevant accounting standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa penyesuaian tersebut didukung analisis penilaian atau penurunan nilai yang sesuai dan mematuhi standar akuntansi relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_511_khjrr73
msgid ""
"Verify that taxes payable reflect the amounts due based on the actual tax "
"filings and applicable rates."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa utang pajak mencerminkan jumlah terutang berdasarkan SPT aktual dan tarif yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_539_11xx5at
msgid ""
"Verify that terms, conditions, and any contingencies affecting liability "
"values are documented and appropriately recorded."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa ketentuan, kondisi, dan setiap kontinjensi yang mempengaruhi nilai liabilitas didokumentasikan dan dicatat secara tepat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_879_ape899y
msgid ""
"Verify that the NCI portion is correctly classified within the equity "
"section of the consolidated balance sheet and not included in liabilities."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa porsi NCI diklasifikasikan benar dalam bagian ekuitas neraca konsolidasian dan tidak dimasukkan dalam liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_413_kc4phm9
msgid ""
"Verify that the amounts accrued align with the terms of the contracts or "
"other agreements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa jumlah terakru selaras dengan ketentuan kontrak atau perjanjian lainnya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_816_5ssx8ld
msgid ""
"Verify that the calculated APIC matches the amounts recorded in the APIC "
"account."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa APIC yang dihitung cocok dengan jumlah yang dicatat pada akun APIC."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1062_tsv087i
msgid ""
"Verify that the calculation is accurate, ensuring the recorded amount "
"correctly reflects the entity’s proportionate share."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan akurat memastikan jumlah yang dicatat mencerminkan bagian proporsional entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_856_l5u8ypt
msgid ""
"Verify that the calculation is based on fair value or another acceptable "
"method to allocate proceeds between liability and equity."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa perhitungan didasarkan pada nilai wajar atau metode lain yang dapat diterima untuk mengalokasikan hasil antara liabilitas dan ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_843_ihc1ecn
msgid ""
"Verify that the company’s repurchase of shares complies with legal and "
"regulatory requirements, including limits on repurchase volumes and "
"shareholder approvals."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pembelian kembali saham perusahaan mematuhi persyaratan hukum dan regulasi termasuk batas volume buyback dan persetujuan pemegang saham."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1078_i6bqkom
msgid ""
"Verify that the costs are recorded in the correct period and classified "
"correctly as direct costs associated with revenue generation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa biaya dicatat pada periode yang benar dan diklasifikasikan tepat sebagai biaya langsung terkait perolehan pendapatan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_867_gt27uhx
msgid ""
"Verify that the disclosures in the financial statements provide clear "
"information on the nature and terms of the convertible bonds, conversion "
"options, and the method used for equity component calculation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa pengungkapan dalam laporan keuangan memberikan informasi jelas tentang sifat dan ketentuan obligasi konversi, opsi konversi, dan metode yang digunakan untuk perhitungan komponen ekuitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_859_v4sold3
msgid ""
"Verify that the equity component is classified within the equity section of "
"the balance sheet as a distinct item, not as part of liabilities."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa komponen ekuitas diklasifikasikan dalam bagian ekuitas neraca sebagai pos tersendiri, bukan bagian liabilitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_231_vjrw057
msgid ""
"Verify that the investment in associate is appropriately classified on the "
"balance sheet and presented as a non-current asset."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa investasi pada entitas asosiasi diklasifikasikan tepat di neraca dan disajikan sebagai aset tidak lancar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_255_ng9v80k
msgid ""
"Verify that the investment in the joint venture is appropriately classified "
"as a non-current asset and accurately presented on the balance sheet."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa investasi pada ventura bersama diklasifikasikan tepat sebagai aset tidak lancar dan disajikan akurat di neraca."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_614_b8ase3a
msgid ""
"Verify that the present value is accurately recorded as the lease liability "
"at the inception of the lease and subsequently adjusted as necessary."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa nilai kini dicatat akurat sebagai liabilitas sewa pada awal sewa dan disesuaikan selanjutnya bila diperlukan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_44_eqdjigt
msgid ""
"Verify that the recorded contract asset represents work completed and not "
"yet billed, based on contract terms."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa aset kontrak yang dicatat mewakili pekerjaan selesai namun belum ditagih sesuai ketentuan kontrak."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_453_boczf7z
msgid ""
"Verify that the recorded liability reflects the terms of the agreement, "
"including accrued interest and any fees."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa liabilitas yang dicatat mencerminkan ketentuan perjanjian termasuk bunga terakru dan setiap biaya."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_942_cjqfl6n
msgid ""
"Verify that the schedule includes current and prior period adjustments, if "
"applicable, and aligns with the balance presented in the financial "
"statements."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa jadwal mencakup penyesuaian periode berjalan dan sebelumnya bila berlaku dan selaras dengan saldo yang disajikan dalam laporan keuangan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_572_ptzr4h1
msgid ""
"Verify that the terms and amounts recorded are consistent with the "
"underlying documentation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa ketentuan dan jumlah yang dicatat konsisten dengan dokumentasi dasar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_731_rwsrxj2
msgid ""
"Verify that the terms of each loan are accurately reflected in the "
"accounting records."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa ketentuan tiap pinjaman tercermin akurat dalam catatan akuntansi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_634_tlt1ia7
msgid ""
"Verify that the terms recorded in the general ledger match those in the loan"
" agreements and that borrowings are classified in accordance with repayment "
"schedules."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa ketentuan yang dicatat di buku besar umum cocok dengan perjanjian pinjaman dan pinjaman diklasifikasikan sesuai jadwal pelunasan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_794_bxpdp4n
msgid ""
"Verify that the total issued share capital does not exceed the authorized "
"share capital as specified in the articles of incorporation or relevant "
"governing documents."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa total modal saham diterbitkan tidak melebihi modal saham disetujui sebagaimana tercantum dalam anggaran dasar atau dokumen pengatur terkait."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1128_o4qoei2
msgid ""
"Verify that the transactions are appropriately recorded in the G&A category "
"and within the correct period."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa transaksi dicatat secara tepat dalam kategori G&A dan pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1102_mwju7k0
msgid ""
"Verify that the transactions are recorded in the correct period and "
"classified accurately as salaries, wages, or benefits."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa transaksi dicatat pada periode yang benar dan diklasifikasikan akurat sebagai gaji, upah, atau manfaat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1064_398a627
msgid ""
"Verify that these adjustments are properly calculated, eliminate unrealized "
"gains or losses from intercompany transactions, and comply with applicable "
"standards."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa penyesuaian tersebut dihitung dengan benar, mengeliminasi laba atau rugi belum terealisasi dari transaksi antar perusahaan, dan mematuhi standar yang berlaku."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1114_95qa9nx
msgid ""
"Verify that these costs are appropriately classified and disclosed if "
"material, and that they align with HR policies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa biaya tersebut diklasifikasikan dan diungkap secara tepat bila material dan selaras dengan kebijakan SDM."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_1090_nlb4gmg
msgid ""
"Verify that these costs are appropriately classified and disclosed, ensuring"
" they do not distort the underlying profitability of core operations."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa biaya tersebut diklasifikasikan dan diungkap secara tepat memastikan tidak mendistorsi profitabilitas dasar operasi inti."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_842_feooa85
msgid ""
"Verify that transactions recorded close to year-end are included in the "
"correct period and that the correct number of shares and costs are recorded."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa transaksi yang dicatat dekat akhir tahun dimasukkan pada periode yang benar dan jumlah saham serta biaya yang benar dicatat."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_78_je2x2zt
msgid ""
"Verify that unrealized gains or losses are appropriately classified based on"
" the entity’s accounting policies."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa laba atau rugi belum terealisasi diklasifikasikan secara tepat berdasarkan kebijakan akuntansi entitas."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_333_jnp70qp
msgid ""
"Verify that useful lives are re-assessed periodically and that changes are "
"supported by relevant documentation."
msgstr "Verifikasi bahwa umur manfaat dievaluasi ulang secara berkala dan perubahan didukung dokumentasi relevan."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_379_29tky2y
msgid "Verify the Classification of Liabilities"
msgstr "Verifikasi Klasifikasi Liabilitas"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_469_dc874f5
msgid "Verify the Cutoff for Retained Earnings Transactions"
msgstr "Verifikasi Cutoff Transaksi Laba Ditahan"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_916_5txa18o
msgid ""
"Verify the accuracy of reclassified amounts and ensure they are supported by"
" transaction documents."
msgstr "Verifikasi akurasi jumlah yang direklasifikasi dan pastikan didukung dokumen transaksi."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_4_33a5rp3
msgid ""
"Verify the accuracy of reconciling items, such as outstanding checks and "
"deposits in transit, and ensure that they are recorded in the appropriate "
"period."
msgstr "Verifikasi akurasi item rekonsiliasi (cek beredar, setoran dalam perjalanan) dan pastikan dicatat pada periode yang benar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_213_4kusbda
msgid ""
"Verify the initial investment amount by inspecting supporting documentation,"
" such as purchase agreements or contracts."
msgstr "Verifikasi jumlah investasi awal dengan meninjau dokumen pendukung (perjanjian pembelian atau kontrak)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_797_gu3wrg3
msgid ""
"Verify the number and cost of treasury shares and confirm proper "
"authorization and compliance with legal requirements for any share buyback "
"transactions."
msgstr "Verifikasi jumlah dan biaya saham treasuri serta konfirmasi otorisasi dan kepatuhan persyaratan hukum atas transaksi buyback."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_552_601v0zr
msgid ""
"Verify the terms of each liability to ensure that amounts recorded are "
"consistent with the underlying documentation."
msgstr "Verifikasi ketentuan tiap liabilitas untuk memastikan jumlah yang dicatat konsisten dengan dokumentasi dasar."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_10_s8xx5rn
msgid ""
"Verify valuation of cash equivalents by recalculating fair values, "
"considering the type of cash equivalents (e.g., treasury bills, short-term "
"investments)."
msgstr "Verifikasi penilaian setara kas dengan menghitung ulang nilai wajar sesuai jenisnya (mis. treasury bills, investasi jangka pendek)."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_ws_b26d482_viewer_group
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_ws_e51bb1c_viewer_group
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_ws_f9f3299_viewer_group
msgid "Viewer"
msgstr "Pemirsa"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure_category,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_category_22_1lfm515
msgid "Vouching of Contract Asset Balances"
msgstr "Vouching saldo aset kontrak"

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_audit_procedure,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.general_audit_audit_procedure_481_deil74a
msgid ""
"Where relevant, consider obtaining an expert opinion or comparing "
"assumptions to external data to assess reasonableness."
msgstr "Jika relevan, pertimbangkan meminta opini ahli atau membandingkan asumsi dengan data eksternal untuk menilai kewajaran."

#. module: ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule
#: model:general_audit_worksheet_type,name:ssi_general_audit_worksheet_lead_schedule.worksheet_type_b26d482
